<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ISA" style="id">- Gamo Full Bible final version</book>
  <para style="h">Isayaasa Tinbite</para>
  <para style="toc1">Isayaasa Tinbite</para>
  <para style="toc2">Isayaasa Tinbite</para>
  <para style="toc3">Isa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Isayaasa Tinbite</para>
  <para style="imt1">Giddo Qofa</para>
  <para style="ip">Isayaasa Maxaafay Kirstoosi yelettanaappe kase osppunththa xeetu layththa wurseththa heeran diza gita nabe Isayaasa sunththan xeygettides; hayssi ha maxaafazi heedzdzu erettida kifiletan shaakettanaas dandayees.</para>
  <para style="ili">1. Shem 1-39 gakkanaas diza kifilezi dugeha bagga kawoteth Yuhuda dere bolla Asoore geetettiza wolqqama kawoy gaththida qoho gishshas yootees; Yuhuda dere meton yeggiday Asoore wolqqa gidontta dereza nagaranne asay Xoossas azazettontta ixo; hessaththoka asay Xoossan ammanettontta aggidayssa be7ides. Nabezi derezinne deraa kaaleththizayti xilloteththaakonne tumateththi dizaso simmana mala yootides; qasseka Xoossas azazettontta ixoy pacenne dhays ehanayssa isttas qonccisides; hessaththoka buroppe yaana layththatan alame yuushon saroteththi kumanayssanne kumeththa lo7eteththan ayssanaas Dawite zereththafe kawotanaadey yaanayssa nabe Isayaasi kaseti yootides.</para>
  <para style="ili">2. Shem 40-55 gakkanaas diza kifilezappe dariza baggay Yuhuda asay di7etti Baabiloone biin heen istta bolla kawushshateththi gakkanayssanne hidotay isttas dhayanayssa yootees. Nabezi Xoossi ba dereza wozziin asay lo7o ooraththa duus daanaas istta izi Yerusalaame zaaranaas wodey matidayssa yootides. Hayta shemppota garsan keehi qoncci beettiza ayfe yo7oy Xoossi hano ubbaas aawa gididayssanne ba deraas izi halchchida halchchoy, Xoossa kiitay Isra7eele asaa baggara dere ubbaas gakkanayssa yootees. «Xoossa oosanchcha gishshas» yootiza kase gal7a caaqon diza erettida kiitatara issife qoodeteettes.</para>
  <para style="ili">3. Shem 56-66 gakkanaas diza kifilezappe dariza baggay yootizay guye ba dere Yerusalaame simmi bidayta gishshassinne Xoossi Isra7eele asaas immida hidota qaala ubbaa polanaakko giidi naage bolla diza asaas markka gidana malassa; tishshi histti xeellanaas bessizayti xilloteththinne tuma pirda, sambata bonchchonne yarsho shiisho, qasseka minni woosso. Hayssa ha kifilezan erettida shemppoy 61:1-2 gidishin Yesusi koyro ooso oykkishe ba xeygeteththaas markka shiishshida qaalati deettes.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ha Maxaafay Oykkida Kumeththa Qofa</para>
  <para style="io1">Giddo qofa <char style="ior"><ref loc="ISA 1:1-31">1:1-31</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yuhuda gishshassinne Isra7eele gishshas aadhdhida kiitata <char style="ior"><ref loc="ISA 2:1-5:30">2:1—5:30</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Isayaasa haggazon diza hanotata <char style="ior"><ref loc="ISA 6:1-9:7">6:1—9:7</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yuhuda gishshassinne Isra7eele gishshas gujettida hara kiitata <char style="ior"><ref loc="ISA 9:8-12:6">9:8—12:6</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Hara dereta bolla Xoossa qixaate <char style="ior"><ref loc="ISA 13:1-23:18">13:1—23:18</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Waaye bolla diza Xoossa deres hidota kiita <char style="ior"><ref loc="ISA 24:1-27:13">24:1—27:13</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xoossi makkalliza ba deraa qaxxayana qaxxayo <char style="ior"><ref loc="ISA 28:1-31:9">28:1—31:9</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xoossi Eedoome qaxxayizaadenne Yerusalaame anjjizaade <char style="ior"><ref loc="ISA 32:1-35:10">32:1—35:10</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Asoore, Baabiloone, kawo Hizqiyaasanne Isayaasa <char style="ior"><ref loc="ISA 36:1-39:8">36:1—39:8</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xoossay ba dere ashshizaade <char style="ior"><ref loc="ISA 40:1-48:22">40:1—48:22</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xoossa oosanchcha <char style="ior"><ref loc="ISA 49:1-53:12">49:1—53:12</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xoossay ba immida hidota naagizaade <char style="ior"><ref loc="ISA 54:1-55:13">54:1—55:13</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Derey wurikka Xoossa bagga gidanaas dandayees <char style="ior"><ref loc="ISA 56:1-8">56:1-8</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Dere ayssizayta gidi uttidi Xoossas azazettonttayti qaxxayettana <char style="ior"><ref loc="ISA 56:9-59:21">56:9—59:21</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Sinththafe yaanaas diza Yerusalaame bonchcho hidota <char style="ior"><ref loc="ISA 60:1-62:12">60:1—62:12</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Malalisiza Xoossa ooraththa medheteththata <char style="ior"><ref loc="ISA 63:1-66:24">63:1—66:24</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ISA 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 1:1" />Yuhuda kawota Ooziya, Iyo7aatame, Akaazenne Hizqiyaasa kawoteththa wode Amoxe naa Isayaasi Yuhuda gishshassinne Yerusalaame gishshas be7ida ajjuuta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 15:1-7">2Kawo 15:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 15:32-16:20">15:32—16:20</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 18:1-20:21">18:1—20:21</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 26:1-32:33">2Taari 26:1—32:33</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossay Ba Dereza Seerida Seera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 1:2" />GODAY, «Salotoo siyite!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:2">biittayee nekka ezga siya!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:2">Tani nayta yelada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:2">dichcha gaththiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:2">istti ta bolla makkallida.<verse eid="ISA 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 1:3" />Booray ba godaa erees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:3">harey iza goday izas giigsida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:3">zedhekka erees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:3">Isra7eeley gidikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:3">tana erenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:3">ta dereykka akeekenna» gides.<verse eid="ISA 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 1:4" />Intteno nagaranchcha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:4">kawoteththatoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:4">Qohon kumidaytoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:4">Iita ooththiza zereththatoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:4">Intte aawata tunateththaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:4">kaalliza naytoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:4">Inttena aayye ana!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:4">GODAA aggaagideta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:4">Isra7eele geeshshaza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:4">yeggi aggideta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:4">zokkoka izas zaarideta.<verse eid="ISA 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 1:5" />Makkalla bolla makkalla gujjidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:5">intte ays zaari zaari</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:5">qaxxayetteetii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:5">Intte hu7ey mule sakettides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:5">intte wozinaykka daaburdes.<verse eid="ISA 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 1:6" />Hessa gaason hirki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:6">toho xugunththafe biidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:6">hu7e iske gakkanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:6">paxateththi inttes baawa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:6">Madunth, kixanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:6">uzas xalla gidides.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:6">He madunththay meecettibeenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:6">qashettibeenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:6">zaytenkka shuggibeenna.<verse eid="ISA 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 1:7" />Intte derey aykkoy baynda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:7">bazzo gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:7">intte katamati taman xuugettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:7">intte ayfey xeellishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:7">intte biitta allagay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:7">bonqqi ekkana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:7">istti intte biitta bula kessana.<verse eid="ISA 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 1:8" />Xiyoone naya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:8">woyne miththa giddon diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:8">gaabba mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:8">lelehe giddon diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:8">qeeri keeththa malanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:8">morkkey giddoththida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:8">katama mala gidadus.<verse eid="ISA 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 1:9" />Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAY</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:9">nuus zereth ashshonttaakko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:9">nuni Sodoome malanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:9">Gamoora mala gidanakkoshin.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24">Medhe 19:24</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 9:29">Oro 9:29</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 1:10" />Intteno Sodoome ayssizaytoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:10">GODAA qaala siyite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:10">intteno Gamoora deretoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:10">Nu Xoossa timirte ezgi siyite.<verse eid="ISA 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 1:11" />«Intte yarsho daroy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:11">taas ay ooththanee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:11">Hanno gakkanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:11">intte taas shiishshida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:11">xuugetti shiiqiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:11">dharsho ashonne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:11">modhdho meheta asho kalladis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:11">tani boora suuththan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:11">dorsa suuththaninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:11">deysha suuththan ufayettike.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11-14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 5:21-22">Amo 5:21-22</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 1:12" />Intte taas goynnanaas yiza wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:12">hessa ubbaa intte</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:12">ekki yaana malanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:12">ta Keeththa zago</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:12">intte yedhdhana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:12">ooni oychchidee?<verse eid="ISA 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 1:13" />Hayssafe guye hayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:13">misatiza hada yarsho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:13">nam7anththo shiishshofte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:13">intte cuwasiza exaaney</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:13">tana shaattees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:13">agina xeeron,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:13">sambata gallassataninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:13">intte goynos shiiqiza gallassatan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:13">intte bonchchiza ba7aaleti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:13">iitateththan kumida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:13">tani heyta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:13">gencca aadhdhanaas dandaykke.<verse eid="ISA 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 1:14" />Agina xeeron</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:14">intte bonchchiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:14">gallassatanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:14">kase intte woththida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:14">ba7aale gallassata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:14">ta shemppoya harasettadus;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:14">heyti taas daro deexo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:14">tooho gidida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:14">ta istta tookkanaas dandaykke.<verse eid="ISA 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 1:15" />Intte intte kushe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:15">woosas taakko micciko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:15">tani ta ayfe inttefe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:15">haraso zaarana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:15">intte kushen suuththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:15">kumida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:15">intte keehi woossikokka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:15">ta intte woosa siyikke.<verse eid="ISA 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 1:16" />Meecettite; inttena geeshshite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:16">intte iita oosoza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:16">ta sinththafe diggite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:16">iita oosokka aggite.<verse eid="ISA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 1:17" />Lo7o ooso tamaarte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:17">suure pirda koyite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:17">qohettidayta minththeththite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:17">yi7otas eqqite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:17">am7etas mootettite» gides.<verse eid="ISA 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 1:18" />Qasseka GODAY, «Haa yiite</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:18">issoy issaara ane buuxettoos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:18">intte nagaray</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:18">xeeqa zo7o gidikkoka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:18">shachcha mala boottana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:18">suuththa mala zo7ikkoka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:18">puutto mala puqqa booth gidana.<verse eid="ISA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 1:19" />Intte taas eeno gi azazettiko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:19">biitta anjjo maana.<verse eid="ISA 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 1:20" />Intte taas akkay gi makkalliko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:20">mashshay inttena maana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:20">hayssa yootiday</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:20">tana GODAA» gides.<verse eid="ISA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nagaray Kumida Katamayo</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 1:21" />Kase ammanettida katamaya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:21">waanada layma gidadee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:21">Kase izin suure pirday</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:21">kumidaaranne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:21">xilloteththi izin kumidaara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:21">ha7i gidikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:21">shemppo wodhizaytas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:21">duussaso gidadus.<verse eid="ISA 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 1:22" />Hanne ne biray shiydes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:22">ne woyne ushshay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:22">haaththan yeellettides.<verse eid="ISA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 1:23" />Nena kaaleththizayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:23">makkallanchchataranne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:23">kaysotara laggetida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:23">istti ubbayka maganxo doseettes.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:23">Matta7ekka keehi koyeettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:23">yi7otas aadhdhi eqqettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:23">am7eta magana siyettenna.<verse eid="ISA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 1:24" />Hessa gishshas GODAY,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:24">Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAA</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:24">Isra7eele Xoossay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:24">«Tani ta morkketa bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:24">ta hanqo gussana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:24">tana komizayta bollaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:24">tani halo kessana.<verse eid="ISA 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 1:25" />Tani ta kushe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:25">ne bolla denththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:25">ne bolla diza kinththaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:25">ta geeshshana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:25">ne qitaakka ne bollafe diggana.<verse eid="ISA 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 1:26" />Kase nena ayssizayta mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:26">hara nena ayssanaytanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:26">zoranayta tani nees denththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:26">hessafe guye neni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:26">‹Xilloteththi diza ammanettida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:26">katamayo› geetettana.<verse eid="ISA 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 1:27" />Xiyoona suure pirdan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:27">maaroteththan simmizayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:27">xilloteththan wozzettana.<verse eid="ISA 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 1:28" />Gido attiin makkallanchchatinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:28">nagaranchchati issi bolla liiqana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:28">Xoossa aggizayti wurikka dhayana.<verse eid="ISA 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 1:29" />Kase intte dosiza kaashshatan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:29">intte yeellatana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:29">kase intte doorida atakiltesohotan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:29">intte kawuyana.<verse eid="ISA 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 1:30" />Wurseththan intte bonccoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:30">qokkida wola mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:30">haaththi baynda atakiltesohota</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:30">mala gidana.<verse eid="ISA 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 1:31" />Mino asi happa mala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:31">iza oosoykka pil7i giza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:31">laco mala gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:31">nam7ayka issi bolla xuugettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:31">he tamaa toyssana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:31">asikka deenna» gides.<verse eid="ISA 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ISA 2" />
  <para style="s1">Mernaa Saro</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MIC 4:1-3">Miki 4:1-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 2:1" />Amoxe naa Isayaasi Yuhuda dere gishshassinne Yerusalaame katama gishshas be7ida ajjuutay hayssa.<verse eid="ISA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 2:2" />Wode wurseththan Xoossa keeththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:2">iza bolla keexettida zumay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:2">hara zuma ubbaafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:2">dhoqqi beettana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:2">Zumbullata ubbaafe dhoqqu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:2">dhoqqu gaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:2">ubbaa kawoteththati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:2">hee goochchana.<verse eid="ISA 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 2:3" />Daro asay yiidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:3">«Wogay Xiyooneppe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:3">GODAA qaalay Yerusalaameppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:3">keziza gishshas haa yiite!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:3">GODAA zumaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:3">Yaaqoobe Xoossaa Keeth</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:3">ane pude kezoos.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:3">Izi koyzayssaththo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:3">nuni baana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:3">izi nuna ba oge tamaarsana» gaana.<verse eid="ISA 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 2:4" />Izi kawoteththata giddon pirdana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:4">daro asata garsan diza palama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:4">izi diggana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:4">Istti bantta giththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:4">mashsha maarasha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:4">bantta toorakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:4">baaca qoxxi kessana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:4">Derey dere bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:4">mashsha denththenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:4">hessafe guye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:4">istti ola tamaarettenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 3:10">Iyu 3:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 2:5" />Intteno Yaaqoobe zaretoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:5">Haa yiite!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:5">Ane GODAA poo7on simerettoos.<verse eid="ISA 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Godaa Gallas</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 2:6" />GODAWU! Neni ne asaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:6">Yaaqoobe zareta aggadasa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:6">Istti arshey mokkiza baggara diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:6">asata mala bitan kumida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:6">Filisxeeme asaa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:6">muurenneettes.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:6">Istti allagara issife zuppeteettes.<verse eid="ISA 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 2:7" />Istta biittan biraynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:7">worqqay kumides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:7">istta dureteththas zaway baawa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:7">istta biittan paray kumides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:7">istta para-gaaretas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:7">zaway deenna.<verse eid="ISA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 2:8" />Istta biittan eeqa xoossati kumida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:8">bantta kushen ooththi kessida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:8">miishshas goynneettes.<verse eid="ISA 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 2:9" />Hessa gishshas asi ubbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:9">ziqqi gaananne kawuyana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:9">Istta qoho atto gooppa.<verse eid="ISA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 2:10" />Yashissiza GODAA hanqofenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:10">iza teemappe attanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:10">zaallatakko biidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:10">biitta giddon qotettite!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 3:10">Ajju 3:10</ref></char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 6:15">Ajju 6:15</ref>; <ref loc="2TH 1:9">2Taso 1:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 2:11" />Otoranchcha ayfey gukkana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:11">moodhettizayti kawuyana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:11">he wode GODAY xalla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:11">dhoqqu dhoqqu gaana.<verse eid="ISA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 2:12" />Ubbaafe wolqqama GODAY</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:12">Otoranchchata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:12">moodhettizaytanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:12">ceeqettizayta kawushshanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:12">gallas bari woththides.<verse eid="ISA 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 2:13" />Adussinne dhoqqa gidida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:13">Libaanoose zigatanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:13">Baasaane wolata ubbaa,<verse eid="ISA 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 2:14" />Gita zumatanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:14">dhoqqa zumbullata ubbaa,<verse eid="ISA 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 2:15" />katama naagiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:15">adussa miixatanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:15">katamaa yuushon diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:15">mino gimbeta ubbaa,<verse eid="ISA 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 2:16" />Tarseese markabetanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:16">bonchcho wogolota ubbaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:16">izi kawushshana wodey dees.<verse eid="ISA 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 2:17" />Moodhettizaadey kawuyana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:17">otoranchchay kundana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:17">he gallas GODAY xalla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:17">dhoqqu dhoqqu gaana;<verse eid="ISA 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 2:18" />Eeqa xoossati ubbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:18">mulera dhayana.<verse eid="ISA 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 2:19" />GODAY hayssa biittaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:19">qaaththanaas dendiza wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:19">Yashissiza GODAA hanqofenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:19">iza teemappe attanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:19">asay qotettanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:19">shuchcha garsinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:19">ollay dizaso baqatana.<verse eid="ISA 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 2:20" />He gallas asay goynnanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:20">medhdhida bantta bira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:20">worqqa misleta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:20">girossinne kafotas olana.<verse eid="ISA 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 2:21" />GODAY ha biittaa qaaththanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:21">dendiza wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:21">iza yashiseththaafenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:21">iza teemaappe dendidayssan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:21">shuchcha gongoloynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:21">zaalla za7ay dizaso baqatana.<verse eid="ISA 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 2:22" />Shemppoy siidhera keziin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:22">aha gidiza asan ammanettofte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:22">asi ay maaddanee?<verse eid="ISA 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ISA 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yerusalaame Bollanne Yuhuda Bolla Yaana Pirda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 3:1" />Be7ite, GODAY Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAY</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:1">asas koshshiza kath,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:1">haaththinne maado ubbaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:1">Yerusalaameppenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:1">Yuhudappe diggana.<verse eid="ISA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 3:2" />Qaratanne olanchchata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:2">pirdizaytanne nabeta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:2">muurennizaytanne cimata,<verse eid="ISA 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 3:3" />hamsa halaqatanne ola gadawata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:3">zoranchchatanne hiillanchchata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:3">cinccateththan bitizayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:3">ubbaa dhayssana.<verse eid="ISA 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 3:4" />Tani yelaga nayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:4">istta bolla shuumana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:4">qeeri nayti istta haarana.<verse eid="ISA 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 3:5" />Derey dere bolla,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:5">asi issoy issaa bolla,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:5">shooroy shooro bolla,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:5">yelaga nayti cimata bolla,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:5">shufuroy bonchchettidayta bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:5">dendana.<verse eid="ISA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 3:6" />Asi ba aawa keeththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:6">ba ishanttafe oykkidi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:6">«Nees may7oy diza gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:6">nuna kaaleththizayssa gida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:6">ha laalettida sohoza aawateth</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:6">ne ekka» gaana.<verse eid="ISA 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 3:7" />Histtiin izi he wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:7">ba qaala dhoqqu histtidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:7">«Tani aykkoka maaddike;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:7">tason may7oynne miza kaththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:7">baynda gishshas tana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:7">dere kaaleththizaade</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:7">histtofte» gaana.<verse eid="ISA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 3:8" />Yerusalaamey gandigarawus;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:8">Yuhudaykka kundana matadus;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:8">gaasoykka istti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:8">bantta haasayaninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:8">ooson GODAARA eqettishe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:8">iza bonchchoza toochcheettes.<verse eid="ISA 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 3:9" />Istta ayfesoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:9">istta bolla markkattees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:9">istti Sodoome asaa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:9">bantta nagaraa qottontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:9">qonccen haasayeettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:9">istti bantta bolla iita miish</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:9">ehiza gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:9">isttas aayye ana!<verse eid="ISA 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 3:10" />Xillotas, «Xilloti ba lo7o ooso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:10">ayfe maana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:10">hessa gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:10">isttas lo7o gidana» ga yoota.<verse eid="ISA 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 3:11" />Iitatas aayye ana!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:11">Istta bolla iita miishshi yaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:11">ays giikko istti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:11">bantta ooso mala ekkana.<verse eid="ISA 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 3:12" />Yelagati ta deraa un7eththeettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:12">maccassatikka istta haareettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:12">Ta derezoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:12">Inttena kaaleththizayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:12">inttena baleththida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:12">intte biza ogeppeka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:12">inttena kare kessida.<verse eid="ISA 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Goday Ba Asaa Bolla Pirdana Pirda</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 3:13" />GODAY pirdanaas shilotan uttides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:13">deraa bolla pirdanaas dendides.<verse eid="ISA 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 3:14" />GODAY dere cimatanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:14">kaaleththizayta pirdanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:14">issi bolla shiishshidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:14">«Tani woyne tokkizasohoza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:14">iissideta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:14">manqotappe intte bonqqidayssi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:14">intte qol7an dees.<verse eid="ISA 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 3:15" />Ta deraa ays meton liiqisidetii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:15">Manqota ays yeesseetii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:15">Hayssa yootiday tana Goda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:15">Ubbaafe Wolqqama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:15">GODAA Xoossaa» gees.<verse eid="ISA 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xiyoone Maccassatas Imettida Seera</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 3:16" />GODAY, «Xiyoone maccassati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:16">otorettida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:16">bantta qoodhe warxi histtishe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:16">bantta ayfen som7i bessishe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:16">bantta duca qaaththishe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:16">bantta tohon diza sagayo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:16">giirissishe hemetteettes.<verse eid="ISA 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 3:17" />Hessa gishshas tani GODAY</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:17">Xiyoone maccassata hu7e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:17">citton goo7issana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:17">tani GODAY istta hu7e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:17">bo7asana» gees.<verse eid="ISA 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 3:18" />He gallas GODAY Xiyoone maccassata alleqo miishshata, heytikka toho sagayota, hu7e alleqota, qoodhe gozdata, <verse eid="ISA 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 3:19" />hayththa gutichchata, kushe sagayota, ayfeso kammiza quraaceta, <verse eid="ISA 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 3:20" />hu7e goosseta, sagayota, hu7e alleqota, xeessan dancciza danccota, shitto bilqaaxeta, ashenkitaabeta, <verse eid="ISA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 3:21" />siidhe midigata, biradhdhe midigata, <verse eid="ISA 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 3:22" />seelo may7ota, garsara may7iza may7ota, kaabbata, kushe karaxiiteta, <verse eid="ISA 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 3:23" />Heregata, laynota, giddora may7iza may7ota, binana qachchiza alleqotanne ayfeso kammiza qolleta ubbaa dafi ekkana.<verse eid="ISA 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 3:24" />Shitto xinqqon, dancco wodoron,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:24">goofare bo7an,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:24">seelo may7o maaqan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:24">puulateth pigen laammana.<verse eid="ISA 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 3:25" />Inttes attuma asati giththa mashshan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:25">olanchchati olan hayqqana.<verse eid="ISA 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 3:26" />Xiyoone pengeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:26">kallo gaden wodhdha uttada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:26">yeekkiza maccassa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:26">yeekkananne zilalana.<verse eid="ISA 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ISA 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 4:1" />He wode laappun maccassati issi adde oykkidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 4:1">«Maana kath gidiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 4:1">may7ana may7o</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 4:1">nuni nurkka nuna dandayana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 4:1">ne sunththan xalla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 4:1">xeygettana mala histtada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 4:1">nu kawushshateththaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 4:1">nuuppe diggarkkii!» gi woossana.<verse eid="ISA 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yerusalaame Ooraththateth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 4:2" />He wode GODAA miththa haggay lo7ananne bonchchettana; Isra7eele asaappe dhayshe attidaytas he biitta kaththay ceeqossinne bonchchos gidana. <verse eid="ISA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 4:3" />Xiyoonen attidayti, Yerusalaamen dhayontta attidayti, Yerusalaamen shemppora paxa dishe xaafettida ubbatara, «Istti geeshshata» geetettana. <verse eid="ISA 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 4:4" />GODAY Xiyoone maccassata qitaa meeccana; maadhetti uttida suuththaafe Yerusalaame pirda ayananinne xuuggiza ayanan geeshshana. <verse eid="ISA 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 4:5" />GODAY Xiyoone zuma bollanne heen shiiqiza ubbata bolla gallas shaaranne cuwa, omars eexxiza tama poo7o kiittana; Xoossa bonchchoy katamayo dunkaane mala kammi naagana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:21">Kessa 13:21</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 24:16">24:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ISA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 4:6" />Izi gallassa awa suuleppe ashshiza kuwa, uushoppenne irappe baqati attizasoho gidana.<verse eid="ISA 4:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ISA 5" />
  <para style="s1">Woyne Tokkiza Gade Gishshas Yootettida Ginxo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 5:1" />Tani ta siiqo laggeza gishshassinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:1">iza woyne turaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:1">tokkizasoho gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:1">siiqo mazamure yexxana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:1">Tani siiqiza laggezas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:1">aradda zumbullan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:1">woyne turaa tokkizasohoy dees.<verse eid="ISA 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 5:2" />Biitta bookkidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:2">shuchchaa qori kessidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:2">ubbaafe lo7iza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:2">woyne turaa tokkides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:2">histtidi iza naaganaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:2">shakko giigsides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:2">woyne ushshu gum7izasoho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:2">olla bookki giigsides.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:2">Hessafe guye lo7o ayfe ayfana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:2">giidi naagides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:2">gido attiin caala phanqida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:2">ayfe ayfides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:1-2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:33">Mato 21:33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1">Mar 12:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 5:3" />Histtiin ta siiqoy,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:3">«Intteno Yerusalaamen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:3">de7izaytoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:3">Intteno Yuhuda asatoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:3">Taappenne ta woyne turaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:3">tokkiza sohozappe giddon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:3">de7iza yo7oza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:3">ane ha7i intte pirdite.<verse eid="ISA 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 5:4" />Tani ta woyne turaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:4">sohozasi ooththidayssafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:4">hara ay ooththanayssi attidee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:4">Izi lo7o ayfe ayfana gaada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:4">ta naagishin ays caala phanqida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:4">ayfe ayfidee?<verse eid="ISA 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 5:5" />Ha7i tani ta woyne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:5">tokkiza gadeza bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:5">ooththanaaz inttes yootays.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:5">Dirsaa shoddana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:5">izikka dhayana mala ooththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:5">Tani gimbeza laallana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:5">he sohoykka durettana.<verse eid="ISA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 5:6" />Tani he sohoza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:6">mago biitta ooththana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:6">He turay xunqqettenanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:6">bul7ettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:6">Histtiin kindichchoynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:6">agunththi izan mokkana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:6">Iray izan bukkontta mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:6">tani shaarata azazana» gides.<verse eid="ISA 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 5:7" />Ubbaafe Wolqqama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:7">GODAA woyne tokkiza gadey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:7">Isra7eele asaa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:7">Yuhuda asay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:7">izi ufayettiza atakilte.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:7">Istti suure pirda pirdana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:7">giidi naagides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:7">gido attiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:7">suuth gussishin be7ides.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:7">Izi xilloteth koyides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:7">gido attiin meto waaso siyides.<verse eid="ISA 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 5:8" />Haratas sohoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:8">dhayanaashe gakkanaas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:8">keeth keeththa bolla gujjizaytoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:8">Gade gadera gaththi oyththidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:8">intterkka xalla biittaa bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:8">aakki de7izaytoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:8">Inttes aayye ana!<verse eid="ISA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 5:9" />Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAY</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:9">tani ta hayththara siyishin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:9">«Gita keeththati kayzi attana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:9">he lo7o keeththatan de7anaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:9">asi dhayana.<verse eid="ISA 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 5:10" />Tammu waaxa booratan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:10">tokkida woyne ayfeppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:10">issi oto gidiza woyne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:10">ushshi xalla ke7ana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:10">tammu qun7a kath zeriin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:10">issi qun7a kaththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:10">xalla ayfana» gides.<verse eid="ISA 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 5:11" />Maththosiza ushshu koyanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:11">maalado guurara dendidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:11">woyne ushshan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:11">xuugettana gakkanaas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:11">sa7aa qamisizaytas aayye ana!<verse eid="ISA 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 5:12" />Istta gibirasohon maasinqoy,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:12">diiththi, karabey, susul7eynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:12">woyne ushshi dees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:12">gido attiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:12">istti GODAA oosozas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:12">wudettibeettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:12">izi ba kushen ooththida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:12">oosokka bonchchibeettenna.<verse eid="ISA 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 5:13" />Histtiin ta Derey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:13">akeeka dhayda gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:13">di7etti baana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:13">istta shuumeti koshan hayqqana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:13">istta dere asaykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:13">haaththa saamon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:13">xuugetti hayqqana.<verse eid="ISA 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 5:14" />Duufoy ba gomppa aassadus;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:14">ba doonaakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:14">zawappe bollara doyadus;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:14">Yerusalaamen de7iza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:14">gita asatinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:14">hankko derey, wocamizaytanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:14">guppizayta issi bolla mittana.<verse eid="ISA 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 5:15" />Asi ubbay tooshettananne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:15">kawuyana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:15">otoranchchati ubbay yeellatana.<verse eid="ISA 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 5:16" />Gido attiin Ubbaafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:16">Wolqqama GODAY,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:16">suure pirdan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:16">dhoqqu dhoqqu gaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:16">geeshsha Xoossay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:16">ba geeshshateththaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:16">ba xilloteththan bessana.<verse eid="ISA 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 5:17" />He wode dorsati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:17">bantta qooron</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:17">heemettiza mala heemettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:17">dorsa laaqqati laalettida dureta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:17">keeththata sohon maata maana.<verse eid="ISA 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 5:18" />Cimo wodoron nagaraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:18">goochchizaytas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:18">para-gaare wodoron iitateth</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:18">goochchizaytas aayye ana!<verse eid="ISA 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 5:19" />«Nuni nu ayfera be7ana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:19">ane Xoossi elelo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:19">Ba oosokka eesoso!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:19">Nuni erana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:19">Isra7eele Geeshshay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:19">qoppida qofay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:19">matan poletto»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:19">gizaytas aayye ana!<verse eid="ISA 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 5:20" />Iitaa lo7o, lo7oza iita gizaytas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:20">dhumaa poo7o</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:20">poo7oza dhuma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:20">ooththizaytassinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:20">cammizayssa mal7o,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:20">mal7izayssa camo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:20">ooththizaytas aayye ana!<verse eid="ISA 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 5:21" />Banttana barkka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:21">«Tani aadho eranchcha!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:21">Tani qara gidikkinaa!»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:21">gi qoppizaytas aayye ana!<verse eid="ISA 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 5:22" />Woyne ushshan erettidaytassinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:22">maththosiza ushshu walakkanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:22">goobizaytas aayye ana!<verse eid="ISA 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 5:23" />Matta7e ekkidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:23">mooranchchata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:23">xillisizaytassinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:23">xillo asatasi suure pirdaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:23">diggizaytas aayye ana!<verse eid="ISA 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 5:24" />Istti Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAA</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:24">wogaa ixxida gishshas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:24">Isra7eele Geeshshaa qaalaakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:24">kadhida gishshas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:24">tama lacoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:24">buuxa oykkiza malanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:24">mela maatay eexxi dhayza mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:24">istta xaphoy wooqqana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:24">istta ciishshayka buhe mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:24">laaletti dhayana;<verse eid="ISA 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 5:25" />GODAA hanqoy iza deraa bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:25">eexxi ke7ides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:25">izi ba kushe denththidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:25">istta shocides.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:25">Zumati qaaxxida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:25">hayqqida asaa ahay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:25">oge bolla pitti yeggida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:25">buura mala gidides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:25">histti pe7iinkka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:25">iza hanqoy simmibeenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:25">iza kushey ha7ikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:25">dendida mala dees.<verse eid="ISA 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 5:26" />GODAY haakon de7iza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:26">kawoteththatas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:26">malaata dhoqqan essees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:26">sa7a gaxan de7iza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:26">morkketaska wayqees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:26">isttika eeson bichcharishe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:26">puttu gaana.<verse eid="ISA 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 5:27" />Istta giddon daaburanchchaynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:27">wobbey deenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:27">Isttafe issoynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:27">dhiskennanne ichchenna.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:27">Xeessan gixxida qabattoyka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:27">birshettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:27">Istta caammaa dafoykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:27">duuxxenna.<verse eid="ISA 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 5:28" />Istta yiishshay hoxe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:28">istta wondafeykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:28">waaxetti uttides.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:28">Istta parata qinccafilley</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:28">zaalla shuchcha mala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:28">istta para-gaareta erzoykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:28">gote mala.<verse eid="ISA 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 5:29" />Istta xaagoykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:29">gaammo xaago mala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:29">wodalla gaammota mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:29">xaaggeettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:29">banttas miza miish</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:29">shankkati oykkidi xaaggeettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:29">istti oykkidayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:29">tookki ekki beettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:29">isttafe woththi ekkanay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:29">oonikka deenna.<verse eid="ISA 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 5:30" />He gallas istti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:30">gita abba dambala mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:30">Isra7eele bolla guummana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:30">oonikka duge zaari</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:30">biittaa xeelliko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:30">dhumanne meto be7ana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:30">poo7oykka shaaran kamettana.<verse eid="ISA 5:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ISA 6" />
  <para style="s1">Nabeteththas Isayaasa Xeygeteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 6:1" />Kawo Ooziyay hayqqida layth GODAY dhoqqa araata bolla uttidayssa beyadis; izi may7ida afala macaray Xoossa Keeth kumi uttides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 15:7">2Kawo 15:7</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 26:23">2Taari 26:23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ISA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 6:2" />Suraafeele geetettiza kiitanchchati izappe bollara deettes; issi issi suraafeeles usuppun qefeti deettes; nam7u qefetan ba ayfeso ayfeso kammeettes; nam7u qefetan ba toho toho kammeettes; nam7u qefetan piradhdheettes. <verse eid="ISA 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 6:3" />Issoy issaara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:3">«Geeshshawu, geeshshawu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:3">geeshshawu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:3">Ubbaafe Wolqqama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:3">GODAA Xoossawu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:3">Sa7a ubbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:3">iza bonchchon kumides» gida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 4:8">Ajju 4:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 6:4" />Istta qaala cenggurssafe dendidayssan Xoossa Keeththas yochchay qaaxxides; qasseka Xoossa Keeththaa cuway dhippi gi kumides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 15:8">Ajju 15:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 6:5" />Histtiin tani, «Tani doonay tunida asa; qasse doonay tunida asata giddon de7ays; tani Kawoza, Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAA Xoossa ta ayfen be7ida gishshas taas aayye ana! Ta dhayadis» gadis.<verse eid="ISA 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 6:6" />Histtiin suraafeeletappe issoy yarshizasozappe qaphen tama bonqqo ekkidi piradhdhishe taakko yides. <verse eid="ISA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 6:7" />Tamaa bonqqozan ta doonaa bochchidi, «Be7a; hayssi tamaa bonqqozi ne doonaa bochchides; ne mooroy neeppe kichchides; ne nagaraykka qucetti kichchides» gides.<verse eid="ISA 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 6:8" />Hessafe guye GODAY, «Oona kiittoo? Nuus oonee kiitettanay?» gishin siyadis. Tanikka zaarada, «Hekko, tana kiita» gadis.<verse eid="ISA 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 6:9" />Histtiin GODAY;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:9">«Ba; baada ha asaas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:9">‹Intte sissi siyeeta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:9">gido attiin yuushshi qoppeketa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:9">ayfen xeelleeta shin akeekkeketa›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:9">gaada isttas yoota.<verse eid="ISA 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 6:10" />Hayssa deraa wozinaa dammisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:10">istta hayththaka tullisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:10">istta ayfezakka qooqisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:10">histtontta aggiko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:10">istti bantta ayfen be7ana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:10">bantta hayththan siyana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:10">bantta wozinankka akeekana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:10">histtidi istti taakko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:10">simmidi paxana» gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:9-10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:14-15">Mato 13:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:12">Mar 4:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:10">Luqa 8:10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:40">Yoha 12:40</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 28:26-27">Hawa 28:26-27</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 6:11" />Tanikka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:11">«Abeet Godawu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:11">Hayssi ayde gakkanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:11">hananee?» gadis.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:11">Izikka zaaridi taas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:11">«Katamati isttan de7iza asi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:11">dhayiin istti laalettana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:11">gakkanaas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:11">keeththatikka ubbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:11">kayzana gakkanaassinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:11">biittayka mulera aykkoy baynda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:11">bula gidana gakkanaassa.<verse eid="ISA 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 6:12" />Tani GODAY asaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:12">haassana gakkanaassa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:12">biittaaka aykkoy baynda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:12">bazzo kessana gakkanaassa.<verse eid="ISA 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 6:13" />Tammu asaappe issi asi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:13">biittaa bolla attiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:13">izikka dhayana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:13">qanxxi yeggiin attida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:13">wolaa duruma mala gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:13">geeshsha zarey hessaththo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:13">he duruma mala gidana» gides.<verse eid="ISA 6:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ISA 7" />
  <para style="s1">Kawo Akaazes Yida Kiita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 7:1" />Ooziya naa Iyo7aatamey yelida Akaazey Yuhuda biittan kawotida wode Aaraame biitta kawo Eraasooninne Isra7eele biitta Kawo Eromeliyo naa Faaquhey Yerusalaame olanaas kezida; gido attiin xoonanaas dandaybeettenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 16:5">2Kawo 16:5</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 28:5-6">2Taari 28:5-6</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 7:2" />Aaraame dereynne Efreeme derey issi bolla gididi olas ke7idayssa Dawite zareppe kawotida kawoy siyida wode wora mith carkoy qaaththiza mala Akaaze wozinaynne deraa wozinay qaaxxides.<verse eid="ISA 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 7:3" />Histtiin GODAY Isayaasas, «Neni ne naa Sha7aari-Yaashube<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:3 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Sha7aari-Yaashube: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sha7aari-Yaashube gizayssa Ibraaweta sunththa birsheththay, «Amardayti simmana» gees.</char></note> ekkada Akaazera gayttanaas baada may7o meeccizayta goshshaakko efiza oge matan ganna baggara de7iza eele haaththa zaraa xeeran neni iza demmana. <verse eid="ISA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 7:4" />Histtada izas, ‹Naagetta; woppu ga; babbofa; hayta tamay mishin attidi cuwattiza duruma nam7atappe Aaraames, Eraasoonessinne, Eromeliyo naa hanqos shabarettofa› ga yoota. <verse eid="ISA 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 7:5" />Aaraame biitta asay Efreeme asaaranne Eromeliyo naara ne bolla iita miish ooththanaas, <verse eid="ISA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 7:6" />‹Ane Yuhuda biittan worajjoos; ane laalloos; ane nuus nuus shaaketti ekkidi Xaabi7eele naa kawoththoos› gi maqettida» gides.<verse eid="ISA 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 7:7" />Gido attiin Ubbaa Haariza GODAY,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 7:7">«Hayssi ha istta maqqozi minnenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 7:7">mulekka polettenna.<verse eid="ISA 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 7:8" />Gaasoykka Damasqoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 7:8">Aaraame biittas hu7e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 7:8">kawo Eraasooney Damasqos hu7e.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 7:8">Usuppun tamman ichchash</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 7:8">layththa garsan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 7:8">Efreeme derey laalettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 7:8">simmidi dere gidana dandayenna.<verse eid="ISA 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 7:9" />Qasse Samaariyay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 7:9">Efreeme biittaas hu7e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 7:9">Eromeliyo nay Samaariyas hu7e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 7:9">intte intte ammanon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 7:9">minnidi eqqontta ixxiko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 7:9">mulekka eqqanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 7:9">dandayekketa» gees.<verse eid="ISA 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amanu7eele Yuussaa Bessiza Malata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 7:10" />Qasseka GODAY Akaazes, <verse eid="ISA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 7:11" />«GODAY ne Xoossa nees bolla saloppe, woykko sa7appe, gars ciimmafe issi malata immana mala oychcha» gides. <verse eid="ISA 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 7:12" />Akaazey gidikko, «Oychchike; GODAAKKA paaccike» gides.<verse eid="ISA 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 7:13" />Isayaasi, «Intteno Dawite zaretoo, siyite! Intte asaa saleththizayssi guuxxiin Xoos saleththanaas dendidetii? <verse eid="ISA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 7:14" />Histtiko GODAY barkka inttes malata bessana; geela7oy shaarana; attuma naa yelana; iza sunththaaka, ‹Amanu7eele›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Amanu7eele: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amanu7eele Ibraaweta sunththa birsheththan Xoossi nunara dees guussa.</char></note> gaada sunththana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:23">Mato 1:23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ISA 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 7:15" />Izi iitanne lo7o shaakki eriza wode hangara maaththinne ees maana. <verse eid="ISA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 7:16" />Gido attiin naazi iitanne lo7o shaakki eranaappe sinththan neni keehi yayyida nam7u kawota biittati aykkoy baynda bula gidana.<verse eid="ISA 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 7:17" />«Efreeme biittay Yuhuda biittafe shaakettoosofe doommiin hayssafe sinththan hani erontta wode GODAY ne bolla, ne deraa bollanne ne aawaa keeththa bolla ehana; izi ne bolla ehanayssika Asoore kawo» gides.<verse eid="ISA 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 7:18" />He wode GODAY haako biittan diza Gibxe shaafappe udunxxeta, Asoore biittafe maththata wayqeththan xeygana. <verse eid="ISA 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 7:19" />Istti ubbayka yiidi bazzo shoobban, shuchcha gongolon, agunththa tushaninne haaththa ollatan gawu7ana.<verse eid="ISA 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 7:20" />He wode GODAY Efiraaxise Shaafa pinththafe garxxi ehida magallan, hessika Asoore kawoy yiidi inttes hu7e binanaa, intte buuchchinne intte bolla diza iske ubbaa meedana.<verse eid="ISA 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 7:21" />He wode issi asas issi ussa miizinne nam7u deyshati xalla attana. <verse eid="ISA 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 7:22" />Gidikkoka istti maaxxiza maaththi keehi daro gidida gishshas izi oys maana; he biittan attida asay ubbayka hangaranne ees maana.<verse eid="ISA 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 7:23" />He wode issi shii biran washettiza issi shii woyne turati tokettidasohoti ubbay agunththinne kindichcho xalla gidana. <verse eid="ISA 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 7:24" />Biitta ubbaan kindichchoynne agunththi kumida gishshas asay hee biza wode wondafenne yiish oykki baana. <verse eid="ISA 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 7:25" />Kase xoyllen goyettidi kath immiza zumbullati kindichchoninne agunththan kumida gishshas yayyidi issi asikka hee beenna; meheynne dorsi la7ettizaso gidana.<verse eid="ISA 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ISA 8" />
  <para style="s1">Asoore Kawo Yuus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 8:1" />GODAY tana, «Gita xaaththa waraqata ekkada, ‹Maher-shalal hash-baaz›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maher-shalal hash-baaz guussi di7anaassinne bonqqanaas elela.</char></note> gaada nababettiza pidalen xaafa. <verse eid="ISA 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 8:2" />Qeese Ooriyanne Baarakiyo naa Zakaraasa taas ammanettida markkata gidana mala ta istta xeygana» gides.<verse eid="ISA 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 8:3" />Hessafe guye ba machcho nabeyra aqides; izakka shaarada attuma naa yeladus; histtiin GODAY tana, «Iza sunththaa, ‹Maher-shalal hash-baaz› gaada sunththa. <verse eid="ISA 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 8:4" />Naazi, ‹Aabboo! Aayee!› gi xeys eranaappe kase Asoore biitta kawoy Samaariyanne Damasqo aqota di7i efana» gides.<verse eid="ISA 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 8:5" />Qasseka GODAY taas,<verse eid="ISA 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 8:6" />«Ha derey co7u gi goggiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:6">Selihoome haaththata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:6">aggidi Eraasooneninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:6">Eromeliyo naazan ufayettides.<verse eid="ISA 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 8:7" />Hessa gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:7">tani GODAY minonne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:7">wolqqama gidida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:7">Efiraaxise haaththa haro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:7">Asoore kawo iza teemaranne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:7">bonchchozara istta bolla ehana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:7">haaththazi shaafaza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:7">kumi polchchidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:7">shaafa doonan diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:7">biitta ubbaa mittana.<verse eid="ISA 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 8:8" />Buuri ekkidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:8">duge Yuhuda wodhdhana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:8">biittaa kumidi aadhdhana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:8">qoodhe gakkanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:8">mittana» gides.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:8">Gido attiin Amanu7eelee!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:8">Micettida iza qefey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:8">ne biittaa gaxappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:8">gaxa gakkanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:8">kammi oykkides.<verse eid="ISA 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 8:9" />Intteno kawoteththatoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:9">Olas dendidi waassite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:9">intte dippi gaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:9">haaho deren dizayti ezgite!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:9">Olaska giigettite!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:9">Intte dippi gaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:9">Olaska giigettite!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:9">Intte meqerettana;<verse eid="ISA 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 8:10" />Olas zorettite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:10">gido attiin inttes suurenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:10">halchcho kessite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:10">gido attiin inttes minnenna.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:10">Gaasoykka Xoossay nunara dees.<verse eid="ISA 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Godaan Ammaneteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 8:11" />GODAY ba mino kushe ta bolla woththidi tani ha asaa oge kaallontta mala seerides;<verse eid="ISA 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 8:12" />«Hayssi asay, ‹Iita maqqo›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:12">gi xeygiza miish</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:12">intte aykkoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:12">‹Iita maqqo› goopite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:12">istti babbizayssas intte babbofte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:12">izas yarkiyarkofte.<verse eid="ISA 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 8:13" />Intte dummasana bessizay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:13">Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAA xalla;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:13">intte yayyanaassinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:13">kokkoranaas bessizay iza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12-13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:14-15">1Phex 3:14-15</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 8:14" />Izi geeshshasoho gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:14">gido attiin izi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:14">Yuhuda biittaa asaassinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:14">Isra7eele keeththaa asaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:14">dhuphiza shuchchinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:14">kundisiza zaalla gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:14">Yerusalaamen diza asaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:14">izi gitenne woximade gidana.<verse eid="ISA 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 8:15" />Isttafe daroti dhuphettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:15">kundidikka meqqana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:15">woximaden</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:15">geli oykettana» gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:14-15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:8">1Phex 2:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 8:16" />Markkateththaa lo7eththa oykka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:16">ta tamaareta giddon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:16">wogaa maatamen shoca.<verse eid="ISA 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 8:17" />Tani ba sinth Yaaqoobe zaretappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:17">genththida GODAA naagana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:17">izakka hidota ooththana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 2:13">Ib 2:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 8:18" />Tananne taas GODAY immida nayta be7ite. Nuni Xiyoone zuman diza Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAAPPE Isra7eeles malatanne markka.<verse eid="ISA 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 8:19" />Asay inttena, «Bessonttaaz tattafettishenne Saasukettishe haasayettiza bitizaytanne moytille xeygizayta oychchite» giikko derey ba GODAA oychchanaas bessennee? De7o Xoossaa aggidi hayqqidayta oysho ays koshshizee? <verse eid="ISA 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 8:20" />Wogaakkonne markkateththa qaalaakko biite! Istti hayssa mala qaala inttes yootontta aggiko wontta poo7oy isttas poo7enna.<verse eid="ISA 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 8:21" />Istti ceecishenne gafishe biitta bolla toylattana; istti keehi gafida wode hanqettana; pude xeellidi bantta kawaanne bantta Xoossaa qanggana. <verse eid="ISA 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 8:22" />Hessafe guye istti duge biitta xeellana; istti xeellanayssika waaye, dhumanne dhippi gida babisiza miish xalla; istti girdi gida dhuman yegettana.<verse eid="ISA 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ISA 9" />
  <para style="s1">Sinththafe Kawotana Saroteththa Kawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 9:1" />Ceecishe dizaytas hayssafe guyen hidotay dhayenna; beni wode Zaabiloone biittanne Niftaaleme biitta kawushshides; sinththafe yaana woden gidikko Mediteraane abbaa ogen de7iza biittanne Yordaanoose Shaafappe he pinththan de7iza, «Ayzaabeti de7iza Galila biitta» izi bonchchana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:15">Mato 4:15</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 9:2" />Dhuman de7iza derey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:2">wolqqama poo7o be7ides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:2">hayqo kuwa garsan diza deretas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:2">poo7oy poo7ides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:16">Mato 4:16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:79">Luqa 1:79</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 9:3" />Neni kawoteththaa darsadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:3">isttas ufayssaa bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:3">ufays gujjadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:3">asay kath shiishshishenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:3">di7i ekkida miish gishettishe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:3">ufayettiza mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:3">isttika ne sinththan ufayettana.<verse eid="ISA 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 9:4" />Kase neni Midiyaame biitta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:4">xoonida mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:4">istta deexxiza qambara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:4">istta hashe bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:4">wodhida durqqanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:4">istta waayisi haarida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:4">guufe menththadasa.<verse eid="ISA 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 9:5" />Olanchchata caammay ubbay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:5">suuththan moorettida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:5">may7o ubbayka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:5">taman dunne gidi eexxana.<verse eid="ISA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 9:6" />Hekko nuus nay yelettides!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:6">Attuma naykka nuus imettides!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:6">Halaqateththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:6">iza hashe bolla gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:6">iza sunththi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:6">«Malalisiza zoranchcha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:6">Wolqqama Xoossa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:6">Mernaa Aawa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:6">Saroteththa Halaqa» geetettana.<verse eid="ISA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 9:7" />Iza kawoteththa aakoteththaassinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:7">iza saroteththaas zaway deenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:7">hachchife doommidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:7">mernaa gakkanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:7">ba kawoteththaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:7">suure pirdaninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:7">xilloteththan essana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:7">lo7eththi oykkidi minththana;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:7">Dawite kawoteththa araatan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:7">izi uttana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:7">deraa ubbaa haarana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:7">Ubbaafe Wolqqama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:7">GODAA qanaatey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:7">hessa polana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:32-33">Luqa 1:32-33</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isra7eele Bolla Xoossa Hanqo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 9:8" />GODAY Yaaqoobe zareta bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:8">pirda qaala kiittides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:8">izikka Isra7eele bolla polettana.<verse eid="ISA 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 9:9" />Efreemeninne Samaariyan de7iza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:9">derey ubbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:9">hessa Xoossi ooththidayssa erana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:9">otoroninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:9">moodheteththan dendidi,<verse eid="ISA 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 9:10" />«Xuubeppe oosettida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:10">gimbetti laalettida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:10">nuni gidikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:10">masettida shuchchan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:10">zaari gimbana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:10">eththati qanxxettida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:10">nuni gidikko isttasohon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:10">ziga laammana» gida.<verse eid="ISA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 9:11" />Hessa gishshas GODAY</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:11">Eraasoone morkketa minththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:11">istta morkketa istta bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:11">denththeththidi ehana.<verse eid="ISA 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 9:12" />Arshey mokkiza baggafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:12">Aaraame biittaa asatinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:12">arshey wulliza baggafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:12">Filisxeeme biitta asati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:12">bantta doona hangidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:12">Isra7eele mittana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:12">Hessi ubbay haniinkka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:12">GODAA hanqoy irxxibeenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:12">iza kusheykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:12">dendidasoppe simmibeenna.<verse eid="ISA 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 9:13" />Derezi gidikko bana shocida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:13">GODAAKKO simmibeenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:13">Ubbaafe Wolqqama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:13">GODAAKKA koyibeenna.<verse eid="ISA 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 9:14" />Hessa gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:14">GODAY hu7enne goyna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:14">zamba hagganne maqqa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:14">Isra7eeleppe issi gallas qeexana.<verse eid="ISA 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 9:15" />Cimatinne bonchchettidayti hu7e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:15">wordo tamaarsiza nabeti goyna.<verse eid="ISA 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 9:16" />Hayssa deraa kaaleththizayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:16">baleththeettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:16">kaalliza dereykka ogeppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:16">kare kezidi toylattees.<verse eid="ISA 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 9:17" />Hessa gishshas GODAY</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:17">naateththa naytan ufayettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:17">yi7otassinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:17">am7etas qadhettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:17">ubbayka iita ooththizaytanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:17">Xoossa yashshateth bayndayta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:17">ubbaa asaa doonappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:17">harassiza qaalay kezees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:17">hessi ubbay haniinkka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:17">GODAA hanqoy irxxibeenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:17">iza kusheykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:17">dendidasoppe simmibeenna.<verse eid="ISA 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 9:18" />Deraa iitateththi kindichchonne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:18">agunth xuuggiza tama mala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:18">dhippi gida woray xuugettishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:18">keziza cuwa tuussa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:18">sitti giidi pude kezees.<verse eid="ISA 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 9:19" />Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAA hanqon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:19">biittay xuugettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:19">dereykka taman geliza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:19">miththa mala gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:19">ishay ishas qadhettenna.<verse eid="ISA 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 9:20" />Ushachcha baggara tuxxana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:20">gido attiin gafa teqqenna.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:20">Hadirsa baggara maana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:20">gido attiin kallettenna.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:20">Issoy issoy ba yelida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:20">nayta maana.<verse eid="ISA 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 9:21" />Minaasey Efreeme maana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:21">Efreemeykka Minaase maana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:21">istti issife gididi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:21">Yuhuda bolla dendana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:21">Hessi ubbay haniinkka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:21">GODAA hanqoy irxxibeenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:21">iza kusheykka dendidasoppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:21">simmibeenna.<verse eid="ISA 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ISA 10" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 10:1" />Geella woganne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:1">as un7eththiza awajja</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:1">kessizaytas aayye ana!<verse eid="ISA 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 10:2" />Manqota pirda geellasizaytas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:2">un7ettida ta dereza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:2">pirda bokkasizaytas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:2">am7eta aqota bonqqizaytas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:2">yi7ota aqota dhechchi mizaytas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:2">aayye ana!<verse eid="ISA 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 10:3" />Inttena xomosiza wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:3">intte awa gelandetii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:3">Haakoppe bashshi yiza wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:3">ay hanandetii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:3">Maado demmanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:3">oonakko baqatandetii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:3">Intte aqota awan qottandetii?<verse eid="ISA 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 10:4" />Qashettida asaara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:4">issife qasheteththafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:4">shukettiza asaara issife</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:4">shuketeththafe attiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:4">haray inttes attanaasoy deenna.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:4">Hessi ubbay haniinkka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:4">GODAA hanqoy dochchibeenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:4">qaxxayanaas izi ba kushe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:4">denththi woththides.<verse eid="ISA 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asoore Bolla Yaana Xoossa Pirda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 10:5" />GODAY, «Ta hanqos guufe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:5">ta ehiza bashshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:5">xam7a gidida Asoore biitta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:5">asaas aayye ana!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5-34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:24-27">Isa 14:24-27</ref>; <ref loc="NAM 1:1-3:19">Naho 1:1—3:19</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:13-15">Sofo 2:13-15</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 10:6" />Istta aqota bonqqana mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:6">banttas di7o</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:6">buuri shiishshana mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:6">istti oge urqqaththo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:6">yedhettana mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:6">Xoos erontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:6">kawoteththa bolla kiittana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:6">Tana hanqeththida asaa bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:6">tani Asooreta yeddana.<verse eid="ISA 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 10:7" />Gido attiin Asoore kawoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:7">hayssa halchchibeenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:7">iza wozinan hayssa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:7">qofay deenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:7">iza halchchoy daro kawoteththata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:7">bashshanaassinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:7">mulera dhayssanaassa.<verse eid="ISA 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 10:8" />Izi, ‹Ta ola gadawati ubbati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:8">kawo gidettennee?› gi ceeqettees.<verse eid="ISA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 10:9" />‹Kalnnoy Karkamishe mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:9">Hamaatey Arfaade mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:9">Samaariyaykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:9">Damasqo mala gidettennee?<verse eid="ISA 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 10:10" />Yerusalaameninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:10">Samaariyan de7iza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:10">eeqa misletappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:10">dariza misleta goynniza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:10">kawoteththata seeranaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:10">tani ta kushe yeddadis.<verse eid="ISA 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 10:11" />Samaariya bollaninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:11">izi misleta bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:11">ta ooththoyssaththo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:11">Yerusalaame bollanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:11">izi misleta bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:11">ta ooththikinaa?› gees» gides.<verse eid="ISA 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 10:12" />GODAY Xiyoone zuma bollanne Yerusalaame bolla ba ooththana ooso ubbaa polidaappe guye, «Asoore kawo iza wozina otoreteththaa gishshassinne izi kadhe ayfen xeelliza gishshas ta iza qaxxayana» gees.<verse eid="ISA 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 10:13" />Asoore kawoy,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:13">«Hayssa ubbaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:13">tani mino qesen ooththadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:13">qasseka tani aadho eranchchanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:13">akeekanchcha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:13">tani kawoteththata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:13">zawa laalladis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:13">tani istta aqota bonqqa ekkadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:13">ta qarateththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:13">istta kawota kawushshadis.<verse eid="ISA 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 10:14" />Asi ba kushe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:14">kafo keeththan yeddiza mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:14">tanikka ta kushe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:14">kawoteththata aqotan yeddadis.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:14">Qasse asi dogetti attida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:14">phuuphphulleta shiishshiza mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:14">tanikka dere ubbaa shiishshadis.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:14">Paallanaas ba qefe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:14">micciday deenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:14">waassanaas ba doona</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:14">doyday deenna» gides.<verse eid="ISA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 10:15" />Kalttay banan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:15">qanxxizaade bolla ceeqettizee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:15">Magaazey bana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:15">goochchizaade bolla otorettizee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:15">Xam7ay bana oykkida asa bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:15">ba hu7e qaaththana dandayzee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:15">guufey asi baynda barkka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:15">hemetti erizee?<verse eid="ISA 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 10:16" />Hessa gishshas GODAY,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:16">Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAY,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:16">modhdhida iza olanchchata bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:16">gilqisiza harge yeddana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:16">iza bonchchozappe garsara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:16">laciza tama yeddana.<verse eid="ISA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 10:17" />Isra7eele Poo7oy tama gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:17">Geeshshazikka tama laco gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:17">issi gallassan iza agunththaanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:17">kindichchoza tamay maana.<verse eid="ISA 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 10:18" />Harganchchay gilqidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:18">hayqqiza mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:18">ba woraa bonchchonne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:18">aradda biitta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:18">ashonne shemppo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:18">mulera dhayssana.<verse eid="ISA 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 10:19" />Iza woran guuththa miththati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:19">casha attana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:19">heytakka qeeri nay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:19">qoodi wursana dadayees.<verse eid="ISA 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Casha Attida Isra7eele Zareta</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 10:20" />He wode Isra7eele zareppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:20">casha attidayti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:20">Yaaqoobe keeththafe attidayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:20">hayssafe guye banttana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:20">shocidayta bolla zemppettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:20">gido attiin GODAAN</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:20">Isra7eele Geeshshan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:20">tumappe ammanettana.<verse eid="ISA 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 10:21" />Casha attidayti simmana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:21">Yaaqoobe keeththafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:21">casha attidayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:21">Ubbaafe Wolqqama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:21">Xoossaako simmana.<verse eid="ISA 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 10:22" />Nenoo Isra7eele! Ne asay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:22">abba shaamintta mala gidikkoka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:22">casha attidayti xalla simmana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:22">Xilloteththan kumida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:22">gita bashshi awajettides.<verse eid="ISA 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 10:23" />GODAY, Ubbaafe Wolqqama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:23">GODAY sa7a ubbaa bollan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:23">ehana qachchida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:23">bash ehana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22-23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:27">Oro 9:27</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asoore Bolla Yaana Xoossa Pirda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 10:24" />Hessa gishshas GODAY, Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAY,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:24">«Xiyoonen diza ta derezoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:24">Gibxeti ne bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:24">ooththidayssaththo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:24">guufe ne bolla denththidayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:24">durqqan nena qoxxida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:24">Asoore asaas babbofa.<verse eid="ISA 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 10:25" />Ta ne bolla ehida qixaateza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:25">guuththa wode garsan ta essana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:25">ta istta bollaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:25">bosha ehana» gees.<verse eid="ISA 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 10:26" />Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAY,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:26">«Midiyaame asaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:26">Hereebe zaalla achchan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:26">shocoyssaththo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:26">izi istta xurqafera wadhdhana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:26">izi Gibxeta bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:26">ooththidayssaththo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:26">ba guufeza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:26">abba bolla denththana.<verse eid="ISA 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 10:27" />He gallas istta toohoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:27">ne hasheppe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:27">istta qambaray</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:27">ne morgefe kichchana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:27">ne ordeteththafe dendidayssan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:27">iza qambaray meqqana» gees.<verse eid="ISA 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Worajjizayti Yeggida Ola</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 10:28" />Istti Ayaatera biidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:28">Migeroone kanththi beettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:28">baas diza miishshaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:28">Makimaasen shiishsheettes.<verse eid="ISA 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 10:29" />Istti pinnizasora aadhdhi biidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:29">nuni Geeban dunkaani aqana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:29">Eraamay dagammadus;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:29">Sa7oole katama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:29">Gibi7ay baqatadus.<verse eid="ISA 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 10:30" />Gaalime nayee ne waassa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:30">Laysha ezga siya!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:30">Manqo gidida Anatoote,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:30">ne izis zaaro imma.<verse eid="ISA 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 10:31" />Madimeenaha baqata bolla dawus;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:31">Geeba derey qotettana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:31">woththan dees.<verse eid="ISA 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 10:32" />Istti hach Noobe gakkana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:32">istti bantta kushe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:32">Yerusalaame zumbulla bolla,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:32">Xiyoone macca nay zuma bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:32">ceeqeteththan mandana.<verse eid="ISA 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ISA 10:33" />Be7ite GODAY,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:33">Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAY</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:33">ba gita wolqqan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:33">haggata qanxxereththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:33">adussa miththatikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:33">shiretti wodhdhana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:33">dhoqqu dhoqqu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:33">gidaytikka kundana.<verse eid="ISA 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ISA 10:34" />Girdi gida woraakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:34">kalttara qeexana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:34">Libaanoose zigatikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:34">Wolqqamaza sinththan kundana.<verse eid="ISA 10:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ISA 11" />
  <para style="s1">Saroteththi Kumida Kawoteth</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 11:1" />Isseye durumappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:1">aacay purccana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:1">iza xaphotappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:1">issi haggay ayfe immana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 5:5">Ajju 5:5</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:16">22:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 11:2" />GODAA Ayanay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:2">aadho erateththinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:2">akeeka Ayanay, zore Ayanaynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:2">wolqqa Ayanay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:2">erateththa Ayanaynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:2">GODAAS yashissiza Ayanay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:2">iza bolla shemppana.<verse eid="ISA 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 11:3" />GODAAS yashshan izi ufayettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:3">ba ayfen be7ida malanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:3">ba hayththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:3">siyida mala pirdenna.<verse eid="ISA 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 11:4" />Gido attiin hiyeesatas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:4">xillo pirdana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:4">sa7a bolla manqotas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:4">suure pirdana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:4">ba inxarsaa xam7an</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:4">sa7a shocana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:4">ba doona peenon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:4">iitata wodhana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 2:8">2Taso 2:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 11:5" />Xilloteththi izas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:5">xeessa dancco gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:5">ammaneteththay izas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:5">dabala dancco gidana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:14">Efe 6:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 11:6" />Kana suytey dorsa laaqqara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:6">issife daana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:6">maaheykka deysha laaqqara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:6">issife ichchana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:6">miiza mari, gaammo marinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:6">modhdho mehey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:6">issife heemettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:6">guuththa nay istta heemmana.<verse eid="ISA 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 11:7" />Miizinne zardoy issife heemettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:7">istta maratikka issife ichchana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:7">gaammoy boora mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:7">happa maana.<verse eid="ISA 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 11:8" />Dhammiza nay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:8">iita shooshsha ollan kaa7ana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:8">dhanth duuththontta nay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:8">ba kushe goppe shooshsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:8">ollan yeddana.<verse eid="ISA 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 11:9" />Geeshshi gidida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:9">ta zumaa bolla qohettenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:9">woykko oonikka dhayenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:9">haaththi abba kumiza mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:9">sa7a ubbay GODAA eron kumana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:6-9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:25">Isa 65:25</ref></char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 2:14">Im 2:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Di7etti Bidayta Simo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 11:10" />He wode Isseye zereththi kawoteththatas malaata gidi eqqana; kawoteththati izakko yaana; iza shemposoy bonchchettana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:12">Oro 15:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ISA 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 11:11" />He wode GODAY nam7anththo ba kushe miccidi attida asaa Asooreppe, pudeha Gibxeppe, dugeha Gibxeppe, Tophphiyappe, Elaameppe, Sana7ooreppe, Hamaateppenne abba gaxan diza deretappe shiishshana.<verse eid="ISA 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 11:12" />Kawoteththatas malaata essana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:12">dhoqqu ooththidi denththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:12">Isra7eeleppe goodetti bidayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:12">zaari ehana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:12">laalettida Yuhuda asaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:12">oyddu bagga biitta gaxappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:12">izi shiishshana.<verse eid="ISA 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 11:13" />Efreeme qanaateteththi eqqana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:13">Yuhuda morkketikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:13">qanxxettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:13">Efreemey Yuhuda bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:13">qanaatenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:13">Yuhudaykka Efreeme ixxenna.<verse eid="ISA 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 11:14" />Istti arshey wulliza baggara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:14">Filisxeemeta dugunththaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:14">wodhdhana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:14">nam7ayka issife gididi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:14">arshey mokkiza dereza bonqqana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:14">istti Eedoome bollanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:14">Mo7aabe bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:14">bantta kushe denththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:14">Amoone asay isttas haarettana.<verse eid="ISA 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 11:15" />GODAY iita carkon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:15">Gibxe abba melissana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:15">izi ba kushe Efiraaxise</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:15">shaafa bolla yeddana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:15">laappun kessi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:15">shaakereththi yeggana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:15">hessa gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:15">asay tohoppe caamma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:15">kessontta pinnana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 16:12">Ajju 16:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 11:16" />Kase Isra7eeley Gibxeppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:16">kezishin hanidayssaththo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:16">Asooren attida asay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:16">kezana oge isttas giigsana.<verse eid="ISA 11:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ISA 12" />
  <para style="s1">Saba Yeth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 12:1" />He wode neni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:1">«Abeet GODAWU,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:1">kase ne ta bolla hanqettadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:1">ha7i gidikko neni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:1">ne hanqozappe simmada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:1">tana minththeththida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:1">ta nena sabbays.<verse eid="ISA 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 12:2" />‹Be7ite, Xoossay ta atoteththa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:2">tani izan ammanettiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:2">gishshas babbike;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:2">GODAY, Xoossay taas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:2">minoteththinne yeththa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:2">ta atoteththay iza› gaandasa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:2">Kessa 15:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 118:14">Maza 118:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 12:3" />Paththiza ta pulttotappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:3">haath ufayssan duuqqandeta.<verse eid="ISA 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 12:4" />He wode intte GODAA galatite!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:4">Iza sunththaaka xeygite.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:4">Izi ooththidayssa kawoteththata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:4">giddon erisite.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:4">Iza sunththay dhoqqu dhoqqu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:4">gidayssa awajjite.<verse eid="ISA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 12:5" />GODAY gita ooso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:5">ooththida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:5">izas yexxite.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:5">Hessi kumeththa alames eretto.<verse eid="ISA 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 12:6" />Intte giddon diza Isra7eele</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:6">Geeshshay gita gidida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:6">Xiyoone asawu ilili giite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:6">ufayssankka yexxite» gaandeta.<verse eid="ISA 12:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ISA 13" />
  <para style="s1">Baabiloone Bolla Yootettida Tinbite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 13:1" />Amoxe naa Isayaasas GODAY Baabiloone gishshas qonccisiin izi be7idayssi hayssafe kaallizayssa;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:1—14:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 47:1-15">Isa 47:1-15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:1-51:64">Er 50:1—51:64</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 13:2" />aykkoy baynda mela diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:2">zumbulla bolla malata essite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:2">intte qaala dhoqqu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:2">histti waassite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:2">istta shuumeta pengera</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:2">gelana mala malata bessite.<verse eid="ISA 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 13:3" />Ta xoonon ufayettizayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:3">ta geeshshata azazadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:3">ta hanqo istti polana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:3">ta olanchchata xeygadis.<verse eid="ISA 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 13:4" />Daro derey wocamiza mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:4">zumata bolla wocamiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:4">wocamaa siyite!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:4">Kawoteththata giddon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:4">metottida derey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:4">gugumiza gugunththaa siyite!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:4">Ubbaafe Wolqqama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:4">GODAY olanchchata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:4">olas salfisides.<verse eid="ISA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 13:5" />GODAYNNE izi ba hanqo polisanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:5">go7ettiza miishshati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:5">biitta ubbaa dhayssanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:5">haaho biittafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:5">salota gaxappe yida.<verse eid="ISA 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 13:6" />GODAA gallassi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:6">matida gishshas yeekkite!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:6">He gallas Ubbaa Dandayza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:6">Xoossaa matappe bashshi yaana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 1:15">Iyu 1:15</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 13:7" />Hessa gishshas kushe ubbay silana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:7">asa ubbaa wozinaykka seerana.<verse eid="ISA 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 13:8" />Istti shirotana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:8">istta waayeynne metoy gakkana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:8">miixay oykkida maccassa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:8">istti miixattana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:8">issoy issaara dagaman xeelettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:8">istta ayfesoy dagaman</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:8">shaala may7ides.<verse eid="ISA 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 13:9" />Be7ite GODAA gallassay menxe iita;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:9">biitta mela ashshanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:9">izin diza nagaranchchata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:9">dhayssanaas bashsharanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:9">gita hanqora yaana.<verse eid="ISA 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 13:10" />Salo xoolinttetinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:10">istta butteti poo7o immettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:10">arshey buro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:10">mokkida mala dhumana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:10">aginaykka ba poo7o immuku.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 32:7">Hizi 32:7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:29">Mato 24:29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-25">Mar 13:24-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25">Luqa 21:25</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:12-13">Ajju 6:12-13</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 13:11" />GODAY, «Tani alame</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:11">izi iitateththaa gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:11">qaxxayana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:11">iitatakka istta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:11">nagara gishshas qaxxayana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:11">Tani otoranchchata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:11">otoreteth shaarana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:11">menxe iitata otoreteth</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:11">ta kawushshana.<verse eid="ISA 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 13:12" />Attida asati muuruta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:12">worqqafe bollara al7o gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:12">ofire worqqafekka al7o gidana.<verse eid="ISA 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 13:13" />Hessa gishshas tani Ubbaafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:13">Wolqqama GODAY,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:13">‹Tani ta hanqo qonccisiza wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:13">salo qaaththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:13">sa7akka izi de7izason</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:13">kokkorsana› gees.<verse eid="ISA 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 13:14" />Shankkatizaadefe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:14">baqatiza genessa mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:14">heemmizaadey baynda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:14">dorsa wude mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:14">asi ubbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:14">ba asaakko asaakko simmana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:14">issoy issoy ba dere baqatana.<verse eid="ISA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 13:15" />Di7ettida ubbay cadettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:15">oykettida ubbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:15">mashshan hayqqana.<verse eid="ISA 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 13:16" />Istta ayfey be7ishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:16">istta nayta busakkana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:16">istta keeththatikka bonqqettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:16">istta machchetakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:16">haray gayttana» gees.<verse eid="ISA 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 13:17" />Be7ite, biras wudu gonttayta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:17">worqqankka ufayettonttayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:17">Meedoone dere asaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:17">ta istta bolla denththana.<verse eid="ISA 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 13:18" />Istta wondafeti wodallata wursana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:18">qeeri naytakka maarettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:18">istta wozinaykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:18">naytas mishettenna.<verse eid="ISA 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 13:19" />Kawoteththatas bonchcho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:19">Kaladaawetas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:19">ceeqo gidida Baabiloone</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:19">GODAY Sodoome malanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:19">Gamoora mala izo shiri yeggana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24">Medhe 19:24</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 13:20" />He biittan mulekka asi de7enna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:20">izin uttiza asikka deenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:20">Arabe asikka heen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:20">ba dunkaane tokkenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:20">mehe heemmizaytikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:20">bantta wude</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:20">heen shempisettenna.<verse eid="ISA 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 13:21" />Gido attiin bazzo do7ati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:21">heen ichchana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:21">izi keeththan worakanati kumana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:21">heen guttoti de7ana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:21">bazzon deysh misatiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:21">daydanththati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:21">izi bolla guppana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:14">Isa 34:14</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:14">Sofo 2:14</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:2">Ajju 18:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 13:22" />Izi miixan godareti waassana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:22">lo7iza izi kawoteththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:22">keeththaankka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:22">worakanati waassana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:22">izi wodey matides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:22">izi gallassayka aduqqenna.<verse eid="ISA 13:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ISA 14" />
  <para style="s1">Di7eteththafe Isra7eele Asaa Simo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 14:1" />GODAY Yaaqoobes</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:1">nam7anththo qadhettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:1">Isra7eelekka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:1">zaareththidi doorana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:1">Istta istta biittan woththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:1">imaththati yiidi Yaaqoobeso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:1">asaara walakettana.<verse eid="ISA 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 14:2" />Kawoteththati efidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:2">istta istta biitta zaarana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:2">Isra7eele asay kawoteththata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:2">baas oykkidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:2">maccassaanne attumasaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:2">aylle histtidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:2">GODAA biittan haarana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:2">Bana di7idayta zaari di7ana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:2">bana un7eththidayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:2">zaaridi haarana.<verse eid="ISA 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baabiloone Kawoy Hayqqidayta Bolla Gujeteth</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 14:3" />GODAY inttena intte waayeppe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:3">metoppenne un7eteththafenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:3">iita aylleteththafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:3">nena shemppisida gallassi,<verse eid="ISA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 14:4" />intte Baabiloone kawo bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:4">qilccishe, «Un7eththizayssas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:4">wodey waani wuridee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:4">izas giirissizayssi waani eqqidee!<verse eid="ISA 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 14:5" />GODAY iita xam7anne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:5">haarizayta kawoteththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:5">guufe menththides.<verse eid="ISA 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 14:6" />Kawoteththata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:6">pacey baynda shocidayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:6">qadhetay baynda gooddi gooddi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:6">qoxxidayssa menththides.<verse eid="ISA 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 14:7" />Biittaya saronne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:7">shempo demmadus;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:7">ufayssa mazamure yexxawus.<verse eid="ISA 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 14:8" />Haray attiin zigatikka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:8">Libaanoose xiiddatikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:8">ufayettida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:8">Nekka kundadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:8">mith qanxxizaadeyka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:8">hayssafe guye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:8">kaltta nu bolla denththenna.<verse eid="ISA 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 14:9" />«Neni yiza wode Si7ooley</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:9">nena mokkanaas giigettadus;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:9">nena mokki ekkana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:9">moytilleta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:9">alame bolla dere haarizayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:9">ubbata denththeththadus;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:9">qasse kawoteththata bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:9">kawotida kawota</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:9">istta araataappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:9">denththa essadus.<verse eid="ISA 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 14:10" />Istti nees,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:10">‹Nekka nu mala daaburadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:10">nu malakka gidadasa.<verse eid="ISA 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 14:11" />Ne bonchchoy diiththaa giirissara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:11">duge si7oole wodhdhides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:11">badati nees garsara hiixettida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:11">guxuneti nees bollara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:11">may7o gidana› gaana» geeta.<verse eid="ISA 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 14:12" />Nenoo wontta naazoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:12">torojje xoolinttezoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:12">ne waanada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:12">saloppe duge kundadii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:12">Kawoteththata kawushshida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:12">neni waanada duge yegettadii!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 8:10">Ajju 8:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 9:1">9:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 14:13" />Neni ne wozinan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:13">«Tani pude salo kezana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:13">ta kawoteththaa araataakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:13">Xoossaa xoolinttetappe bollara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:13">dhoqqan woththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:13">zuma bolla shiiqizason</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:13">anjjettida zumaa bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:13">dhoqqasohon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:13">ta kawoteththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:13">araata bolla uttana.<verse eid="ISA 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 14:14" />Tani shaarati diza dhoqqasohoppeka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:14">pude aadhdhana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:14">tani tana Ubbaafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:14">Dhoqqa Xoossa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:14">ooththana» gadasa.<verse eid="ISA 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 14:15" />Gido attiin neni si7oolen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:15">duge ciimma ollan yegettadasa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:13-15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:23">Mato 11:23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:15">Luqa 10:15</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 14:16" />Nena be7izayti ubbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:16">tishshi histti xeellidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:16">nena, «Biitta qaaththidayssinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:16">kawoteththata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:16">kokkorisidayssi hayssee?<verse eid="ISA 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 14:17" />Sa7a bazzo kessidayssi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:17">katamatakka laalliday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:17">di7ettidayti ba dere</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:17">simmi bontta mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:17">diggiday hayssee?» gaana.<verse eid="ISA 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 14:18" />Kawoteththata kawoti ubbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:18">bonchchon dhiskida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:18">ba duufon duufon shempida.<verse eid="ISA 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 14:19" />Ne gidikko koyettontta hagga mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:19">duufoppe wora olettadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:19">mashshan cadettidaytan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:19">duge ciimma shuchcha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:19">ollan wodhdhidaytan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:19">asa kushen hayqqidaytan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:19">kamettadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:19">neni tohon yedhettida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:19">aha mala gidadasa.<verse eid="ISA 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 14:20" />Neni isttara duufon daakka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:20">gaasoykka ne biittaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:20">bashshadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:20">ne dereza ne dhayssadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:20">iita ooththizayta zereththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:20">mulekka akeekettenna.<verse eid="ISA 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 14:21" />Istti dendidi biitta laattontta mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:21">alamen ba katama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:21">istti kunththontta mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:21">kase istta aawata nagara gaason</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:21">attuma nayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:21">siifettanaasoho giigsite.<verse eid="ISA 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 14:22" />Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAY,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:22">«Tani istta bolla dendana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:22">histtada istta sunththaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:22">isttafe attidayta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:22">istta zereththaanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:22">yeletaa Baabilooneppe dhayssana.<verse eid="ISA 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 14:23" />Tani Baabiloone quxarsa aqosonne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:23">care kessana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:23">bashsha peyxan tani izo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:23">pitta dhayssana» gees.<verse eid="ISA 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asoore Bolla Yootettida Tinbite</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 14:24" />Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAY,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:24">«Tani halchchida mala polettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:24">ta qoppida malakka hanana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 10:5-34">Isa 10:5-34</ref>; <ref loc="NAM 1:1-3:19">Naho 1:1—3:19</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:13-15">Sofo 2:13-15</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 14:25" />Tani Asoore ta biitta bolla liiqisana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:25">tani iza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:25">ta zuma bolla yedhdhana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:25">iza qambaray</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:25">ta dereza bollafe dendana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:25">iza toohoykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:25">istta hasheppe kichchana»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:25">gi caaqqides.<verse eid="ISA 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 14:26" />Sa7a ubbaas qofettida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:26">qofay hayssa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:26">kawoteththata ubbaa bollan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:26">micettida kushey hayssa.<verse eid="ISA 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 14:27" />Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAY</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:27">hayssa qoppides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:27">hessa iza oonee digganay?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:27">Izi ba kushe denththides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:27">hessa zaaranay oonee?<verse eid="ISA 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Filisxeemeta Bolla Yootettida Tinbite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 14:28" />Kawo Akaazey hayqqida layth hizgiza qaalay yides;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 16:20">2Kawo 16:20</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 18:27">2Taari 18:27</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 14:29" />Intteno Filisxeeme asatoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:29">inttena shocida guufey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:29">meqqida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:29">ubbati ufayettofte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:29">shooshshaa garsafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:29">haso shooshshi kezana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:29">iza zereththika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:29">xongettiza marzera</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:29">diza haso shoosh gidana.<verse eid="ISA 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 14:30" />Putteesa manqoti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:30">duussaso demmana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:30">metotanchchati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:30">woppu giidi ichchana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:30">Gido attiin tani ne zare</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:30">koshan wursana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:30">qasse neeppe attidaytakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:30">dippi histtana.<verse eid="ISA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 14:31" />«Nenoo pengezoo! Wuu! Wuy ga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:31">Nenoo katamazoo! Waassa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:31">Intteno Filisxeeme asatoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:31">Intte ubbayka hirgan seerite!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:31">Gaasoykka pudeha baggafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:31">cuway intte bolla yides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:31">he cifraappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:31">duuxxi attanay deenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:29-31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 47:1-7">Er 47:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:15-17">Hizi 25:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Iyu 3:4-8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:6-8">Amo 1:6-8</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:4-7">Sofo 2:4-7</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:5-7">Zaka 9:5-7</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 14:32" />He kawoteththatappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:32">kiitetti yiza qasttannetas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:32">ay gi zaaranee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:32">‹GODAY Xiyoone</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:32">minththi essides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:32">waaye ekkida derey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:32">izi garsan shemposo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:32">demmides› gi zaaro.»<verse eid="ISA 14:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ISA 15" />
  <para style="s1">Mo7aabe Bolla Yootettida Tinbite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 15:1" />Mo7aabe biitta gishshas GODAY yootida qaalay hayssa;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:1—16:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 25:10-12">Isa 25:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 48:1-47">Er 48:1-47</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:8-11">Hizi 25:8-11</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 2:1-3">Amo 2:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:8-11">Sofo 2:8-11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:1">Qiire-Mo7aaben diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:1">Eerey laalettadus;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:1">issi gallassa omarsan dippi gadus;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:1">qasse Qiire-Mo7aaben diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:1">Qiirey laalettadus;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:1">issi gallassa omars dippi gadus.<verse eid="ISA 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 15:2" />Diboone asay Xoossa keeth kezides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:2">yeekkanaas pude</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:2">zumbullata bolla kezides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:2">Mo7aabe asay Nebo gishshassinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:2">Medeba gishshas waassees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:2">hu7eynne buuchchay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:2">milxi gi meedettides.<verse eid="ISA 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 15:3" />Ogey dizaso ubbaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:3">maaqa may7eettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:3">pooqeta bollaninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:3">dabaabay dizason yeekkeettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:3">afunth gusseettes.<verse eid="ISA 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 15:4" />Hasebooneynne El7eeley waassida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:4">istta waasoykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:4">Yahaaxe gakkanaas seetettides.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:4">Hessa gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:4">Mo7aabe olanchchati waassida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:4">istta wozinaykka kokkorides.<verse eid="ISA 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 15:5" />Ta wozinay Mo7aabe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:5">gishshas yeekkides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:5">izippe goodettida asati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:5">Zo7aare gakkanaas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:5">Egilaate-Shalishiya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:5">gakkanaas baqatida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:5">istti afunth gussishe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:5">pude Luhite kezida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:5">qasse Horonayme</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:5">efiza ogera bishe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:5">bantti dhayanayssas waassida.<verse eid="ISA 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 15:6" />Nimiriime haaththati miccida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:6">maatay shullides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:6">caarechchayka dhaydes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:6">cilila miishshika beettenna.<verse eid="ISA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 15:7" />Hessa gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:7">istti haarida aqotanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:7">istti shiishshida haaro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:7">Ahaya shaafa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:7">tookki pinththeettes.<verse eid="ISA 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 15:8" />Istta waasoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:8">Mo7aabe zawa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:8">gakkanaas seetettees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:8">istta waasoy Egilayme gakkanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:8">istta zilasaykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:8">Bi7eeri-Eelime gakkees.<verse eid="ISA 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 15:9" />Dimoona shaafati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:9">suuththan kumida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:9">gidikkoka tani Dimoona bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:9">hessafe aadhdhizaaz ehana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:9">Mo7aabeppe baqatizayta bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:9">biittayn casha attidayta bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:9">gaammo yeddana.<verse eid="ISA 15:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ISA 16" />
  <para style="s1">Mo7aabes Hidota Dhayo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 16:1" />Bazzo biittafe he pinththan diza Seelappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:1">Xiyoone macca nay zuman</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:1">deraa haarizayssas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:1">dorsa laaqqa yeddite.<verse eid="ISA 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 16:2" />Bantta keeththafe goodettidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:2">waayettiza kafota mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:2">Mo7aabe maccassati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:2">Arnoone shaafa purden</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:2">hessaththo hanana.<verse eid="ISA 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 16:3" />Mo7aabe asay Yuhuda asaas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:3">«Nuus zore immite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:3">nuus pirdite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:3">seeta gallas intte eeshon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:3">omarsa dhuma mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:3">nuna kammite.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:3">Baqatidayta qottite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:3">goodettidaytakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:3">aaththi immofte.<verse eid="ISA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 16:4" />Mo7aabeppe goodettidayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:4">inttekon takketto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:4">istta dhayssizaytappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:4">istti qotetti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:4">attizasoho gidite» gees.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 16:4" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:4">Un7eththizayssas wurseththi yaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:4">bashshi attana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:4">otoranchchay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:4">biitta bollafe dhayana.<verse eid="ISA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 16:5" />Araatay siiqon minnees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:5">he araatan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:5">Dawite keeththafe gididay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:5">suure pirda amottizay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:5">xilloteth eesosizay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:5">issi asi ammaneteththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:5">iza bolla uttana.<verse eid="ISA 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 16:6" />Yuhuda asay, «Mo7aabeta hallaca,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:6">otoreteththaanne moodheteththa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:6">ceeqeteththaanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:6">kadheza siyidos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:6">gido attiin istta otoreteththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:6">hada» gaana.<verse eid="ISA 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 16:7" />Hessa gishshas Mo7aabeti waassana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:7">issi bolla Mo7aabes yeekkana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:7">Qiire-Hereesete katama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:7">asaa gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:7">yuushshi qoppidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:7">kayottishe yeekkana.<verse eid="ISA 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 16:8" />Haseboone goshsha gadeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:8">Seebama woyne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:8">miththati shullida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:8">kawoteththata haarizayti</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:8">Iyaazeere aadhdhi biidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:8">bazzo biitta kanththidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:8">bantta xapho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:8">abba gakkanaas yeddidayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:8">doorettida woyne miththata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:8">yedhettida.<verse eid="ISA 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 16:9" />Seebama woyne miththaa gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:9">Iyaazeera yeekkiza mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:9">tanikka yeekkays;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:9">Haseboonee! El7eelee!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:9">Tani ta afunththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:9">inttena looxikissays.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:9">Gaasoykka inttes miththa ayfeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:9">gakkida wode diza hombocaynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:9">kath shiishshiza wode diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:9">ufayssi attides.<verse eid="ISA 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 16:10" />Ufayssaynne ililisay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:10">ne atakiltey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:10">dizasoppe kichchides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:10">woyne tokkizasohon yexxiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:10">yeththay deenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:10">ilisikka attides.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:10">Woyne teera</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:10">gum7izasohoy deenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:10">gum7izayta hombocaakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:10">ta dhayssadis.<verse eid="ISA 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 16:11" />Hessa gishshas ta wozinay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:11">Mo7aabe gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:11">qadheta milas sissawus;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:11">Qiire-Hereeseta gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:11">ta maraceya yeekkawus.<verse eid="ISA 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 16:12" />Mo7aabey pude</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:12">ba zumbulla bolla kezikkoka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:12">daabura xalla;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:12">iza woosas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:12">ba eeqa keeth gelikkoka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:12">go7ay deenna.<verse eid="ISA 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 16:13" />GODAY Mo7aabe gishshas kaseti yootida qaalay hayssa. <verse eid="ISA 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 16:14" />Ha7i gidikko GODAY, qaxxaretti ooththiza oosanchchay gallas qoodiza mala Mo7aabe bonchchoynne asaa corateththay heedzdzu layththa giddon kawuyana; heen attida asati guuththatanne wolqqay bayndayta gidana.<verse eid="ISA 16:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ISA 17" />
  <para style="s1">Damasqo Bollanne Isra7eele Bolla Xoossa Qixaate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 17:1" />Damasqo gishshas,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:1">«Be7ite, hayssafe sinththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:1">Damasqo katamateththi attana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:1">laaleththa doore gidana.<verse eid="ISA 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 17:2" />Aaro7eere katamati kays gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:2">mehe heenththasoho gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:2">istta babisiza miishshika deenna.<verse eid="ISA 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 17:3" />Gimbettida katamay Efreemeppe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:3">kawoteththa maatay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:3">Damasqofe dhayana;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:3">Aaraameppe casha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:3">attidayta bonchchoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:3">Isra7eeletayssa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:3">kawuyana» gees</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:3">Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAY.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:1-3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 49:23-27">Er 49:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:3-5">Amo 1:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:1">Zaka 9:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 17:4" />«He wode Yaaqoobe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:4">bonchchoy shaarumatana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:4">iza modhdhoteththaykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:4">shuumana.<verse eid="ISA 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 17:5" />Kath maxizaadey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:5">eqqida kaththaa shiishshidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:5">modhe ba kushen maxiza mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:5">Erafayme shoobbafe maxettiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:5">pushulo mala gidana.<verse eid="ISA 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 17:6" />Wogara mith shociin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:6">nam7u woykko heedzdzu ayfeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:6">hagga xeera bolla attiza mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:6">oyddu woykko ichchash ayfeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:6">dhippi gida haggata bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:6">attiza mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:6">guuththa haggati attana»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:6">gi GODAA Isra7eele</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:6">Xoossay haasaydes.<verse eid="ISA 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 17:7" />He wode asay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:7">bana Medhdhidayssako xeellana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:7">istta ayfey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:7">Isra7eele Geeshshaako xeellana.<verse eid="ISA 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 17:8" />Istti bantta kushen ooththida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:8">yarshosohota xeellettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:8">istti bantta eeqatas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:8">exaane cu7asizasohotassinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:8">Asheeris goynnana essida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:8">tuussatas bonchcho imettenna.<verse eid="ISA 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 17:9" />He wode Isra7eele asaa gaason</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:9">boshettontta attida mino katamati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:9">woranne aykkoy bayndaso gidana.<verse eid="ISA 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 17:10" />Nena ashshiza Xoossaa baladasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:10">ne izan qotetta attiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:10">ne zaallaka akeekabeekka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:10">hessa neni doorettida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:10">atakilte tokkikokka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:10">ooraththa zereth ne zerikkoka,<verse eid="ISA 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 17:11" />ne tokkida gallas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:11">izi mokkana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:11">ne ooththikokka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:11">ne zerida wonteththa gallas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:11">izi ciiyana mala ne ooththikokka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:11">he kaththay hargeninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:11">paxontta sakon mulera dhayana.<verse eid="ISA 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Morkke Kawoteththata Xooneteth</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 17:12" />Be7a, daro asaa hanqo giirissi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:12">abba dambala mala giirees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:12">be7a, asaa waaso daroy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:12">wolqqama haaththa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:12">guummees.<verse eid="ISA 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 17:13" />Asay wolqqama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:13">haaththa mala guummikkoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:13">izi istta seerikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:13">zumbulla bollara carkon biza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:13">gudulla mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:13">gote carkoy laalliza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:13">happa mala laalettana.<verse eid="ISA 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 17:14" />Hekko Sa7ay qammishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:14">qofay baynda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:14">shiro gidides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:14">sa7ay wonttanaappe kasetidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:14">oonikka beettibeenna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:14">Nu aqota bonqqidayta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:14">ubbaa wolqqan ekkizayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:14">qaaday hessa.<verse eid="ISA 17:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ISA 18" />
  <para style="s1">Tophphiya Bolla Yootettida Tinbite</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 18:1" />Tophphiya shaafata matan diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:1">giirettiza qefey diza biittays</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:1">aayye ana!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:1-7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEP 2:12">Sofo 2:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 18:2" />He biittaya qasttanneta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:2">shaccafe oosettida wogolon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:2">abba bollara shaafappe he pinth</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:2">kiita yeddizaaro.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:2">Intteno pilata qasttannetoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:2">Adussanne bolla shugo asataakko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:2">haakoninne matan dizay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:2">isttas yayyiza deretakko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:2">wolqqamanne qaalay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:2">erettontta deretakko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:2">shaafa haaththati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:2">iza dere shaakki biza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:2">kawoteththaako biite.<verse eid="ISA 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 18:3" />Intteno sa7a bolla diza as ubbatoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:3">zumata bolla malatay kaqettishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:3">intte be7ana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:3">zayey punettishin intte siyana.<verse eid="ISA 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 18:4" />GODAY taas, «Ta co7u ga uttana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:4">seeta gallas awa seelan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:4">xolqettiza misha mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:4">bone hombe mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:4">shaarappe bukkiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:4">ira mala gidada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:4">ta xeellana» gides.<verse eid="ISA 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 18:5" />Kath maxiza wodeppe kase</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:5">ciishsha wodey aadhdhishin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:5">ciishshay gakkidi woyney</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:5">ayfe ayfana gishin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:5">woyne bolla diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:5">koshshonttayssa xunqqana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:5">daayida haggatakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:5">qanxxereththi diggana.<verse eid="ISA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 18:6" />Istti ubbayka zuma bolla diidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:6">baqqi miza kafotassinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:6">bazzo do7atas attana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:6">kafoti bone kumeth</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:6">mishe shaaccana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:6">bazzo do7ati balgo ubbaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:6">mishe shaaccana.<verse eid="ISA 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 18:7" />He wode GODAAS</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:7">Ubbaafe Wolqqama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:7">Xoossaas adussanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:7">liiqo asaappe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:7">matappe haahoppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:7">yayyiza dereppe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:7">wolqqamanne iza qaalay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:7">erettontta dereppe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:7">shaafati shaakki biza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:7">kawoteththafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:7">imotay yaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:7">medheteththa GODAY dizaso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:7">pude Xiyoone zuma bolla yaana.<verse eid="ISA 18:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ISA 19" />
  <para style="s1">Gibxe Bolla Yootettida Tinbite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 19:1" />Gibxe gishshas yootettida qaalay,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:1">«Be7ite, GODAY eesotiza shaara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:1">toggidi Gibxe yees.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:1">Gibxe eeqa xoossati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:1">iza sinththan kokkoreettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:1">Gibxe wozinay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:1">istta giddon seerees» gees.<verse eid="ISA 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 19:2" />«Tani Gibxeta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:2">issaa issaa bolla denththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:2">ishay ishara, shooroy shoorora,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:2">katamay katamara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:2">kawoy kawora olettana.<verse eid="ISA 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 19:3" />Gibxeta wozinay labettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:3">tani istta halchcho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:3">hada ooththana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:3">Istta eeqa xoossatanne moytilleta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:3">tuna ayana xeygizaytanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:3">marota zore oychchana.<verse eid="ISA 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 19:4" />Qasse menxe iita asa kushen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:4">ta Gibxeta aaththa immana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:4">babisiza kawoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:4">istta haarana» gees</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:4">GODAY, Ubbaafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:4">Wolqqama Xoossay.<verse eid="ISA 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 19:5" />Abbaye shaafa haaththi paccana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:5">haaththi guuxxi guuxxi melana.<verse eid="ISA 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 19:6" />Zara haaththati xinqqana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:6">Gibxe kanchcheti micci dhayana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:6">shaccatinne care</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:6">maatati shullana.<verse eid="ISA 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 19:7" />Abbaye shaafa lanqen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:7">haaththa matan diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:7">miththati shullana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:7">shaafaa matan zerettida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:7">kath ubbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:7">carkon pitetti dhayana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:7">aykkoyka attenna.<verse eid="ISA 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 19:8" />Mole oykkizayti ceecana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:8">Abbaye shaafan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:8">gaattile yeggizayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:8">ubbay yeekkana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:8">haaththa bolla bantta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:8">gite yeggizayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:8">ubbaa wolqqay ixxana.<verse eid="ISA 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 19:9" />Paatettida talbba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:9">suqizayti dhayana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:9">qasse booththa puuttofe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:9">may7o dadizayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:9">hidota qanxxana.<verse eid="ISA 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 19:10" />May7o dadizayti ceecana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:10">damozan aqizayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:10">wozinay meqqana.<verse eid="ISA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 19:11" />Xaanoose biitta halaqati keehi eeya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:11">aadho eranchcha gidida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:11">kawo Paaroone aadho eranchchata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:11">zorey hada.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:11">Paaroones, «Tani aadho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:11">eranchchatappe issaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:11">tani kase kawota kaallizaade»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:11">waanidi geetii?<verse eid="ISA 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 19:12" />Intte aadho eranchchati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:12">ha7i awan dizoo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:12">Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAY</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:12">Gibxe bolla ooththana qoppidayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:12">ane inttena bessettonne erisetto.<verse eid="ISA 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 19:13" />Xaanoose halaqati eeyda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:13">Memppisa shuumeti balettida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:13">izi dere kaaleththiza erettidayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:13">Gibxe asaa baleththida.<verse eid="ISA 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 19:14" />GODAY istta bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:14">dochchiza ayana gussides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:14">maththottida asi ba cooshshan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:14">gandigarza mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:14">Gibxey ba ooso ubbaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:14">gandigarana mala ooththida.<verse eid="ISA 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 19:15" />Kace woykko goyna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:15">zamba woykko shacca</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:15">heyti ubbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:15">Gibxes aykkoka maadettenna.<verse eid="ISA 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 19:16" />He wode Gibxe asay maccassa mala gidana. Qasse Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAY istta bolla ba qese denththiza wode istti yashshan kokkorana. <verse eid="ISA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 19:17" />Yuhuda asay Gibxe asaa bolla shiro denththeththana; Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAY istta bollan ooththana halchchida halchchofe dendidayssan Yuhuda gishshas siyida ubbay shirotana.<verse eid="ISA 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 19:18" />He wode Gibxe biittan diza ichchash katamati Kanaane qaalan haasayana; Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAA bagga gidanaas caaqqana. He katamatappe issiniya Bashsha Katama geetetta xeygettana.<verse eid="ISA 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 19:19" />He wode Gibxe biittan GODAAS yarshosoy oosettana; qasse Gibxe biitta zawan GODAAS tuussi eqqana. <verse eid="ISA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 19:20" />Hessi Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAAS Gibxe biittan malatanne markka gidana; istti banttana un7eththizaytappe dendidayssan GODAAKKO waassiza wode izi istta ashshizaadenne maaddizaade kiittidi istta ashshana. <verse eid="ISA 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 19:21" />GODAY bana Gibxetas qonccisana; isttika he gallas GODAA erana; yarshoninne kaththa yarshon iza goynnana. Istti GODAAS adinettana; ba adinettidayssaka gaththana. <verse eid="ISA 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 19:22" />GODAY Gibxe boshan shocana; zaaridikka istta paththana; isttika GODAAKKO simmana; izikka istta woosa siyidi istta paththana.<verse eid="ISA 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 19:23" />He wode Gibxeppe Asoore gakkanaas wogga ogey oosettana; Asooreti Gibxe, Gibxe asay Asoore baana; qasse Gibxetinne Asooreti issi bolla goynnana. <verse eid="ISA 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 19:24" />He wode Isra7eeley biittas anjjo gidanaas heedzdzanththo maaran Gibxeranne Asoorera issife qoodettana. <verse eid="ISA 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 19:25" />Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAY isttas, «Ta dere Gibxey, ta kushey medhdhida Asoorey, ta xinxxo Isra7eeley anjjettidayta gidetto» gi anjjana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:1-25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 46:2-26">Er 46:2-26</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 29:1-32:32">Hizi 29:1—32:32</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 19:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ISA 20" />
  <para style="s1">Gibxe Bollanne Tophphiya Bolla Yootettida Tinbite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 20:1" />Asoore kawo Sarggooney ola gadawaa kiittiin Ashdoode geetettiza Filisxeeme katama oli oykkida layth, <verse eid="ISA 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 20:2" />he wode GODAY Amoxe naa Isayaasa, «Maaqa ne bollafe qaara; ne caammaa tohoppe kessa» gi yootides; izikka hessaththo ooththides; kallonne caammay baynda simerettides.<verse eid="ISA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 20:3" />Hessafe GODAY, «Ta aylle Isayaasi Gibxe bollanne Tophphiya bolla gakkanayssas malata gidana mala heedzdzu layth may7o may7onttanne caamma aaththontta de7ida mala, <verse eid="ISA 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 20:4" />Asoore kawoy Gibxeppe di7ettida cimatanne yelagata, Tophphiyappe beti yidayta kallonne caamma aaththontta ekki baana; istti duca kallo qaari yeggidi yedereththishe Gibxeta kawushshana. <verse eid="ISA 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 20:5" />Tophphiya hidota ooththidaytinne Gibxen ceeqettizayti babbananne kawuyana. <verse eid="ISA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 20:6" />He wode abbaa matan de7iza derey, ‹Kase istti ceeqettidayti, Asoore kawoppe attanaassinne la7a kezanaas nu istta giddon qotettidayta aazi gakkidaakko ane xeellite; histtiin nuni waani kessi ekki attanee? gaana› » gides.<verse eid="ISA 20:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ISA 21" />
  <para style="s1">Baabiloone Bolla Yootettida Tinbite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 21:1" />Abba lanqen diza bazzo biittas yootettida GODAA qaalay hayssafe kaallizayssa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:1">Dugeha baggafe gote carkoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:1">pitti ekki yiza mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:1">worajjizay shiro denththeththiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:1">bazzo biittafe yees.<verse eid="ISA 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 21:2" />Yashshiza ajjuuta ta be7adis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:2">aaththi immizayssi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:2">aaththi immees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:2">di7izayssi di7ees.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:2">Elaame denda!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:2">Meedoone giddoththa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:2">iza gaththida waaye ubbaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:2">ta essana.<verse eid="ISA 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 21:3" />Hessa gishshas ta xeessay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:3">sako xalala gidides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:3">miixay oykkida maccassa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:3">tana leessoy oykkides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:3">tani siyida yo7oy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:3">tana gadigadissides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:3">ta be7ida yo7on shirotadis.<verse eid="ISA 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 21:4" />Ta wozinay poddu gides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:4">tana yashshi kokkorisides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:4">ta ufayssan naagida omarsay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:4">ta bolla hirga yeggides.<verse eid="ISA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 21:5" />Istti maadda giigsida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:5">uttizaso giigsida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:5">midanne uyida.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:5">Intteno shuumetoo dendite!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:5">gondalleza zayten quccite!<verse eid="ISA 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 21:6" />GODAY tana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:6">«Ba; wochchiza as woththa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:6">izi ba be7idayssa yooto.<verse eid="ISA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 21:7" />Paran gooshettiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:7">para-gaareta be7iza wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:7">hare toggizayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:7">gaamella toggizayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:7">be7iza wode izi yuushshi qoppo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:7">lo7eththi wochcho» gides.<verse eid="ISA 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 21:8" />Naagizayssika waassishe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:8">«Godawu, tani gallas gallas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:8">pacey baynda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:8">shakko bolla eqqadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:8">omars ubbaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:8">ta naagizasohon eqqadis.<verse eid="ISA 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 21:9" />Be7ite, issi asi paratan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:9">gooshettiza para-gaaretan yides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:9">histtidi, ‹Baabilooney</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:9">kundadus! Kundadus!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:9">izi eeqa xoossa misletikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:9">meqeretti gaden kundida›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:9">gi zaarides» gi waassides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 14:8">Ajju 14:8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:2">18:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 21:10" />Balen bukettida ta derezoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:10">Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAA</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:10">Isra7eele Xoossafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:10">ta siyida qaala nees yootays.<verse eid="ISA 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eedoome Bolla Yootettida Tinbite</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 21:11" />Eedoome gishshas yootettida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:11">mino yo7o;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:11">issi asi Seyreppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:11">tana xeygidi «Naagizayssoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:11">Gadey wonttanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:11">ay keena saatey attidee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:11">Naagizayssoo! Gadey wonttanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:11">ay keena saatey attidee?» gides.<verse eid="ISA 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 21:12" />Naagizayssi zaaridi, «Wonttana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:12">gido attiin simmidi qammana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:12">oychchana koykko oychchite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:12">gido attiin simmidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:12">haa yiite» gides.<verse eid="ISA 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Arabe Bolla Yootettida Tinbite</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 21:13" />Arabe gishshas yootettida mino yo7o;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:13">Intteno Dadaane zal7anchchatoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:13">intte intte caana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:13">gaamellatara Arabe bazzon aqana.<verse eid="ISA 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 21:14" />Saamettidaytas haath ehite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:14">intteno Temaanen dizaytoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:14">Bete asatas kath ehite.<verse eid="ISA 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 21:15" />Istti giththa mashshafenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:15">koohoppe shodettida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:15">giththa mashshafe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:15">waaxettida wondafeppenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:15">suullida olappe baqatida.<verse eid="ISA 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 21:16" />GODAY tana, «Konttiraate oosanchcha ooso gallassi wuriza mala issi layththa giddon Qeedaare bonchchoy ubbay wurana. <verse eid="ISA 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 21:17" />Qeedaare biittan wondafen dukkiza wolqqama olanchchatappe guuththati attana; hessa GODAA Isra7eele Xoossay yootides» gides.<verse eid="ISA 21:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ISA 22" />
  <para style="s1">Yerusalaame Bolla Yootettida Tinbite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 22:1" />Ajjuuta zulle bolla yootettida mino yo7o;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:1">Inttena aazi metiin ubbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:1">pooqe bolla kezidetii?<verse eid="ISA 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 22:2" />Hanne wocamay kumida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:2">katamayee!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:2">Shiroynne dirbbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:2">kumida katamayee!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:2">Neeppe hayqqidayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:2">mashshan hayqqibeettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:2">woykko olan hayqqibeettenna.<verse eid="ISA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 22:3" />Nena ayssizayti ubbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:3">issife baqatida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:3">wondafe denththontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:3">dishe di7ettida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:3">morkkey haahon dishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:3">baqatida ubbatoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:3">Intte oykettidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:3">issi bolla qashettideta.<verse eid="ISA 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 22:4" />Hessa gishshas tani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:4">«Taappe haakkite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:4">ane camo yeeho ta yeekkays;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:4">dhayda ta asaa gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:4">tana minththeththana qoppofte» gadis.<verse eid="ISA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 22:5" />GODAY Ubbaafe Wolqqama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:5">Xoossay Ajjuuta Zullen wocama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:5">dirbbanne shiro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:5">dirsata laaleththinne zumatakko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:5">waaso gallassi dees.<verse eid="ISA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 22:6" />Elaamey wondafe yiishsha kooho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:6">ba paratanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:6">para-gaareta giigsides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:6">Qiireykka ba gondalle oykkides.<verse eid="ISA 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 22:7" />Lo7o zulleti para-gaaretan kumida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:7">toga asati katamay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:7">pengen eqqida.<verse eid="ISA 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 22:8" />Yuhuda miixata laallida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:8">he wode wora giddon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:8">minjja keeththan diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:8">ola massara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:8">ne xeelladasa.<verse eid="ISA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 22:9" />Dawite katamay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:9">daro laalettidayssa be7ideta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:9">duge baggara haath eelissideta.<verse eid="ISA 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 22:10" />Yerusalaamen diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:10">keeththata qoodideta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:10">dirsaa ooraththanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:10">keeththata laallideta.<verse eid="ISA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 22:11" />Kase gal7a eele haaththaa zaaridi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:11">iza minjjizaso nam7u gimbetappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:11">giddon giigsideta.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:11">Gido attiin intte hessa ooththiday</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:11">oonakko eribeekketa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:11">koyro halchchi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:11">ooththidayssa akeekibeekketa.<verse eid="ISA 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 22:12" />He gallas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:12">GODAY Ubbaafe Wolqqama Xoossay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:12">intte yeekkana malanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:12">waassana mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:12">intte hu7e binana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:12">buucana malanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:12">maaqa may7ana mala xeygides.<verse eid="ISA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 22:13" />Gido attiin injjenne ufays,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:13">booranne dharsho shukay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:13">asho muussinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:13">woyne ushshi dees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:13">«Nuni wonto hayqqana gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:13">ane moossinne uyoos» gideta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:32">1Qoro 15:32</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 22:14" />GODAY Ubbaafe Wolqqama Xoossay hayssafe kaallizayssa taas qonccisides; izakka ta hayththan siyadis; «Hayssi ha nagarazi intte hayqqana gakkanaas wursiin wurenna.»<verse eid="ISA 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 22:15" />GODAY, GODAY Ubbaafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:15">Wolqqama Xoossay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:15">«Baada kawo keeththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:15">alaafe Sheebina,<verse eid="ISA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 22:16" />Hayssan ay ooththay?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:16">Hayssa nees duufo giigsanaas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:16">dhoqqasohon ne moogettanaaso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:16">woocanaas, ne ahay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:16">uttanaaso zaalla woocanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:16">ooni nena azazidee?<verse eid="ISA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 22:17" />Haysso mino addezoo! Naagetta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:17">GODAY nena minththi oykkidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:17">ba kushen cuucumi oykkidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:17">olana hanees.<verse eid="ISA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 22:18" />Nena yanbarsha mala yuushshidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:18">aako biittan olana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:18">ne godaa keeththas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:18">ne yeella gidadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:18">ne heen hayqqana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:18">ne bonchcho para-gaaretikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:18">heen attana.<verse eid="ISA 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 22:19" />Ne bonchchettidasoppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:19">ta nena kawushshana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:19">alaafeteththaafekka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:19">ne goodettana» ga.<verse eid="ISA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 22:20" />«He gallas tani Kilqiyaasa naa ta ashkara Elyaaqeeme xeygana. <verse eid="ISA 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 22:21" />Ne seeloza ta iza mayzana; ne giththaa iza gixissana; ne daannateththaaka ta izas aaththa immana. Izi Yerusalaamen diza asaassinne Yuhuda asaas aawa gidana. <verse eid="ISA 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 22:22" />Tani Dawite keeththa qulpe iza hashen woththana; izi doyiin oonikka gordenna; izi gordiin oonikka doyenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 3:7">Ajju 3:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ISA 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 22:23" />Tani iza ammanettizasohon dhishke mala essana; izi ba aawa keeththas bonchcho araata gidana. <verse eid="ISA 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 22:24" />Qeeri xaaroppe biidi baath gakkanaas soon diza miish ubbaa kocan kaqqiza mala iza aawa keeththa bonchcho ubbay naytappe biidi naa naa gakkanaas iza bolla qaaphettana» gides.<verse eid="ISA 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 22:25" />GODAY Ubbaafe Wolqqama Xoossay, «He gallas ammanththizason eqqida dhishkey shodettana; meqqi wodhdhana; iza bolla kaqettida ubbay kundidi meqerettana» gides; hayssa GODAY yootides.<verse eid="ISA 22:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ISA 23" />
  <para style="s1">Xiroose Bolla Yootettida Tinbite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 23:1" />Xiroose bolla yootettida mino yo7o;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:1">Xiroosey dippi gi dhayda gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:1">Tarseese markabetoo waassite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:1">keeththinne wodebey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:1">bayndaso gidadus.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:1">Qophiroose biittafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:1">worey kezides.<verse eid="ISA 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 23:2" />Intteno harurotoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:2">Intteno duretida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:2">Sidoona zal7anchchatoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:2">Co7u giite!<verse eid="ISA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 23:3" />Gita abbaara Shihooreppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:3">Xirooses kaththi yees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:3">Xiroose aqotay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:3">Abbayeppe beettees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:3">iza kawoteththatas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:3">zal7e baach gidadus.<verse eid="ISA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 23:4" />Hanne Sidoona katamayee!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:4">Hanne abba miixaye neni yeellata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:4">abbay, «Tani miixatabeekke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:4">naakka yelabeekke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:4">attuma naytanne macca nayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:4">dichchabeekke» gides.<verse eid="ISA 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 23:5" />Xirooseppe keziza paapunththay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:5">Gibxe biittan siyettiza wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:5">istti ceecana.<verse eid="ISA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 23:6" />Intteno harurotoo! Zilalite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:6">Tarseese pinnite.<verse eid="ISA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 23:7" />Izi tohoy izo haako dere efidaara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:7">heen iza uttana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:7">ooththidaara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:7">kase beni katamaya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:7">injjenne ufayssa katamaya hannii?<verse eid="ISA 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 23:8" />Kallachcha goxissidaari bolla,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:8">ba zal7anchchata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:8">daannasidaari bolla,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:8">biitta bolla bonchchettidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:8">bayzizaytinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:8">laammizayti izin diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:8">Xiroosi bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:8">hayssa qoppiday oonee?<verse eid="ISA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 23:9" />Otorettizayta ubbaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:9">bonchcho kawushshanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:9">qasse biittaa bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:9">dhoqqu dhoqqu gidayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:9">ziqqi histtanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:9">GODAY Ubbaafe Wolqqama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:9">Xoossay halchchides.<verse eid="ISA 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 23:10" />Intteno Tarseese biitta asatoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:10">Inttena teqqizay baynda gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:10">Abbaye shaafa mala intte</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:10">biitta bollan kumidi goggite.<verse eid="ISA 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 23:11" />GODAY ba kusheza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:11">abba bolla miccides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:11">izi kawoteththatakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:11">daganththides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:11">Kanaane miixati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:11">laalettana mala azazides.<verse eid="ISA 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 23:12" />Qasseka, «Hanne qoxettida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:12">Sidoona geela7oyee!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:12">Hayssafe guye ufayettofa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:12">denda Qophiroose pinna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:12">heenkka ne saro demmaka» gides.<verse eid="ISA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 23:13" />Ane Baabiloone biitta be7ite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:13">he biitta asay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:13">paththontta as gidides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:13">Asoore asay izo bazzo do7as</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:13">gufaso kessides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:13">istti bantta shakkota</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:13">izi bolla gimbida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:13">izi miixata laallida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:13">budhettoyssi doore gidides.<verse eid="ISA 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 23:14" />Intteno Tarseese</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:14">markabetoo, waassite!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:14">Intte miixay laalettides.<verse eid="ISA 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 23:15" />He wode Xiroose katamay issi kawos de7o layththa keena laappun tammu layth dogettana; hessafe guye layma maccassay gishshas yexettida yeththi Xiroose bolla yexettana.<verse eid="ISA 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 23:16" />Istti, «Hanne dogettida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:16">layma maccassayee!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:16">bagana denththa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:16">katamay giddon yuuya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:16">ne hassa7ettana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:16">baganaa lo7eththa shoca;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:16">daro mazamure yexxa» gaana.<verse eid="ISA 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 23:17" />Laappun tammu layththi polettidaappe guye GODAY Xiroose qoppana; gido attiin iza kase ba layma ooson simmana; sa7a bolla kawoteththata ubbaara ba laymateththa zal7e zal7ana. <verse eid="ISA 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 23:18" />Gidikkoka iza demmida ubbaynne wodhey GODAAS dummatana; dagattennanne suuddenna; izi wodhey GODAA sinththan de7izaytas palahida kaththinne lo7o may7o gidana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:1-18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 26:1-28:19">Hizi 26:1—28:19</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Iyu 3:4-8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:9-10">Amo 1:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:1-4">Zaka 9:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:21-22">Mato 11:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:13-14">Luqa 10:13-14</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 23:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ISA 24" />
  <para style="s1">Goday Sa7a Bolla Ehana Qixaate</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 24:1" />Be7ite! GODAY biittaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:1">bula kessana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:1">mulera dhayssana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:1">budheththa doore histtana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:1">izin diza asaa laallana.<verse eid="ISA 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 24:2" />Ubbaa miishshika issi mala gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:2">dereza bolla hanzayssi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:2">qeeseza bolla hanana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:2">aylle bolla hanzayssi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:2">godaa bolla hanana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:2">ashkaray bolla hanzayssi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:2">godattey bolla hanana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:2">shammizayssa bolla hanzayssi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:2">bayzizayssa bolla hanana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:2">tal7e ekkizayssa bolla hanzayssi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:2">tal7e immizayssa bolla hanana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:2">aco ciggizayssa bolla hanzayssi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:2">aco cigissizayssa bolla hanana.<verse eid="ISA 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 24:3" />Biittay mulera bula gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:3">mulera bonqqettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:3">ha qaalaa GODAY haasaydes.<verse eid="ISA 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 24:4" />Biittaya melana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:4">izin diza ubbay qokkana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:4">alamey daaburana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:4">biitta bolla erettida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:4">gita asati daaburana.<verse eid="ISA 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 24:5" />Biittay ba asaan tunadus;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:5">istti woga menththida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:5">maaraa moorida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:5">mernaa caaqo qaala menththida.<verse eid="ISA 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 24:6" />Hessa gishshas qanggeththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:6">biittaa mees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:6">izin de7iza dereti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:6">bantta mooron</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:6">qaxxayettana bessees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:6">Hessa gishshas sa7a bolla diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:6">asati xuugettida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:6">isttafe qoodan guuththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:6">asati attida.<verse eid="ISA 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 24:7" />Woyne turay meliin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:7">woyne ushshi wurides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:7">kase ufayettiza ubbay ceecides.<verse eid="ISA 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 24:8" />Ufayssan karabe baqay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:8">co7u gides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:8">kaa7izayta hombocaykka eqqides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:8">ufayssiza diiththa giirissi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:8">co7u gides.<verse eid="ISA 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 24:9" />Hayssafe guye istti yexxishe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:9">woyne ushshu uyettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:9">ushshayka uyizayta cammana.<verse eid="ISA 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 24:10" />Laalettida katamaya kayzadus;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:10">keeththa pengetikka gordettida.<verse eid="ISA 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 24:11" />Woyne ushsha gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:11">dubbushan waasseettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:11">ufayssi ubbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:11">ceecen laamettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:11">homboca kaassi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:11">biitta bollafe dhaydes.<verse eid="ISA 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 24:12" />Katamaya mulera laalettadus;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:12">pengetikka meqeretti kundida.<verse eid="ISA 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 24:13" />Wogara miththa ayfe shoci qoqofiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:13">woyne miththa qanxxi ekkiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:13">attiza attida pushulo mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:13">biittaa bolla, kawoteththata bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:13">hessaththo hanana.<verse eid="ISA 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 24:14" />Istti bantta qaalaa dhoqqu histtidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:14">ufayssan yexxana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:14">arshey wulliza baggafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:14">GODAA gitateththa yootana.<verse eid="ISA 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 24:15" />Hessa gishshas arshey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:15">mokkiza baggara dizaytoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:15">abban diza haruroti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:15">GODAA Isra7eele Xoossaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:15">sunththaa dhoqqu dhoqqu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:15">histtite.<verse eid="ISA 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 24:16" />Biittaa gaxaappe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:16">«Xillozas bonchchoy gido»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:16">giza mazamure nu siyidos;</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 24:16" />
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:16">«Tani gidikko gilqada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:16">meqeth attadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:16">Tana aayye ana!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:16">Kaddizayti kaddeettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:16">aaththi immizayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:16">aaththi immeettes» gadis.<verse eid="ISA 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 24:17" />Intteno sa7a bollan diza asatoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:17">dagamay, ollaynne woximadey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:17">inttena naagees.<verse eid="ISA 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 24:18" />Salo maskooteti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:18">doyettida gishshas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:18">biitta yochchatikka qaaxxida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:18">shiroppe baqatizay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:18">ollan kundana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:18">ollafe kessi ekkidaykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:18">woximaden oykettana.<verse eid="ISA 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 24:19" />Biittay qaaxxides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:19">za7idessinne phalqetti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:19">wodhdhides.<verse eid="ISA 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 24:20" />Biittay maththottida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:20">asa mala yiicotides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:20">carkoy sugida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:20">gaabba mala gidadus.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:20">Biitta makkallateththay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:20">deexo gidida gishshas kundana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:20">nam7anththoka simmi dendenna.<verse eid="ISA 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 24:21" />He gallas GODAY</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:21">bolla salon diza wolqqamata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:21">gars biitta bolla diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:21">kawotakka qaxxayana.<verse eid="ISA 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 24:22" />Istti ollan diza qasho asa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:22">issi bolla uucettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:22">istti qasho keeththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:22">gordetti uttana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:22">daro wodeppe guye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:22">istti pirda ekkana shiiqana.<verse eid="ISA 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 24:23" />Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAY</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:23">Xiyoone zumaninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:23">Yerusalaamen cimata sinththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:23">bonchchon kawotana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:23">he wode aginay shaaphettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:23">awa ayfeykka yeellatana.<verse eid="ISA 24:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ISA 25" />
  <para style="s1">Xoossas Shiiqiza Galata</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 25:1" />Abeet GODAWU!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:1">Neni ta Xoossaa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:1">Tani nena</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:1">dhoqqu dhoqqu histtana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:1">ne sunththaaka sabbana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:1">Gaasoykka benippe qofettidayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:1">malalisiza hano kumeththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:1">ammaneteththan ooththadasa.<verse eid="ISA 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 25:2" />Neni katamayo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:2">shuchcha doore ooththadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:2">gimbettida katamayokka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:2">laalladasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:2">hayssafe sinththan gimbettida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:2">allagata katamati deettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:2">Simmidi mulekka oosetettenna.<verse eid="ISA 25:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 25:3" />Hessa gishshas mino dereti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:3">nena bonchchana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:3">menxe iita kawoteththati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:3">nees yayyana.<verse eid="ISA 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 25:4" />Neni hiyeesatas zemppo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:4">Metotanchchatas meto wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:4">neni zemppo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:4">gote carkofe geemmi attizaso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:4">awa seelappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:4">kuwattizaso gidadasa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:4">Gaasoykka menxe iitata peenoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:4">keeththa godara icettiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:4">gote carko mala.<verse eid="ISA 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 25:5" />Bazzo biitta seela mala.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:5">Allaga otoreteththa waaso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:5">co7u ooththaasa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:5">Awa seelay shaaraa kuwan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:5">irxxiza mala menxe iitata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:5">mazamure sirphi gaana.<verse eid="ISA 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 25:6" />GODAY Ubbaafe Wolqqama Xoossay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:6">hayssa zumaa bolla dere ubbaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:6">gidiza gita gibiraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:6">lo7i kaxxida woyne ushshu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:6">lo7o ashonne doorettida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:6">woyne ushshu giigsana.<verse eid="ISA 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 25:7" />Hayssa ha zumaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:7">dere ubbaa bollan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:7">wodhdhida magalasha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:7">kawoteththata ubbaa goozi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:7">oykkida goossaa izi dhayssana.<verse eid="ISA 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 25:8" />Hayqo izi mernaas mittana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:8">Ubbaa Haariza GODAY</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:8">asa ubbaa ayfeppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:8">afunththu quccana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:8">ba deraa kawushshateth</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:8">biitta ubbaafe diggana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:8">Hayssa GODAY haasaydes.<verse eid="ISA 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 25:9" />He gallas isttas, «Be7ite</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:9">nu Xoossay hayssa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:9">nuni izan ammanettidos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:9">izikka nuna ashshides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:9">Hayssi GODAA;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:9">nuni izan ammanettidos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:9">izi ashshidayssan ufayettoos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:9">ufayssan hombocoos» gaana.<verse eid="ISA 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mo7aabe Qaxxayeteth</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 25:10" />GODAA kushey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:10">ha zumaa bolla shemppana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:10">Gido attiin uttulay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:10">urqqan yedhettiza mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:10">Mo7aabeykka yedhettana.<verse eid="ISA 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 25:11" />Haaththa wadhdhizay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:11">ba kushe micciza mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:11">iza giddon dizayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:11">bantta kushe miccana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:11">Xoossi istta gene ooso balettontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:11">istta otoreteththaa kawushshana.<verse eid="ISA 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 25:12" />Istti dhoqqu histti gimbida gimbeza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:12">izi duge ziqqi histtana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:12">duge woththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:12">kawushshidi duge</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:12">sa7an woththidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:12">gudulla bolla yeggana.<verse eid="ISA 25:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ISA 26" />
  <para style="s1">Galata Yeth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 26:1" />He gallas ha yeththay Yuhuda biittan yexettana.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 26:1" />
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:1">Nuus mino katamay dees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:1">Xoossi iza gimbetanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:1">miixata atoteththas ooththides.<verse eid="ISA 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 26:2" />Ba ammano naagida,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:2">xillo kawoteththati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:2">gelana mala pengeta doyte.<verse eid="ISA 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 26:3" />Nenan ammanettida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:3">nenan zemppida shemppoyo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:3">neni kumeththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:3">saroteththan naagaasa.<verse eid="ISA 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 26:4" />Mernaas GODAAN ammanettite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:4">GODAY nuus mernaa Zaalla.<verse eid="ISA 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 26:5" />Dhoqqasohon dizayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:5">ziqqi ooththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:5">dhoqqu gida katama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:5">kawushshana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:5">duge biittan olana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:5">gudullara walakkana.<verse eid="ISA 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 26:6" />Tohon yedhettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:6">un7ettidayta tohoynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:6">manqota tohoy iza yedhdhana.<verse eid="ISA 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 26:7" />Xillota ogey moole.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:7">Nenoo Suurezoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:7">neni xillota oge moolisaasa.<verse eid="ISA 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 26:8" />Abeet GODAWU!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:8">Ne woga ogera hemettishe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:8">nuni nena hidota ooththidos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:8">ne sunththinne ne gitateththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:8">nu wozinas amo.<verse eid="ISA 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 26:9" />Ta shemppoya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:9">omarsi nena laamotawus;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:9">ta ayanay maalado</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:9">nena koyawus;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:9">ne pirday biitta bolla yida wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:9">sa7an de7iza asay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:9">xilloteth tamaarees.<verse eid="ISA 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 26:10" />Iita asatas kiya ooththikokka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:10">istti xilloteth tamaarettenna.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:10">Suure biittan iita ooththeettes;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:10">GODAA gitateththaaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:10">akeekettenna.<verse eid="ISA 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 26:11" />Abeet GODAWU!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:11">Ne qesey dhoqqu dhoqqu gides.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:11">Istti gidikko be7ettenna;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:11">Ne asaas ne mishettizayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:11">be7ettonne yeellatetto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:11">Ne morkketas giigida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:11">tamay istta mo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 10:27">Ib 10:27</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 26:12" />Abeet GODAWU!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:12">Neni nuus saroteth</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:12">yoch ooththadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:12">nu ooso ubbaa neni ooththadasa.<verse eid="ISA 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 26:13" />Abeet GODAWU Nu Xoossawu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:13">neeppe hara allaga xoossati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:13">nuna haarida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:13">nuni gidikko ne sunththaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:13">xalla bonchchoos.<verse eid="ISA 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 26:14" />Istti hayqqida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:14">simmidi shemppora</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:14">paxa de7ettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:14">istta shemppoy simmi yeenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:14">neni istta qaxxayadasanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:14">dhayssadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:14">istta hassa7issiza miish ubbaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:14">pitta dhayssadasa.<verse eid="ISA 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 26:15" />Abeet GODAWU!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:15">Neni kawoteththaa darsadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:15">Neni deraa darsadasa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:15">Neni bonchchettadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:15">biittaa zawa ubbaaka aassadasa.<verse eid="ISA 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 26:16" />Abeet GODAWU!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:16">Istti metotida wode neekko yida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:16">Neni istta seerida wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:16">saasuki nena woosseettes.<verse eid="ISA 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 26:17" />Abeet GODAWU! Shaara maccassi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:17">miixan metotiza malanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:17">waassiza mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:17">nunikka ne sinththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:17">metotidi waassoos.<verse eid="ISA 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 26:18" />Nuni shaaridos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:18">miixankka un7ettidos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:18">gido attiin carko yelidos.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:18">Nuni sa7as atoteth ehibookko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:18">sa7an diza deraakka yelibookko.<verse eid="ISA 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 26:19" />Gido attiin hayqqida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:19">ne asay paxana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:19">istta ahaykka dendana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:19">Intteno biitta garsan dizaytoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:19">Dendite ufayssan yexxite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:19">ne xaazay biitta yakkissiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:19">maalado xaaza mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:19">sa7ay mittidayta zaara cuttana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:2">Daane 12:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 26:20" />Ta derezoo! Ba ne keeth gela;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:20">ne penge ne bolla gorda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:20">iza hanqoy aadhdhana gakkanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:20">guuththa wodes qotetaashsha.<verse eid="ISA 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 26:21" />Biittaa bollan diza asaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:21">istta nagaraa gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:21">qaxxayanaas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:21">GODAY ba de7izasoppe kezidi yees.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:21">Biittayka ba bollan gukkida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:21">suuththaa qonccisana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:21">hayqqidaytakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:21">hayssafe guye qottuku.<verse eid="ISA 26:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ISA 27" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 27:1" />He gallas GODAY lewataane geetettiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:1">xongettiza shooshshaanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:1">xaaxettiza shooshshaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:1">ba mino, gitanne wolqqama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:1">giththa mashshan qaxxayana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:1">abban diza wogga do7aa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:1">qanxxereththi yeggana.<verse eid="ISA 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 27:2" />He gallas, «Woyne mith tokkiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:2">lo7osozas yexxite!<verse eid="ISA 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 27:3" />Tani GODAY iza naagays;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:3">tani ubbaa gallas haath ushshays;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:3">omarsinne gallas iza naagays;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:3">hessa gishshas ooninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:3">iza qohenna.<verse eid="ISA 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 27:4" />Tani hanqettike;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:4">tanara olettanaas agunththinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:4">kindichchoy kezidaakko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:4">ta istta issi bolla xuuggana!<verse eid="ISA 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 27:5" />Woykko taakko yiidi tana banttas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:5">qotettizaso kessetto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:5">tanara giigetto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:5">ee tanara giigetto» geetettana.<verse eid="ISA 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 27:6" />Yaana gallassatan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:6">Yaaqoobey xapho yeddana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:6">Isra7eeley aacananne ciiyana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:6">histtiin istta ayfey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:6">sa7a kumana.<verse eid="ISA 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 27:7" />Izo shocidayta shocida mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:7">GODAY izo shocidee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:7">Izo wodhidayta izi wodhida mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:7">izo wodhidee?<verse eid="ISA 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 27:8" />Olaninne di7on ne izo qaxxayadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:8">arshey mokkiza bagga carkoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:8">carkiza mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:8">wolqqama gote carkon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:8">ne izo gooddadasa.<verse eid="ISA 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 27:9" />Yaaqoobey yarsho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:9">yarshizaso shuchchata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:9">booqintta shuchcha mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:9">gaacci liiqisishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:9">Asheero geetettiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:9">eeqa xoossay mislenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:9">exaane cuwasiza sohota</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:9">istti dizasohotappe shoddi olishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:9">he gallas mooroy atto geetettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:9">hessi izi ba nagara diggoyssas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:9">kumeththa ayfe gidana.<verse eid="ISA 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 27:10" />Gimbettida katamaya kayzadus;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:10">bazzo biitta mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:10">olettidaso gidadus;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:10">marati heen heemettidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:10">heen ichchana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:10">izi haggatakka poqqi maana.<verse eid="ISA 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 27:11" />Izi xeeray melidi meqqana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:11">maccassatikka mixi eeththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:11">akeekay baynda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:11">dere gidida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:11">iza medhdhiday</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:11">izas qadhettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:11">ooththidayssika iza maarenna.<verse eid="ISA 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 27:12" />He gallas Efiraaxise shaafappe haaththi baynda Gibxe Shaafa gakkanaas GODAY ba kaththaa bukkana; intteno Isra7eele asatoo, intte issoy issoy shiiqana.<verse eid="ISA 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 27:13" />He gallas gita zayey punettana; Asooren di7ettidaytinne Gibxen un7ettidayti guye Yerusalaame simmi yiidi geeshsha zumaa bolla GODAAS goynnana.<verse eid="ISA 27:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ISA 28" />
  <para style="s1">Efreemes Imettida Seera</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 28:1" />Efreemen diza maththottizaytas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:1">otoreteththas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:1">kallachcha gididaaris,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:1">cilila shoobba hu7en</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:1">kippi ga uttida,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:1">izas bonchcho seelo gidida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:1">shulla ciishshays,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:1">woyne ushshay istta zereththas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:1">otoreteththas gidida katamays</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:1">aayye ana!<verse eid="ISA 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 28:2" />Be7ite, Godaas wolqqamanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:2">mino gidida issoy dees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:2">hessika shachcha uusho mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:2">dhayssiza gote carko mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:2">wolqqama dambala malanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:2">wolqqama ira mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:2">wolqqan izi izo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:2">duge biittan yeggana.<verse eid="ISA 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 28:3" />Maththottiza Efreeme asata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:3">otoro kallachchay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:3">tohon yedhettana.<verse eid="ISA 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 28:4" />Cilila shoobba hu7en kippi ga uttida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:4">izas bonchcho seelo gidida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:4">shulla ciishshaya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:4">kaththa shiishoppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:4">sinththan gakkiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:4">asi be7ida mala xuphi ekkidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:4">heerakka mittiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:4">balase mala gidana.<verse eid="ISA 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 28:5" />He gallas Ubbaafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:5">Wolqqama GODAY</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:5">ba asaappe casha attidaytas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:5">bonchcho kallachchanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:5">puula akilile gidana.<verse eid="ISA 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 28:6" />Izi pirdizaytas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:6">suure pirda pirdiza ayana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:6">olaa katama pengefe zaarizaytas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:6">wolqqa gidana.<verse eid="ISA 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maththottiza Yuhuda Nabetanne Qeeseta,</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 28:7" />Hayti woyne ushshu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:7">uyidi yiicoteettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:7">maththosiza ushshan gandigareettes.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:7">Qeesetinne nabeti maththosiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:7">ushshan gandigarda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:7">woyne ushsha gaason</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:7">yo7oy isttafe balettides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:7">maththosiza ushshan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:7">gandigarda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:7">ajjuutaa likkera be7ettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:7">pirda pirdishe dhuphetteettes.<verse eid="ISA 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 28:8" />Istta maadda ubbay coosh xalla;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:8">cooshshan moorettonttasoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:8">deenna.<verse eid="ISA 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 28:9" />Istti, «Izi oona tamaarsizee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:9">Kiitaakka oos qonccisizee?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:9">Maath aggida naytasseyee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:9">dhanththa duuso naytassee?<verse eid="ISA 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 28:10" />Azazo bolla azazo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:10">azazo bolla azazo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:10">woga bolla woga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:10">wogaa bolla woga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:10">haankka guuththara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:10">heenkka guuththara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:10">ooththees» gaana.<verse eid="ISA 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 28:11" />Histtiko sinththafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:11">Xoossay allagata qaalaninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:11">imaththata doonan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:11">ha asaas haasayana.<verse eid="ISA 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 28:12" />Izi isttas, «Hanna shemposo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:12">daaburday shemppo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:12">hanna shemposo»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:12">giday oonassee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:12">Istti gidikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:12">siyana koyibeettenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:11-12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 14:21">1Qoro 14:21</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 28:13" />Hessa gishshas GODAA qaalay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:13">istti biidi guye kundana mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:13">madunxana malanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:13">woximaden oykettana mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:13">di7ettana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:13">azazo bolla azazo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:13">azazo bolla azazo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:13">woga bolla woga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:13">woga bolla woga gididi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:13">haan guuththara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:13">heen guuththara hanana.<verse eid="ISA 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xiyoonen Gula Shuch</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 28:14" />Hessa gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:14">intteno Yerusalaamen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:14">diza asaa haariza qilccizaytoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:14">GODAA qaalaa siyite.<verse eid="ISA 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 28:15" />Intte, «Nuni hayqora caaqettidos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:15">duuforakka sigettidos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:15">wordo nuus zempposonne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:15">qotettizaso ooththidos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:15">wolqqama boshay pitti ekki bishe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:15">nuna bochchanaas dandayenna»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:15">gi otorettideta.<verse eid="ISA 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 28:16" />Hessa gishshas Ubbaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:16">Haariza GODAY,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:16">«Be7ite! Tani Xiyoonen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:16">paacettida shuch,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:16">yochcha shuch,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:16">mino yochchas gidiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:16">bonchchettida gula</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:16">shuch woththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:16">izan ammanizay yeellatenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22-23">Maza 118:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 9:33">Oro 9:33</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 10:11">10:11</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:6">1Phex 2:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 28:17" />Tani suure pirda wadha wodoro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:17">xilloteththika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:17">tumbe mala ooththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:17">intte wordo zempposo ooththidayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:17">shachcha iray meeccana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:17">intte qotetti attizasozakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:17">haaththi mittana» gees.<verse eid="ISA 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 28:18" />Intte hayqora caaqettida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:18">caaqoy attana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:18">intte duufora sigettida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:18">sigay laalettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:18">wolqqama boshay pitti ekki bishe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:18">inttenakka pitti ekki baana.<verse eid="ISA 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 28:19" />Izi yida wode wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:19">inttena ekki baana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:19">maalado maalado,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:19">qammanne gallas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:19">inttena pitti efana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:19">ha qaalaa intte akeekizaa gidikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:19">shiro bolla shiro ehana.<verse eid="ISA 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 28:20" />Toho cogotti ichchontta mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:20">hiixay qaanththa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:20">gaththi may7anaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:20">afalaykka guuththa.<verse eid="ISA 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 28:21" />GODAY Paraaxime zuman</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:21">ooththida mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:21">ba ooso, ba imaththa ooso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:21">hessika ba ooraththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:21">ooso ooththanaas dendana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:21">Qasse Geba7oone zullen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:21">ooththida malakka ooththana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 10:10-12">Iya 10:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 5:20">2Same 5:20</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 14:11">1Taari 14:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 28:22" />GODAY, Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAY</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:22">izi boshaa biitta ubbaa bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:22">ehanaas awajjidayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:22">tani siyida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:22">ha7i intte qilccizayssa aggite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:22">akkay giikko intte bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:22">qashoy minnana.<verse eid="ISA 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Aadho Erateth</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 28:23" />Ezgidi ta yootizayssa siyite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:23">akeekidi ta qaala siyite.<verse eid="ISA 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 28:24" />Goshshanchchay kath zeranaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:24">ubba wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:24">he soho goyishe de7izee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:24">Qasse izi hem7e liiqisishenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:24">ubbato pixishe de7izee?<verse eid="ISA 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 28:25" />Goshshaa liiqisidi aasutanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:25">aanuga zerennee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:25">Gistteza izas giigidasohon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:25">banggaa izas giigidasohon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:25">arddaa izas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:25">giigidasohon zerennee?<verse eid="ISA 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 28:26" />Iza Xoossay iza tamaarssees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:26">suure ogekka iza bessees.<verse eid="ISA 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 28:27" />Aasutay lodan bukettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:27">aanugay para-gaaren bukettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:27">aasutay guufen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:27">aanugay qeeri lodan bukettees.<verse eid="ISA 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 28:28" />Sollo uukkanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:28">kaththi gaacettees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:28">hessa gishshas issi asi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:28">mernaas kath bukkenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:28">kath bukkiza para-gaareta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:28">iza bollara laaggikokka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:28">kaththaa gaacettenna.<verse eid="ISA 28:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 28:29" />Hayssi ubbay ba zoren malalisizaaz,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:29">ba aadho erateththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:29">malalisizaaz gidida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:29">Ubbaafe Wolqqama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:29">GODAAPPE hanees.<verse eid="ISA 28:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="ISA 29" />
  <para style="s1">Dawite Katamaas Aayye Ana</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 29:1" />Hanne Dawiti nenan de7ida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:1">Ar7eele<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibraaweta qaalara Ar7eele guussi Xoossa yarshosoho guussa.</char></note> katamayee!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:1">Nena aayye ana!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:1">Layththa bolla layth gujja;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:1">ba7aaletakka zaara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:1">zaarada bonchcha.<verse eid="ISA 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 29:2" />Gido attiin tani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:2">Ar7eele katamayo giddoththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:2">iza yeekkananne waassana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:2">iza taas yarsho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:2">yarshizaso gidana.<verse eid="ISA 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 29:3" />Tani ne yuushon dunkaanana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:3">ta ne yuushon gimbe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:3">yuushsha aaththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:3">ne yuushon shakko ooththada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:3">ta nena un7eththana.<verse eid="ISA 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 29:4" />Neni duge wodhdhana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:4">biitta garsafe pude haasayana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:4">ne haasayay gudullaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:4">giddofe kezana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:4">ne cenggurssi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:4">moytille cenggurssa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:4">biitta garsafe pude kezana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:4">ne haasayaykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:4">gudulla giddofe saasukettana.<verse eid="ISA 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 29:5" />Gido attiin daro ne morkketi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:5">gudulla suulla mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:5">menxe iitati carkon biza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:5">happa mala gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:5">qofay baynda dishin,<verse eid="ISA 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 29:6" />Ubbaafe Wolqqama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:6">GODAY dadan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:6">biittaa qaaththan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:6">gita cenggurssan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:6">gote carkoninne wolqqama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:6">abba dambalan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:6">ubbaa miza tama lacon yaana.<verse eid="ISA 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 29:7" />Ar7eele oliza kawoteththata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:7">ubbaa wudey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:7">izi bollanne izi shakko bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:7">daafa yeggizaytinne dooddizayti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:7">agumo malanne omars beettiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:7">ajjuuta mala gidana.<verse eid="ISA 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 29:8" />Gafida asi agumora mishe aqees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:8">gido attiin izi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:8">dhiskofe dendishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:8">gafay aggonttayssa mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:8">saamettida asi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:8">agumora uyishe aqees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:8">gido attiin beeggishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:8">daaburaynne saamoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:8">iza aggonttayssa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:8">Xiyoone zuma oliza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:8">kawoteththata ubbaa wudey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:8">hessaththo hanana.<verse eid="ISA 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Azazo Ixoy Ehiza Qixaate</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 29:9" />Dammattidi malalettite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:9">inttena intterkka qooqisidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:9">qooqe gidite.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:9">Gido attiin woyne ushshu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:9">uyontta coo maththottite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:9">maththosiza ushshu uyontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:9">dishe gandigarite.<verse eid="ISA 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 29:10" />GODAY intte bolla wolqqama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:10">dhisko yeggides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:10">intte nabeta ayfe goozides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:10">ajjuuta be7izayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:10">hu7e gullunttissides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:8">Oro 11:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 29:11" />Ha ajjuutay isttas xaaththa maxaafa giddon gordetti diza qaala mala gidides. Ha xaaththa maxaafa nababanaas dandayza asi, «Shoobbe nuus nababa» giidi intte immiko, izi inttes, «Gordettida gishshas tani nababanaas dandaykke» gaana. <verse eid="ISA 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 29:12" />Qasse xaaththa maxaafaa nababo dandayontta asas, «Shoobbe nuus nababa» giidi intte izas immiko izi inttes, «Ta nababo dandaykke» gaana.<verse eid="ISA 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 29:13" />GODAY,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:13">«Hayssi derey doonan xalla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:13">taakko shiiqees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:13">ba metershan xalla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:13">tana bonchchees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:13">gido attiin iza wozinay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:13">taappe haakon dees.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:13">Istti asi tamaarsidanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:13">asi woththida wogan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:13">taas goynneettes.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 15:8-9">Mato 15:8-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 7:6-7">Mar 7:6-7</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 29:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 29:14" />Hessa gishshas tani ha asaa bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:14">malalisiza miishsha bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:14">malalisiza miish ooththashe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:14">zaara zaara istta malalissana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:14">aadho eranchchata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:14">erateththi dhayana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:14">akeekanchchata akeekaykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:14">pentti baana» gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:19">1Qoro 1:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sinththafe Yaana Hidota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 29:15" />Bantta halchcho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:15">GODAAPPE genththanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:15">duge ciimma ollan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:15">wodhdhizaytas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:15">bantta ooso dhuman</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:15">ooththizaytas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:15">«Nuna ooni be7anee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:15">Nuna ooni eranee?»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:15">gizaytas aayye ana!<verse eid="ISA 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 29:16" />Intte yo7ota laammi yeggeeta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:16">manata urqqa mala xeelleeta!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:16">Medhettidayssi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:16">medhdhidayssa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:16">«Izi tana medhdhibeenna» gizee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:16">Mana miishshi bana medhdhidayssa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:16">«Izi aykkoka erenna» gizee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:9">Isa 45:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 29:17" />Libaanoosey laamettidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:17">aradda gade gidanaas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:17">aradda biittay laamettidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:17">wora gidanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:17">guuththa wodey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:17">attides gidennee?<verse eid="ISA 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 29:18" />He gallas tulley</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:18">xaaththa maxaafa qaala siyana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:18">qooqe ayfetikka shaarumappenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:18">dhumappe shaakettidi xeellana.<verse eid="ISA 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 29:19" />Ashketi GODAAN,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:19">hiyeesati Isra7eele Geeshshan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:19">zaari zaari ufayettana.<verse eid="ISA 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 29:20" />Menxe iitati ubbay wurana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:20">qilccizayti tim7i gaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:20">Iita ooththanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:20">zamadi uttidayti dhayana.<verse eid="ISA 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 29:21" />As yo7on mooranchcha kessizayti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:21">shilotan mootettizayssa bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:21">woximade waaxizayti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:21">wordo markkan tumateththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:21">xillotappe bonqqizayti dhayana.<verse eid="ISA 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 29:22" />Hessa gishshas Abrahaame wozzida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:22">GODAY Yaaqoobesos,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:22">«Yaaqoobey hayssafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:22">guye yeellatenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:22">iza sinththika laamettenna.<verse eid="ISA 29:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 29:23" />Bantta giddon ta kushe ooso gidida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:23">bantta nayta be7ishe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:23">ta sunththaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:23">geeshshateththan naagana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:23">istti Yaaqoobe Geeshshaza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:23">geeshshateth erana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:23">Isra7eele Xoossaa sinththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:23">yashshateththan eqqana.<verse eid="ISA 29:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 29:24" />Ayanan balidayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:24">simmidi akeekana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:24">zuuzumizaytikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:24">timirte ekkana» gees.<verse eid="ISA 29:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="ISA 30" />
  <para style="s1">Gibxera Caaqettida Hada Caaqo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 30:1" />GODAY,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:1">«Makkallanchcha gidida naytas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:1">aayye ana!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:1">taappe gidontta qofa kaalleettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:1">ta Ayanappe gidontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:1">caaqo caaqqeettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:1">nagara bolla nagara gujjeettes.<verse eid="ISA 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 30:2" />Tana zore oychchontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:2">Gibxe wodhdheettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:2">kawo Paarooney isttas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:2">gondalle gidana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:2">Gibxe kuwan attana koyeettes.<verse eid="ISA 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 30:3" />Gido attiin Paaroone</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:3">gondalleteththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:3">isttas kawushshateth gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:3">Gibxe kawon ateththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:3">istta bolla yeella ehana.<verse eid="ISA 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 30:4" />Istta shuumeti Xaanoosen diikkoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:4">istta kiittidayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:4">Haneesen diikkoka,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:29">Mato 24:29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:25">Mar 13:25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:26">Luqa 21:26</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:13-14">Ajju 6:13-14</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 30:5" />isttas yeellateththinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:5">kawushshateth xalla gidana attiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:5">maado woykko wodhe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:5">isttas ehontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:5">aykko go7akka isttas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:5">immontta asata gaason</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:5">ubbayka yeellatana» gees.<verse eid="ISA 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 30:6" />Negeben diza medosata gishshas GODAY yootida qaalay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:6">wodalla gaammotinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:6">macca gaammoti dizason,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:6">marzera diza shooshshatinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:6">xongettiza shooshshati dizason,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:6">metoynne ceecey kumida biittara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:6">aadhdhi biidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:6">istti go7ontta deretakko,<verse eid="ISA 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 30:7" />izi maados</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:7">mulekka go7ay baynda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:7">dere istti Gibxe baana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:7">hessa gishshas tani izi sunththaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:7">«Aykkoka go7onttaaro Era7aabe»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:7">ga xeygana.<verse eid="ISA 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Azazettontta Kawoteththata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 30:8" />Ha7i ba; saleedan isttas xaafa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:8">xaaththa maxaafa bollaka cadda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:8">hessi buroppe yaana wodetan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:8">mernaas markka gidana.<verse eid="ISA 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 30:9" />Hayti GODAA azazo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:9">siyana koyonttayti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:9">makkallanchcha derenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:9">baleththiza nayta.<verse eid="ISA 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 30:10" />Ajjuuta be7izayta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:10">«Hayssafe guye ajjuuta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:10">be7opite» gaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:10">nabeta, «Hayssafe guye nuus</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:10">tuma tinbite yootopite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:10">nuna ufayssizaazinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:10">miichchizaaz yootite.<verse eid="ISA 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 30:11" />Hayssa ogaappe kichchite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:11">ha wogga ogaappe haakkite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:11">Isra7eele Geeshshaara nuna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:11">tiran gaththofte» gaana.<verse eid="ISA 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 30:12" />Hessa gishshas Isra7eele Geeshshay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:12">«Intte ha qaala kadhida gishshas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:12">genen intte ammanettida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:12">gishshassinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:12">baleththon zemppida gishshas,<verse eid="ISA 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 30:13" />hayssi ha nagarazi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:13">phalqetti kundananne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:13">qoppontta dishin kundiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:13">gita gimbe mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:13">isttas gidana.<verse eid="ISA 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 30:14" />Meqerettoyssa giddofe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:14">tama bonqqo kaashiza kon7ay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:14">haaththe duuqqiza kon7ay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:14">dhayanaashe gakkanaas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:14">aykkoyka attontta tiifettiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:14">mana miishsha mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:14">tiifettana» gees.<verse eid="ISA 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 30:15" />Ubbaa Haariza GODAY,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:15">Isra7eele Geeshshay,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:15">«Intte taakko simoninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:15">tanan shempon attana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:15">woppaninne ammanon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:15">intte minnana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:15">intte gidikko hessaththo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:15">ooththibeekketa.<verse eid="ISA 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 30:16" />Qasseka, ‹Chii! Nuni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:16">paran utti baqatana› gideta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:16">hessa gishshas intte baqatana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:16">Zaaridikka intte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:16">‹Nuni pilata paran</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:16">kessi ekki baana› gideta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:16">hessa gishshas inttena</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:16">yedeththizayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:16">pilatata gidana.<verse eid="ISA 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 30:17" />Intte zuma hu7en</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:17">eqqida bandira mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:17">zumbullata xeeran eqqida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:17">malata mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:17">gidi intte attanaashe gakkanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:17">issi asa mandeththan 1,000</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:17">asi baqatana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:17">ichchash asa mandeththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:17">intte ubbay baqatana» gees.<verse eid="ISA 30:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 30:18" />Gido attiin GODAY inttes</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:18">kiya ooththanaas naagees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:18">inttena ba qadheteththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:18">bessanaas dendees;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:18">GODAY tumu pirdiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:18">Xoossa gidida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:18">ammanettidi iza naagizayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:18">anjjettidayta.<verse eid="ISA 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Deraa Anjjeteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 30:19" />Intteno Yerusalaamen de7iza Xiyoone derezoo! Hayssafe sinththan intte yeekkeketa; intte izakko waassishin izi inttena waani maarennee? Intte waaso izi siyidi inttes eeson zaaro immana. <verse eid="ISA 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 30:20" />GODAY inttes waaye kaththinne meto haath immikokka hayssafe guye intte astamaarey inttefe qotettenna; intte ayfetikka intte astamaareza be7ana. <verse eid="ISA 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 30:21" />Intte hadirs woykko ushach giikko intte guyera, «Ogezi hayssa; izara biite» gizayssa intte hayththi siyana. <verse eid="ISA 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 30:22" />Hessafe biran meeshettida intte eeqa xoossatanne worqqan meeshettida misleta intte moorana; «Nuuppe haakkite» giidi tuna carqqa mala intte wora yeggana.<verse eid="ISA 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 30:23" />Ne zerida kaththas izi ira immana; biittafe mokkida kaththay muurutanne daro gidana. He wode intte mehey aaho demban heemettana. <verse eid="ISA 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 30:24" />Goshsha booratinne hareti bakkan bukki suragettida harqqonne basso maana. <verse eid="ISA 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 30:25" />Asay wuriza wolqqama gallassan miixati laalettishin gita zumata ubbata bollafenne zumbullata ubbata bollafe duge haaththi goggana. <verse eid="ISA 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 30:26" />GODAY meqqida ba deraa koolishin, madunththidayssa paththishin, aginay arshe mala poo7ana. Arshes issi gallassa poo7oykka laappun gallassa poo7o mala gidana.<verse eid="ISA 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asoore Qaxxayeteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 30:27" />Be7ite, GODAA sunththay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:27">eexxiza hanqora,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:27">shaara mala dhippi gida cuwara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:27">haakoppe yaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:27">iza metershati hanqon kumida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:27">iza inxarsayka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:27">xuuggiza tama mala.<verse eid="ISA 30:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 30:28" />Iza peenoykka qoodhe gakkidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:28">meecci efiza kixa haaththa mala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:28">kawoteththatakka dhayso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:28">zayzaren zayzarees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:28">asaa doonan oge baleththiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:28">bixala barssees.<verse eid="ISA 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 30:29" />Omars geeshsha ba7aale</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:29">intte bonchchishe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:29">yexxizayssaththo intte yexxana;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:29">GODAA zumaakko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:29">Isra7eele Zaallaako</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:29">asay susul7e susul7ishe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:29">ufayssan kezizayssaththo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:29">intte wozinay ufayettana.<verse eid="ISA 30:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 30:30" />GODAY eexxiza hanqoninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:30">miza taman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:30">gote carkoninne dadan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:30">shachcha shuchchan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:30">teemay kumida ba cenggurssaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:30">asaa sissana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:30">wodhdhishe ba qesaa izi bessana.<verse eid="ISA 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 30:31" />GODAA cenggurssi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:31">Asoore daganththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:31">iza guufeykka istta shocana.<verse eid="ISA 30:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 30:32" />GODAY istta bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:32">yeddiza qixaate guufe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:32">ubbay karabe giirissaninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:32">diiththa giirissan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:32">azhabettidayssa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:32">izi ba wolqqa olan bessidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:32">istta shocides.<verse eid="ISA 30:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ISA 30:33" />Beni wodeppe doommidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:33">Toofeete geetettiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:33">xuuggizasoy giigetti uttides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:33">kawozasikka giigetti uttides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:33">xuuggana gongolozikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:33">aahonne ciimma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:33">iza giddon daro tamaynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:33">eexxana miththi dees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:33">GODAA peenoy diine tama mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:33">eeththi kessana.<verse eid="ISA 30:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="ISA 31" />
  <para style="s1">Gibxen Ammanettizaytas Aayye Ana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 31:1" />Pude Isra7eele geeshshaako xeellonttaytas,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:1">GODAAPPE maado koyonttaytas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:1">maado demmanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:1">duge Gibxe wodhdhizaytas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:1">para-gaareta daroteththaninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:1">ba para minoteththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:1">ceeqettizaytas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:1">aayye ana.<verse eid="ISA 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 31:2" />Izi gidikko aadho eranchcha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:2">izi bash ehana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:2">ba qaalakka laammenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:2">iita ooththizayta bollanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:2">qoho ooththizayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:2">maaddizayta bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:2">izi dendana.<verse eid="ISA 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 31:3" />Gibxe asay asappe attiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:3">Xoos deettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:3">istta paratikka ashoppe attiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:3">ayana gidettenna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:3">GODAY ba kushe micciza wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:3">iza maaddizaadey dhuphettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:3">maadettizaadeyka kundana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:3">nam7ayka issife dhayana.<verse eid="ISA 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 31:4" />GODAY taas, «Gaammoy woykko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:4">wodalla gaammoy mehe oykkidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:4">daro heenththanchchati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:4">xeygetti shiiqidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:4">iza bolla yiikko istta waasoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:4">iza yashisonttayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:4">istta waasoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:4">iza daganththonttayssa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:4">Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAY</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:4">zumaa bollanne zumbullata bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:4">olas wodhdhana.<verse eid="ISA 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 31:5" />Kafoy bollara aalanththiza mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:5">Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAY</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:5">Yerusalaame kammana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:5">naagananne ashshana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:5">izi bollara aadhdhidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:5">izo ashshana» gees.<verse eid="ISA 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 31:6" />Intteno Isra7eele asazoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:6">Intte keehippe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:6">makkallidayssaako simmite.<verse eid="ISA 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 31:7" />He wode nagaray kumida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:7">intte kusheti birappenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:7">worqqafe ooththida eeqa xoossata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:7">intte ubbayka wora yeggana.<verse eid="ISA 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 31:8" />«Asoorey asa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:8">mashsha gidontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:8">mashshan hayqqana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:8">asho may7idaade</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:8">mashsha gidontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:8">hara mashshay iza maana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:8">izi giththa mashsha sinththafe baqatana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:8">naateththati dosay baynda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:8">wolqqaththon ooththana.<verse eid="ISA 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 31:9" />Mino miixay shiro gaason kundana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:9">ola gadawatikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:9">ola bandira be7idi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:9">dagaman kumana»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:9">gees tamay Xiyoonen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:9">tama coocey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:9">Yerusalaamen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:9">diza GODAY.<verse eid="ISA 31:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="ISA 32" />
  <para style="s1">Xilloteththan Ayssiza Kawo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 32:1" />Be7ite, kawoy xilloteththan kawotana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:1">haarizaytikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:1">suure pirdan haarana.<verse eid="ISA 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 32:2" />Asi hu7en hu7en</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:2">carkofe geemmizasoho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:2">goteppeka baqati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:2">attizasoho gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:2">bazzo biittan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:2">haaththa pultto mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:2">saamettida biittan wogga zaalla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:2">kuwa mala gidana.<verse eid="ISA 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 32:3" />Xeelliza asata ayfey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:3">hayssafe guye qilim7enna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:3">siyizayta hayththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:3">beeggidi ezgana.<verse eid="ISA 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 32:4" />Tapitapizayta wozinay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:4">erananne akeekana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:4">Deddotizayta inxarsika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:4">birshettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:4">geeshshidikka haasayana.<verse eid="ISA 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 32:5" />Hayssafe guyen eeyay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:5">gita as geetettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:5">wogay baynda asi bonchchettenna.<verse eid="ISA 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 32:6" />Eeyay eeyateth haasayees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:6">iza wozinay iitateth</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:6">yuushshi qoppees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:6">Xoossas yashshateththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:6">baynda miish ooththees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:6">GODAA bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:6">bala qaala haasayees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:6">gafidayssas kath immenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:6">saamettidayssas haath immenna.<verse eid="ISA 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 32:7" />Wogay baynda asata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:7">hiillateththi iita;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:7">metotanchchata maganay suure gidikkoka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:7">hiyeesata wordora dhayssanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:7">iitateththan yuushshi qoppees.<verse eid="ISA 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 32:8" />Gita asas qofaykka gita;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:8">ba gitateththa ooson</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:8">minni de7ees.<verse eid="ISA 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pirdafe Guye Yaana Injje De7o</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 32:9" />Intteno otoroy tuccida maccassatoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:9">Dendite; ta gizaaz siyite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:9">intteno badhdhi gi uttida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:9">macca naytoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:9">tani inttes yootizayssa ezgite.<verse eid="ISA 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 32:10" />Layththay buro aadhdhida mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:10">intte badhdhi gi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:10">uttidayti kokkorana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:10">woyne turay ayfe immenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:10">dumma dumma ayfe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:10">intte shiishshiza wodey yeenna.<verse eid="ISA 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 32:11" />Intteno otoroy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:11">tuccida maccassatoo! Kokkorite.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:11">Intteno badhdhi gida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:11">macca naytoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:11">Hirgan gajigajite.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:11">Intte may7ida may7o</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:11">qaari yeggite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:11">intte xeessan maaqa danccite.<verse eid="ISA 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 32:12" />Aradda biitta gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:12">intte tiraa iccite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:12">ayfiza woyne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:12">miththaa gishshas ceecite;<verse eid="ISA 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 32:13" />Ta deraa biittaa gishshas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:13">agunththinne kindichchoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:13">mokkida biittaa gishshas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:13">homboceththan isttan guppiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:13">keeththata ubbaa gishshas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:13">homboceththan izin guppiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:13">katamays yeekkite.<verse eid="ISA 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 32:14" />Miixati kayzana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:14">daro shirotiza katamaya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:14">dimmi gaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:14">miixatinne qatoti mernaas gongolo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:14">hardidati guppizasohonne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:14">wudey heemettizaso gidana.<verse eid="ISA 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 32:15" />Hessika hananay Ayanay nuus</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:15">bollafe gukkanaashe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:15">bazzo biittay aradda gidanaashe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:15">aradda biittay wora</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:15">misatanaashe gakkanaassa.<verse eid="ISA 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 32:16" />Hessafe guye bazzo biittan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:16">suure pirday de7ana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:16">aradda biittankka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:16">xilloteththi daana.<verse eid="ISA 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 32:17" />Xilloteththa ayfey saroteth;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:17">xilloteththa oosoy woppanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:17">mernaas ammaneteth gidana.<verse eid="ISA 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 32:18" />Ta derey saroy dizason,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:18">ammanththizason,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:18">woppay dizason woppu gi daana.<verse eid="ISA 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 32:19" />Shachchi woraa kurakkiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:19">katamaykka mulera kundiko,<verse eid="ISA 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 32:20" />shaafay dizason dizason</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:20">kath zerizaytoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:20">intte booratanne hareta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:20">hirgay baynda heemmizaytoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:20">intte ay mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:20">anjjettidayta gidandetii!<verse eid="ISA 32:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="ISA 33" />
  <para style="s1">Maado Demmanaas Woossida Woosa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 33:1" />Nees dhayontta dashe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:1">hara dhayssizayssoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:1">Nees aayye ana!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:1">Nena aaththi immontta dishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:1">hara aaththa immizayssoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:1">Nees aayye ana!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:1">Neni dhayso aggida wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:1">ne dhayana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:1">neni aaththa imo aggida wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:1">nena aaththi immana.<verse eid="ISA 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 33:2" />Abeet GODAWU! Nuna maara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:2">nuni nena hidota ooththidos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:2">maalado maalado nuus</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:2">wolqqa gida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:2">meto wodekka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:2">nuna ashshizaade gida.<verse eid="ISA 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 33:3" />Ne cenggurssay dada mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:3">guummiza wode derey baqatees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:3">neni denda eqqiza wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:3">kawoteththati laaletteettes.<verse eid="ISA 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 33:4" />Kawoteththatoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:4">Booley shiiqiza mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:4">inttefe di7ettidayssi shiiqana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:4">gumbaroy guppiza mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:4">asay iza bolla dirbbatana.<verse eid="ISA 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 33:5" />GODAY bolla salon de7iza gishshas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:5">dhoqqu dhoqqu gides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:5">izi Xiyoono suure pirdaninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:5">xilloteththan kunththana.<verse eid="ISA 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 33:6" />Izi ne diza layth ubbaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:6">ammanththiza yoch,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:6">atoteth, aadho erateththinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:6">erateth gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:6">GODAAS yashshateththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:6">hayssa ha aqotatas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:6">qulpe gidana.<verse eid="ISA 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 33:7" />Be7ite, istta gooba asati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:7">ogetan waasseettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:7">sigateththas kiitettidaytikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:7">camo yeeho yeekkeettes.<verse eid="ISA 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 33:8" />Wogga ogeti samida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:8">ogera kanththizay deenna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:8">Qachchida qaalay laalettides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:8">zorizayti kadhettida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:8">bonchchettizaykka deenna.<verse eid="ISA 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 33:9" />Biittaya yeekkadussinne gilqadus;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:9">Libaanoosey yeellatidi shullides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:9">Lasharooney Arabe mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:9">bazzo gidadus;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:9">Baasaaneynne Qarmeloosey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:9">bantta hayth qoqofida.<verse eid="ISA 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossaa Ixxizaytas Imettida Seera</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 33:10" />GODAY kawoteththatasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:10">«Ha7i tani dendana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:10">ha7i tani bonchchettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:10">ha7i tani dhoqqu dhoqqu gaana.<verse eid="ISA 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 33:11" />Intte uttula shaaridi suulla yelideta.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:11">Intte shemppiza shemppoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:11">inttena miza tama.<verse eid="ISA 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 33:12" />Derey booqintta keziza shuchcha mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:12">taman xuugettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:12">qasseka agunththa tusha mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:12">taman eexxana.<verse eid="ISA 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 33:13" />Intteno haakon de7izaytoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:13">tani ooththidayssa siyite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:13">matan dizaytoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:13">Ta wolqqaa erite» gees.<verse eid="ISA 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 33:14" />Xiyoonen diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:14">nagaranchchati dagammida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:14">Xoossi isttas bayndayti babbidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:14">«Nu garsafe xuuggiza tamara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:14">daana dandayzay oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:14">Mernaa tamara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:14">daana dandayzay oonee?» gida.<verse eid="ISA 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 33:15" />Xilloteththan hemettizay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:15">suure haasayzay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:15">baleththon beettiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:15">wodhe kadhizay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:15">gubbo ekkenaappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:15">ba kushe shiishshi ekkizay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:15">as wodhana zuppetizayta zore</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:15">siyanaappe ba hayth tuccizay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:15">iita beyanaappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:15">ba ayfe qilim7izay,<verse eid="ISA 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 33:16" />Hessaadey dhoqqasohon daana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:16">zuma miixay izas shiiqi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:16">attizaso gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:16">izas qumay imettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:16">haaththika izas paccenna.<verse eid="ISA 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bonchchoy Kumida Sinththara Yaana Layth</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 33:17" />Ne ayfeti kawoza puulateth be7ana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:17">haakon micetti diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:17">biittaaka be7ana.<verse eid="ISA 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 33:18" />Beni waayey nees qofettishin neni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:18">«Waanna halaqazi awa bidee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:18">Giira ekkizayssi awa bidee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:18">Shakkoza alaafezi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:18">awan dizee» gaana.<verse eid="ISA 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 33:19" />Heytantti qadhetay baynda asa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:19">istta haasayay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:19">asas gelonttaytanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:19">istta inxarsi deddotizayta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:19">hayssafe guye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:19">intte istta beyekketa.<verse eid="ISA 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 33:20" />Nu ba7aaleta izin bonchchiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:20">Xiyoone katamayo be7ite!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:20">Saron dizasohoyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:20">qaaxxontta dunkaane gididaaro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:20">izi toley shodettonttaaro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:20">izi wodorotappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:20">issinakka duuxxonttaaro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:20">Yerusalaame katamayo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:20">ne ayfey be7ana.<verse eid="ISA 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 33:21" />Heen GODAY nuus wolqqa gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:21">he sohoy dalga shaafanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:21">kanchche gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:21">wogoloy iza bollara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:21">baanaas dandayenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:21">gita markabetikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:21">iza bollara beettenna.<verse eid="ISA 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 33:22" />GODAY nuus pirdiza daanna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:22">GODAY nuus woga immizaade;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:22">GODAY nuus kawo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:22">nuna ashshanaykka iza.<verse eid="ISA 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 33:23" />Ne tole wodoroy leppides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:23">tuussay minni eqqibeenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:23">sharazi tolettibeenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:23">he wode di7ettida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:23">gita miishshi gishettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:23">wobbeyka attontta di7o ekkana.<verse eid="ISA 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 33:24" />Xiyoonen dishe, «Ta sakettadis»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:24">gaana asi deenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:24">heen de7iza asata nagaray</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:24">atto geetettana.<verse eid="ISA 33:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="ISA 34" />
  <para style="s1">Dere Bolla Yaana Pirda</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 34:1" />Intteno kawoteththatoo shiiqidi siyite!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:1">Neni derezi akeeka!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:1">Biittaynne biittan diza ubbay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:1">alameynne alameppe yida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:1">ubbay siyo!<verse eid="ISA 34:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 34:2" />GODAY kawoteth ubbaa hanqettides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:2">iza hanqoyka iza olanchchata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:2">ubbaa bollana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:2">Izi istta mulera dhayssana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:2">shukaska aaththi immana.<verse eid="ISA 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 34:3" />Isttafe hayqqidayti kare olettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:3">istta ahay xinqqana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:3">Zumati suuth xalla gidana.<verse eid="ISA 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 34:4" />Salo xoolintteti ubbay seerana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:4">saloy galba mala xaaxettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:4">cora xoolintteti ubbay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:4">shullidi qoqofettiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:4">woyne hayththa malanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:4">melidi sa7an wodhiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:4">balase hayththa mala gidana. <figure style="fig" alt="Scroll" file="HK00282B.TIF" size="span" ref="34:4">Xaaththa maxaafa</figure><verse eid="ISA 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 34:5" />Ta giththa mashshay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:5">salota giddon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:5">baas gidana gakkanaas uyadus;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:5">be7ite; Eedoome bolla,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:5">tani qanggida asaa bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:5">pirdanaas wodhdhadus.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:5-17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 63:1-6">Isa 63:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 49:7-22">Er 49:7-22</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:12-14">Hizi 25:12-14</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 35:1-15">35:1-15</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:11-12">Amo 1:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="OBA 1:1-14">Ab 1-14</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 1:2-5">Mil 1:2-5</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 34:6" />GODAA giththa mashshay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:6">suuth may7adus;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:6">modhdhoka kalladus;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:6">dorsa laaqqa suuththaninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:6">deysha suuththan goozettadus;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:6">dharsho kilaho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:6">moodhen goozettadus;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:6">GODAY Booxira kataman yarsho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:6">Eedoomen wolqqama shuka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:6">giigsida gishshassa.<verse eid="ISA 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 34:7" />Qasse Isttara menththi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:7">kormay wofanora issife kundana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:7">biittaya suuththan caphana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:7">istta biittay modhdhon araddana.<verse eid="ISA 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 34:8" />Hessika GODAY</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:8">halo kessiza gallassinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:8">Xiyoone gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:8">morkketa oliza layth gidana.<verse eid="ISA 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 34:9" />Eedoome kanchcheti shida gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:9">izi biittay xuugettiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:9">diine gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:9">izi biittay shida mala eexxana.<verse eid="ISA 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 34:10" />Izo miza tamay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:10">qammanne gallas to7enna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:10">cuwaykka mernaas tullu gaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:10">yeletappe yeleta gakkanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:10">kays gidana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:10">Oonikka nam7anththo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:10">heera aadhdhenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 14:11">Ajju 14:11</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:3">19:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 34:11" />Xiloynne quxarsi izo laattana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:11">guttoynne quuroy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:11">izin keeth keexxana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:11">Xoossi Eedoome bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:11">izo laallana wodoronne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:11">izo dhayssana tumbe yeddana.<verse eid="ISA 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 34:12" />Izi daannati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:12">kawo geetetti xeygettanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:12">dandayza miishshi deenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:12">izi halaqati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:12">mulera pitetti dhayana.<verse eid="ISA 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 34:13" />Gimbetti yuuyida katamata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:13">izi miixata doyoynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:13">okkay laattana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:13">worakanata ollanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:13">guttota duussaso gidana.<verse eid="ISA 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 34:14" />Bazzo do7ati godaretara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:14">issife daana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:14">bazzo deysh misatiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:14">daydanththati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:14">bantta giddon xeygettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:14">omarsa medhetati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:14">heen shemppana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:14">banttas duussaso heen demmana.<verse eid="ISA 34:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 34:15" />Guttoy he keeththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:15">phuuphphulleta yeggana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:15">zaaradakka phuqissana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:15">ba ciyetakka haphphana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:15">woleti waaththan waaththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:15">heen shiiqana.<verse eid="ISA 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 34:16" />GODAA maxaafan xeellite; nababite.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:16">Haytappe issoyka paccenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:16">issoy issoy baas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:16">waaththa lagge dhayenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:16">hayssi ha azazozi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:16">iza doonappe kezides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:16">iza ayanay istta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:16">issi bolla shiishshana.<verse eid="ISA 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 34:17" />Istta gisha gisha isttas woththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:17">iza kushey meezaanen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:17">meezaanen gishana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:17">iza mernaas isttas gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:17">yeletappe yeleta gakkanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:17">istti izin de7ana.<verse eid="ISA 34:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="ISA 35" />
  <para style="s1">Wozzettida Dere Ufays</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 35:1" />Bazzoynne mela biittay ufayettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:1">aykkoy baynda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:1">bazzoy ufayettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:1">ciishsha malakka ciiyana.<verse eid="ISA 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 35:2" />Izi daro ufayettananne miiccana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:2">Libaanoose bonchchoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:2">izas imettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:2">Qarmeloosenne Lasharoone</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:2">teema izi may7ana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:2">nu GODAA bonchchonne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:2">Xoossaa gitateththaa istti be7ana.<verse eid="ISA 35:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 35:3" />Daaburda qeseta minththite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:3">argacida gulbatata minththite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:12">Ib 12:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 35:4" />Wozinan yashshay dizayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:4">«Minnite! Yayyofte!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:4">Intte Xoossi yiidi halo kessana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:4">izi inttena ashshanaasinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:4">halo kessanaas yaana» giite.<verse eid="ISA 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 35:5" />He wode qooqeta ayfey xeellana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:5">tulleta hayththi siyana.<verse eid="ISA 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 35:6" />Wobbey genessa mala guppana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:6">duude doonay ufayssan yexxana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:6">bazzofe haaththi kezana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:6">pulttoy bazzo biittafe pulttana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:5-6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:5">Mato 11:5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 7:22">Luqa 7:22</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 35:7" />Xuuggiza biittan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:7">eele haaththi kumana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:7">mela biittati haath pulttana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:7">worakanati aqiza ollan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:7">maatay, maqqaynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:7">shaccay mokkana.<verse eid="ISA 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 35:8" />Heen wogga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:8">ogey oosettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:8">izikka, «Geeshshateththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:8">Oge» geetettana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:8">Tunati he ogera beettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:8">ogezi he ogera bizaytas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:8">xalla gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:8">geellati he ogaara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:8">baana dandayettenna.<verse eid="ISA 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 35:9" />Heen gaammoy de7enna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:9">dafi miza do7aykka izan kezenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:9">heytantti heen beettettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:9">wozzettidayti xalla heera baana.<verse eid="ISA 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 35:10" />GODAY maaddidayti simmana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:10">istti yexxishe Xiyoone gelana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:10">mernaa ufayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:10">kallachcha mala goxxana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:10">injjenne ufays demmana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:10">ceeceynne kayoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:10">heeppe baqatana.<verse eid="ISA 35:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="ISA 36" />
  <para style="s1">Yerusalaame Bolla Senakireeme Mande</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 18:13-27">2Kawo 18:13-27</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 32:1-19">2Taari 32:1-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 36:1" />Kawo Hizqiyaasi kawotida tammanne oydanththo layththan, Asoore kawo Senakireemey gimbettida Yuhuda katamata ubbaa oli oykkides. <verse eid="ISA 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 36:2" />Asoore kawoy Laakishe geetettiza katamappe ola gadawa cora olanchchatara kawo Hizqiyaasakko Yerusalaame yeddides. Ola gadawazi May7o meeccizaadeza gadekko efiza ogeppe qommo baggara diza eele haaththaako iza zara lanqen eqqides. <verse eid="ISA 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 36:3" />Kawo keeth ayssiza Kilqiyaasa naa Elyaaqeemey, xaafezi Sheebinaynne taarike xaafezi Aasaafe naa Yo7aahii izakko kare kezida.<verse eid="ISA 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 36:4" />Ola gadawazi isttas, «Hizqiyaasasi, ‹Wolqqama Asoore kawo, neni hayssa mala ne ammanettiday aazanee? <verse eid="ISA 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 36:5" />Neni ola erateththinne mino olanchchati taas deettes gaasa; gido attiin neni go7ay baynda qaala xalla haasayaasa; histtiin ne oonan ammanettada ta bolla makkallay? <verse eid="ISA 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 36:6" />Hekko neni asi iza oykki darttiin meqqidi madunththiza maqqa misatiza Gibxen ammanettadasa; Gibxe kawo Paarooneykka izan ammanettiza ubbaas hessa mala.›<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 29:6-7">Hizi 29:6-7</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 36:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 36:7" />«Neni taas, ‹Nuni GODAAN, nu Xoossan ammanettoos› giikko, izas goynniza dhoqqasohotanne yarshosohota Hizqiyaasi laallidi Yuhuda asaanne Yerusalaame asaa, ‹Intte goynnanaas bessizay hayssa mala issi yarshoson xalla gidanaas bessees› gibeennee?<verse eid="ISA 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 36:8" />«Ane ha7i haa yaada ta godaa Asoore kawora giigana mala haasaya; nees toga dandayza asati diikko 2,000 parata tani nees immana. <verse eid="ISA 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 36:9" />Neni Gibxe para-gaaretaninne toganchchatan ammanettizaa gidikko ta godaa olanchchatappe issi laafa butteza ne wostta zaaranee? <verse eid="ISA 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 36:10" />Qasse hayssa biitta dhayssanaas GODAA azazoy baynda ta yidaa nees misatizee? GODAY ba hu7era hayssa deraa tani ola dhayssana mala taas yootides» gides.<verse eid="ISA 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 36:11" />Elyaaqeemey, Sheebinaynne Yo7aahi ola gadawaza, «Nu eriza Aaraame qaalara nuus ne aylletas yoota; gimbeza bolla diza derezi eriza, Ibraaweta qaalan nuus yootoppa» gida.<verse eid="ISA 36:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 36:12" />Gido attiin ola gadawazi zaaridi, «Ta goday tana kiitti yeddiday hayta ha yo7ota ne godaassinne nees xalla yootanaassee? Intte mala bantta shiya maanaassinne bantta sheesh uyanaas gimbe bolla uttida asaassara yootana mala gidennee?» gides.<verse eid="ISA 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 36:13" />Hessafe guye ola gadawazi Ibraaweta qaalara ba qaala dhoqqu histtidi, «Wogga wolqqama Asoore kawo qaala siyite! <verse eid="ISA 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 36:14" />Kawozi, ‹Hizqiyaasi inttena cimmofo; izi inttena ashshana dandayenna. <verse eid="ISA 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 36:15" />GODAY tuma nuna ashshana; ha katamayakka Asoore kawos imettuku› giidi intte GODAAN ammanettana mala ooththofo» gides.<verse eid="ISA 36:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 36:16" />«Hizqiyaasi gizayssa siyopite. Asoore kawoy inttena, ‹Tanara sigettite; haa taakko kezite. Hessafe guye intte ubbayka intte woyneppenne intte balaseppe maandeta; intte bookkida ollafe haath uyandeta. <verse eid="ISA 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 36:17" />Hessa intte hananay tani yaada inttena intte biitta misatiza dere denththa efana gakkanaassa. He biittay kaththinne woyne ushshi, kaththa biittanne woyne atakiltey kumida biitta› gees.<verse eid="ISA 36:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 36:18" />«Hizqiyaasi, ‹GODAY nuna ashshana› giidi inttena cimmofo. Hanno gakkanaas kawoteththata xoossatappe ba deraa Asoore kawo kusheppe ashshida xoossi dizee? <verse eid="ISA 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 36:19" />Hamaate xoossatinne Arfaade xoossati awan dizoo? Sefarwayme xoossati awan dizoo? Hayti Samaariya ta kusheppe ashshidoo? <verse eid="ISA 36:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 36:20" />Hayta ha dereta xoossata ubbaafe ba deraa ta kusheppe ashshana dandayday awayssee? Histtiin GODAY Yerusalaame ta kusheppe wostti ashshana dandayzee?» gides.<verse eid="ISA 36:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 36:21" />Gido attiin kawozi isttas, «Izas aykkoka zaaropite» gi azazida gishshas asay issi qaalakka qaattontta co7u gides. <verse eid="ISA 36:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 36:22" />Hessafe guye kawo keeth ayssiza Kilqiyaasa naa Elyaaqeemey, xaafe Sheebinaynne taarike xaafezi Aasaafe naa Yo7aahi bantta may7o daakkidi Hizqiyaasakko bida; histtidi Asooreta ola gadaway gidayssa ubbaa izas yootida.<verse eid="ISA 36:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="ISA 37" />
  <para style="s1">Kawo Hizqiyaasi Isayaasa Oychchida Zore</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 19:1-7">2Kawo 19:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 37:1" />Kawo Hizqiyaasi hessa siyida mala ba may7o daakkides; hessafe guye maaqa may7idi GODAA Keeth gelides. <verse eid="ISA 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 37:2" />Kawo keeth ayssiza Elyaaqeemey, xaafe Sheebinaynne qeesetappe erettidayti ubbay maaqa may7idi Amoxe naa nabe Isayaasakko baana mala kiittides. <verse eid="ISA 37:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 37:3" />Isttika Isayaasas biidi, «Hizqiyaasi, ‹Ha gallassay ceece, qixaatenne kawushshateththa gallassa; hessika nay yelettana hanishin abbey ixxiza gallassa mala gidides. <verse eid="ISA 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 37:4" />De7o Xoossaa cayana mala iza godaa Asoore kawoy kiittida ola gadawa qaala GODAA ne Xoossay siyontta aggenna. Qasse GODAA ne Xoossay he siyida qaalaa gaason iza qaxxayontta aggenna. Hessa gishshas neni shemppora paxa attida cashata gishshas woossa› gees» gida.<verse eid="ISA 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 37:5" />Kawo Hizqiyaasi kiittidayti Isayaasakko yida wode, <verse eid="ISA 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 37:6" />Isayaasi isttas zaaridi, «Intte godaassi biidi, ‹GODAY nena, Asoore kawo ashkarati tana cayishin neni siyida cashsha qaalaas hirgofa. <verse eid="ISA 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 37:7" />Beya, ta iza bolla ayana kiittana; izi wore siyidi ba dere simmi baana; heen ba deren mashshan hayqqana mala ta ooththana› giite» gides.<verse eid="ISA 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asooreti Nam7anththo Kiittida Mande Qaala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 19:8-19">2Kawo 19:8-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 37:8" />Asoore kawoy Laakishe katamappe dendi bidayssa ola gadawazi siyidi guye simmides. Histtidi kawozi Libina katama olishin demmides.<verse eid="ISA 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 37:9" />Kawo Senakireemey, Tophphiya Kawo Tiraaqey iza olana yizayssa siyides; hessa siyida mala Hizqiyaasas kiita yeddidi, <verse eid="ISA 37:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 37:10" />«Yuhuda Kawo Hizqiyaasas, ‹Yerusalaamey Asoore kawo kushen gelenna› giin ne ammanettida Xoossi nena cimmofo. <verse eid="ISA 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 37:11" />Hekko Asoore kawoti biitta ubbaa bolla istti ooththidayssanne mulera istta dhayssidayssa ne siyadasa. Histtiin ne kessa ekka attana misatizee? <verse eid="ISA 37:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 37:12" />Kase ta aawati dhayssida Gozaanen, Kaaraaneninne Erafesen hessaththoka Talasaaren de7iza Edene asaa istta xoossati he biittata ashshidoo? <verse eid="ISA 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 37:13" />Hamaate kawoy, Arfaade kawoy, Sefarwayme kawoy, Heena kawoynne Iwa kawoy awan dizoo?» gides.<verse eid="ISA 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hizqiyaasa Woosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 37:14" />Hizqiyaasi dabdaabbeza kiitettida asatappe ekkidi nababides. GODAA Keeth ekki efidi GODAA sinththan miccides. <verse eid="ISA 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 37:15" />Histtidi GODAA woossishe, <verse eid="ISA 37:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 37:16" />«Abeet GODAWU, Ubbaafe Wolqqama Xoossawu, kirubetappe giddon uttiza Isra7eele Xoossawu, sa7aa kawoteththata ubbaa bolla ne xalla Xoossaa. Salonne sa7a neni medhdhadasa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:22">Kessa 25:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ISA 37:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 37:17" />Abeet GODAWU, ne hayth haa yeggada ezga. Abeet GODAWU, ne ayfe pogada haa xeella. Nena De7o Xoossaa cayanaas Senakireemey kiittida qaala siya.<verse eid="ISA 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 37:18" />«Abeet GODAWU tumakka, Asoore kawoti ha kawoteththatanne istta biitta ubbaa bazzo kessida. <verse eid="ISA 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 37:19" />Istta xoossata taman xuuggida; istta xoossati wonikka miththafenne shuchchafe asa kushen masetti kezida misleppe attiin xoossata gidettenna. <verse eid="ISA 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 37:20" />Ha7ikka abeet GODAWU, nu Xoossawu neni GODAY xalla Xoossa gididayssa sa7a kawoteththati ubbay erana mala nuna iza kusheppe ashsha!» gi woossides.<verse eid="ISA 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isayaasi Kawo Hizqiyaasas Yeddida Kiita</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 19:2-37">2Kawo 19:2-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 37:21" />Hessafe guye Amoxe naa Isayaasi kawo Hizqiyaasasi, «GODAY Isra7eele Xoossay, ‹Neni Asoore Kawo Senakireemey mandida mandeththa gishshas woossida woosaa ta siyadis› gees.<verse eid="ISA 37:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 37:22" />«GODAY Senakireeme gishshas yootida qaalay,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:22">«Geela7oya Xiyoone naya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:22">nena kadhadussinne leqqadus.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:22">Yerusalaame naya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:22">ne baqatishin be7ada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:22">ba qoodhe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:22">qaaththadus.<verse eid="ISA 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 37:23" />Ne oona cayaynne kawushshay?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:23">Oona bolla ne qaala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:23">dhoqqu histta haasayay?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:23">Otoro ayfen oona xeellay?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:23">Isra7eele Geeshshaa bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:23">gidennee!<verse eid="ISA 37:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 37:24" />Neni kiittida asata baggara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:24">Godaa bolla daro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:24">cashsha qaala haasayadasa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:24">Qasseka, ‹Tani cora para-gaaretan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:24">zumata kaara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:24">Libaanoose hu7e kezadis.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:24">Histtada adussa zigatanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:24">ubbaafe lo7iza xiiddata qanxxadis.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:24">Tani keehi dhoqqasohotaninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:24">keehi kayshiza woran gakkadis.<verse eid="ISA 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 37:25" />Tani allaga biittatan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:25">haaththa ollata bookkadis,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:25">isttafekka haath uyadis.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:25">Gibxe biittan diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:25">pultto haaththata ubbaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:25">ta tohon yedhdha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:25">melissadis› gadasa.<verse eid="ISA 37:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 37:26" />«Tani daro wodeppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:26">kase qachchidayssa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:26">ta beni halchchidayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:26">ne siyabeekkii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:26">Ha7i gidikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:26">polettana mala ooththadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:26">nenikka gimbettida katamata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:26">laallada shuchcha doore kessana.<verse eid="ISA 37:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 37:27" />Istta deraas wolqqay ixxides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:27">isttika dagammidanne kawuyida.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:27">Istti gaden diza doozata mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:27">mul7o caarechchata mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:27">keeththa kaaran mokkida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:27">maata malanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:27">kessontta qooyda kaththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:27">mala gidida.<verse eid="ISA 37:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 37:28" />«Gido attiin neni uttizaso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:28">ne ayde yaada ayde baanaakko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:28">ne ta bolla waana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:28">hanqon dendanaakko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:28">ta erays.<verse eid="ISA 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 37:29" />Neni ta bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:29">hanqon dendettida gishshassinne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:29">ne hallacizayssi ta hayththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:29">wodhdhida gishshas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:29">tani ne siidhen dafo aaththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:29">ne doonankka bixala barsana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:29">ne yida ogerakka ta nena</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:29">guye zaara yeddana» gides.<verse eid="ISA 37:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 37:30" />«Hessafe guye Isayaasi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:30">kawo Hizqiyaasas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:30">hayssi nees malata gido;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:30">ha layth intte azabba mokkida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:30">kath maana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:30">yiza layththika azabbaafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:30">wodhdhi mokkidaaz maana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:30">Gido attiin heedzdzanththo layth</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:30">intte zerananne maxana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:30">woyne tokkananne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:30">iza ayfekka shiishshana.<verse eid="ISA 37:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 37:31" />Yuhudappe attida cashati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:31">xapho duge yeddidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:31">bollan ayfe ayfana.<verse eid="ISA 37:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 37:32" />Attida cashati Yerusalaameppe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:32">shemppora paxa attidayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:32">Xiyooneppe kezana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:32">Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAA</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:32">zil7eteththi hessa ooththana.<verse eid="ISA 37:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ISA 37:33" />«Asoore kawo gishshas GODAY,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:33">‹Asoore kawoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:33">ha katamaa gelenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:33">izi bolla ba wondafe dukkenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:33">izi bolla ba gondalle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:33">oykkidi yeenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:33">qasse katamaa yuushon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:33">biitta dooren gordenna.<verse eid="ISA 37:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ISA 37:34" />Ba yida ogera guye simmana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:34">izi ha katamayo gelenna› gees.<verse eid="ISA 37:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ISA 37:35" />Tani ta bonchcho gishshassinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:35">ta ashkara Dawite gishshas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:35">ha katamayo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:35">kamma ashshana» gides.<verse eid="ISA 37:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ISA 37:36" />He gallassa omarsi GODAA kiitanchchay ke7idi, Asoore asay dunkkaani dizason, 185,000 attumasata wodhides. Histtiin asay maalado suuridi be7iza wode hayqqida asaa ahay heen kumides. <verse eid="ISA 37:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ISA 37:37" />Hessa gishshas Asoore Kawo Senakireemey kessi ekkides; guye simmi biidikka Nannawe kataman uttides.<verse eid="ISA 37:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ISA 37:38" />Sanaakireemi ba xoossaa Nisraake keeththan goynnishe de7ishin, iza nayti Adiramelekeynne Sarsarey mashshan iza wodhida. Histtidi Araraate biitta baqatida. Iza naa Aseradooney izasohon kawotides.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">37:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibraaweta qaalara Asiraadooni Esar-Haddon geetettees.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 37:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="ISA 38" />
  <para style="s1">Hargefe Hizqiyaasa Paxo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 20:1-11">2Kawo 20:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 32:24-26">2Taari 32:24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 38:1" />He wode Kawo Hizqiyaasi hargidi, hayqqana matides. Histtiin Amoxe naa nabe Isayaasi izakko biidi, «GODAY nena, ‹Neni hayqqanaappe attiin hargezappe paxakka; hessa gishshas ne keeththaa giigsa› gees» gides.<verse eid="ISA 38:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 38:2" />Histtiin Hizqiyaasi keeththa godaakko simmidi GODAA woossides. <verse eid="ISA 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 38:3" />Woossishe, «Abeet GODAWU, tani ne sinththan ammaneteththaninne kumeththa wozinappe nena ufayssiza miish ooththashe ta waana de7idaakko neni akeekana mala tani nena woossays» gi woossides; Hizqiyaasikka keehi camo yeeho yeekkides.<verse eid="ISA 38:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 38:4" />Hessafe guye GODAA qaalay Isayaasakko yides. <verse eid="ISA 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 38:5" />Histtidi, «Neni baada Hizqiyaasa, ‹GODAY ne aawaa Dawite Xoossay, Tani ne woosaa siyadis; ne afunththaaka be7adis. Ne layththa bolla tani nees tammanne ichchashu layth gujjana. <verse eid="ISA 38:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 38:6" />Nenanne ha katamayo Asoore biitta kawoza kusheppe ashshana; tani ha katamay bolla yizayssa teqqana› gees» gides.<verse eid="ISA 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 38:7" />Isayaasi gujjidikka, «GODAY nees gida qaala polanayssas malatay hayssafe kaallizayssa; <verse eid="ISA 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 38:8" />beya, Akaazey pude ke7anaas giigsida kechchata bolla wodhdhiza awa kuway tammu kech guye simmi baana mala tani ooththana» gides. Histtiin kuway tammu kech guye simmidi bides.<verse eid="ISA 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 38:9" />Yuhuda kawo Hizqiyaasi hargi paxidaappe guyen xaafida qaalay hayssafe kaallizayssa; <verse eid="ISA 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 38:10" />tani, «Ta de7o layththas buron bagga gakkiza wode, hayqo pengera gelana bessizee? Taas attida layththay taappe bonqqettanaas bessizee?» gadis.<verse eid="ISA 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 38:11" />Qasseka, «Tani shemppora paxa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:11">de7izayta biittan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:11">nena GODAA zaara be7ikke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:11">hayssafe guyen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:11">ta asa zereth be7ikke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:11">ha sa7an de7izayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:11">giddonkka de7ikke.<verse eid="ISA 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 38:12" />Ta keeththi heenththanchchata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:12">dunkaane mala shodettides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:12">taappeka ekettides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:12">Shemmaaney afala wondiraashen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:12">xaaxiza mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:12">tani ta de7o xaaxadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:12">izikka tana wondiraasheppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:12">duuththides.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:12">Malladoppe omars gakkanaas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:12">neni tana dhayssanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:12">eesotadasa.<verse eid="ISA 38:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 38:13" />Sa7ay wonttana gakkanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:13">tani nena dandayan naagadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:13">Gido attiin gaammo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:13">mala ta meqeththaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:13">ubbaa menththereththides.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:13">Qasse maaladoppe omarsi gakkanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:13">neni tana dhayssanaas eesotadasa.<verse eid="ISA 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 38:14" />Tani cirashanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:14">haaththa kafo mala waassadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:14">haraphphe malakka guugumadis.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:14">Ta ayfeti pude salo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:14">xeellidi daaburda.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:14">Abeet Godawu, tani un7ettadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:14">neni tana hannife kessa!» gadis.<verse eid="ISA 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 38:15" />Histtiin ta ay gaanee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:15">Izi ba hu7era taas yootides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:15">qasseka ba hu7era</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:15">hayssa ooththides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:15">Ta shemppoya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:15">keehippe ceecida gishshas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:15">ta de7o layth ubbaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:15">ashketeththan baana.<verse eid="ISA 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 38:16" />Abeet Godawu heytantta mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:16">yo7otan asay paxa dees.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:16">Ta ayanaykka heytanttan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:16">de7o demmana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:16">Ne tana paththadasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:16">tana shemppora paxa woththadasa!<verse eid="ISA 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 38:17" />Hekko ta meton ceecidayssi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:17">taas go7as gidides.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:17">Neni ta shemppo bashsha ollafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:17">ne siiqon naagadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:17">neni ta nagara ubbaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:17">neeppe guye zaarada oladasa.<verse eid="ISA 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 38:18" />Duufoy nena galatenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:18">hayqoykka nena sabbenna.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:18">Duge ollan wodhdhizayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:18">ne ammaneteth hidota oosettenna.<verse eid="ISA 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 38:19" />Tani hach nena galatizayssa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:19">shemppora paxa de7izayti xalla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:19">nena galatana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:19">ne ammaneteththa gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:19">aawati ba naytas yooteettes.<verse eid="ISA 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 38:20" />GODAY tana ashshana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:20">hessa gishshas nuni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:20">nu de7iza layththata ubbaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:20">GODAA keeththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:20">waaxettida diiththan yexxana.<verse eid="ISA 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 38:21" />Isayaasi kase, «Balase miththa ayfe daaxxidi, iza kixaa bolla woththite. Histtiko izi paxana»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:21">gi woththides.<verse eid="ISA 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 38:22" />Hizqiyaasikka, «Tani paxada GODAA Keeth pude kezanayssas malatay aazee?» giidi Isayaasa oychchi woththides.<verse eid="ISA 38:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="ISA 39" />
  <para style="s1">Baabilooneppe Kiitetti Yida Asata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 20:12-19">2Kawo 20:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 39:1" />He wode Baabiloone kawoy Balidaane naa, Marodoke-Baldaaney Hizqiyaasi hargi paxida gishshas dabdaabbenne imota izas yeddides. <verse eid="ISA 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 39:2" />Hizqiyaasi kiitettidayta ufayssan mokki ekkides; histtidi kawo minjja keeththan diza biraa, worqqaa, dumma dumma sawota, doorettida zayte, qasse ola miishshaa, izas diza miish ubbaa issinokka ashshontta dishe bessides. Iza minjja keeththan diza miish gidiin iza kawoteththa garsan diza miish ubbaa bessontta ashshida miishshi deenna.<verse eid="ISA 39:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 39:3" />Hessafe guye nabe Isayaasi kawo Hizqiyaasakko yiidi, «Ha asati nena ay gidoo? Istti neekko awappe yidoo?» gi oychchides.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ISA 39:3">Hizqiyaasikka zaaridi izas, «Ha asati taakko haako biittafe Baabilooneppe yida» gides.<verse eid="ISA 39:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 39:4" />Isayaasi qasseka, «Ne kawoteththa keeththafe ay be7idoo?» gides.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ISA 39:4">Hizqiyaasi, «Ta kawoteththa keeththan diza ubbaa be7ida; ta bessontta ashshida issi miishshika deenna» gides.<verse eid="ISA 39:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 39:5" />Hessafe guye Isayaasi Hizqiyaasas, «Ubbaafe Wolqqama GODAY gizayssa siya; <verse eid="ISA 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 39:6" />‹Ne kawoteththa keeththan diza ubbay, kase ne aawati hach gakkanaas shiishshida ubbay di7ettidi Baabiloone baana wodey yaana; issinokka ashshontta maxi efiza wodey yaana› gees GODAY. <verse eid="ISA 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 39:7" />Neeppe yelettidaytinne ne zereththafe yelettidayti di7etti biidi Baabiloone kawo keeththan gundula gididi ooththana» gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 1:1-7">Daane 1:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 24:10-16">2Kawo 24:10-16</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:10">2Taari 36:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 39:8" />Hizqiyaasi zaaridi, «Neni yootida GODAA qaalay lo7o» gides. Hizqiyaasi, «Tani de7ida layththan taas saronne woppa gido» gi qoppida gishshassa.<verse eid="ISA 39:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="ISA 40" />
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Dere Minththeththiza Qaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 40:1" />Intte Xoossay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:1">«Minththeththite! Ta dereza minththeththite!<verse eid="ISA 40:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 40:2" />Yerusalaameskka shugo qaalara yootite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:2">izis awajjite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:2">iza aylleteththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:2">ooththiza wodey wurides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:2">izi nagara waagay cigettides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:2">iza ba nagara ubbaa gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:2">GODAAPPE nam7u kushe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:2">qixaate ekkadus» gees.<verse eid="ISA 40:2" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 40:3" />Awajja yootizaade cenggurssi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:3">«Bazzon GODAA oge giigsite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:3">nu Xoossaas Aaraba bazzon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:3">aako oge giigsite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:3">Mato 3:3</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:3">Mar 1:3</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:23">Yoha 1:23</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 40:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 40:4" />Shoobbay ubbay pude dhoqqu gaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:4">zumaynne zumbullay ziqqi gaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:4">kundukurcco biittay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:4">issi gina gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:4">kurppoti demba gidana.<verse eid="ISA 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 40:5" />He wode GODAA bonchchoy qonccana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:5">asho may7ida ubbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:5">hessa issife be7ana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:5">GODAA doonay hessa haasaydes» gees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:3-5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 3:4-6">Luqa 3:4-6</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 40:6" />Cenggurssi tana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:6">«Waassa!» gides.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:6">Tanikka, «Ay ga waassoo?» gadis.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:6">Izikka, «Asi ubbay maata mala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:6">iza bonchcho ubbayka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:6">demba ciishsha mala.<verse eid="ISA 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 40:7" />GODAY ba shempo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:7">iza bollan shempishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:7">maatay melees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:7">ciishshika qokkees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:7">tumappe derey maata mala.<verse eid="ISA 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 40:8" />Maatay melees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:8">ciishshayka qokkees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:8">gido attiin nu Xoossaa qaalay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:8">mernaas minni dees»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:8">gaada waassa gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:6-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 1:10-11">Yaaqo 1:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 1:24-25">1Phex 1:24-25</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 40:9" />Nenoo mishiraachcho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:9">Xiyoones yootizaysso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:9">dhoqqa zuma bolla keza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:9">nenoo mishiraachcho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:9">Yerusalaames yootizaysso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:9">ne cenggurssaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:9">dhoqqu histta waassa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:9">dhoqqu histta, babbofa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:9">Yuhuda katamatas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:9">«Hekko intte Xoossaa»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:9">gaada yoota.<verse eid="ISA 40:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 40:10" />Hekko Ubbaa Haariza GODAY</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:10">wolqqara yees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:10">iza qesey iza gishshas haarana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:10">Be7ite iza woytoy izara dees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:10">izi ciggana ooso waagaykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:10">izara dees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 62:11">Isa 62:11</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:12">Ajju 22:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 40:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 40:11" />Izi ba wude</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:11">heenththanchcha mala heemmees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:11">ba laaqqatakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:11">ba qesen tookkees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:11">ba ki7onkka idimmees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:11">dhanththizaytakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:11">loddara kaaleththees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 34:15">Hizi 34:15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:11">Yoha 10:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 40:12" />Haaththata ba kushe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:12">kuphphen makkiday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:12">salota tadhdhakiday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:12">baana daachchon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:12">makki oykkiday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:12">zumata ba meezaanen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:12">zumbullatakka meezaanen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:12">woththiday oonee?<verse eid="ISA 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 40:13" />GODAA Ayana shaakki eriday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:13">iza zorizaade gidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:13">tamaarsiday oonee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:34">Oro 11:34</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 2:16">1Qoro 2:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 40:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 40:14" />Erateth demmanaas GODAY</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:14">oona zore oychchidee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:14">Suure oge iza tamaarsiday oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:14">Erateth iza tamaarsiday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:14">akeeka ogekka iza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:14">bessiday oonee?<verse eid="ISA 40:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 40:15" />Be7ite kawoteththati gombo giddon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:15">xokkida haaththa mala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:15">istti meezaane bolla diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:15">gudulla mala qoodetteettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:15">harurota liiqo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:15">biitta mala geeddarees.<verse eid="ISA 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 40:16" />Libaanoosey yarshosoho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:16">tamas gidukku;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:16">izi medosata qoodaykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:16">xuugettiza yarshos guuththa.<verse eid="ISA 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 40:17" />Kawoteththati ubbay iza sinththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:17">aykkoka gidettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:17">istti aykkorakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:17">gakki qoodettontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:17">hada miishsha mala.<verse eid="ISA 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 40:18" />Histtiin intte Xoossaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:18">oonara giniseetii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:18">Ay mislera gaththi giniseetii?<verse eid="ISA 40:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 40:19" />Eeqa misley gidikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:19">hiilla kushen masettides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:19">hessa worqqa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:19">ooththizaadey bollara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:19">worqqan meeshees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:19">bira sansalatakka izas giigssees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:18-19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:29">Hawa 17:29</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 40:20" />Hessa mala yarsho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:20">shiishshanaas dandayontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:20">manqo asi musontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:20">mith doorees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:20">kundontta misle essanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:20">erettida hiilla koyees.<verse eid="ISA 40:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 40:21" />Intte hessa erekketii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:21">Woykko siyibeekketii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:21">Beni beni inttes yootettibeennee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:21">Sa7ay medhettoosofe doommiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:21">intte akeekibeekketii?<verse eid="ISA 40:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 40:22" />Izi biitta yuushoppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:22">bollara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:22">ba araatan uttees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:22">biitta bolla diza derey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:22">boole mala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:22">salota magalasha mala miccees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:22">duussaso dunkaane mala tokkees.<verse eid="ISA 40:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 40:23" />Halaqata hada histtana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:23">ha biittaa ayssizaytakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:23">pitti dhayssees.<verse eid="ISA 40:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 40:24" />Istti tokettidi gam7ontta dishin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:24">zerettidi takkontta dishin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:24">buro xapho yeddontta dishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:24">istta bolla carko yeddiin melida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:24">gotey istta suulla mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:24">pitti efides.<verse eid="ISA 40:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 40:25" />Geeshshazi isttas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:25">«Tana oonara giniseetii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:25">Tanara ginattizay oonee?» gees.<verse eid="ISA 40:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 40:26" />Intte ayfe dhoqqu histtidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:26">pude salo xeellite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:26">haytantta ubbaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:26">medhdhiday oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:26">Salo xoolintteta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:26">issaa issaa kessizay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:26">istta sunththan sunththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:26">xeygizay iza.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:26">Izi ba gitateththaninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:26">ba erateththa minoteththaafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:26">dendidayssan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:26">isttafe issoyka dhayenna.<verse eid="ISA 40:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 40:27" />Yaaqoobe ne ays hessaththo gay?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:27">Isra7eele ne ays hessaththo haasayay?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:27">«Ta ogey GODAAPPE geemmides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:27">ta pirday Xoossa achchan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:27">wudu geetettibeenna» ays gay?<verse eid="ISA 40:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 40:28" />Ne erabeekkii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:28">Ne siyabeekkii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:28">GODAY mernaa Xoossa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:28">izi biittaa ubbaaka medhdhidayssa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:28">Izi daaburenna; azallenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:28">iza akeekaykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:28">oonankka pilggettenna.<verse eid="ISA 40:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 40:29" />Minoteththi bayndaades</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:29">minoteth immees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:29">Daaburdayssas wolqqa gujjees.<verse eid="ISA 40:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 40:30" />Yelagatikka daabureettessinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:30">azalleettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:30">naateththatikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:30">dhuphettidi kundeettes;<verse eid="ISA 40:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 40:31" />Gido attiin GODAA</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:31">hidota ooththizayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:31">bantta wolqqa ooraxisseettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:31">istti golle mala piradhdhana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:31">istti daaburontta woxxana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:31">istti baana; argacettenna.<verse eid="ISA 40:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="ISA 41" />
  <para style="s1">Isra7eele Maado</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 41:1" />GODAY, «Intteno harurotoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:1">co7u giite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:1">kawoteththati ba wolqqa ooraththetto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:1">shiiqidi haasayetto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:1">ane pirda shilota</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:1">sinththan gayttoos.<verse eid="ISA 41:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 41:2" />Arshey mokkiza baggafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:2">issaa denththiday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:2">xilloteththan baas haggazissana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:2">xeygiday oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:2">Izi kawoteththata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:2">izas aaththi immees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:2">izi istta giththa mashshan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:2">biitta kessides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:2">ba wondafen carkoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:2">laallida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:2">suulla mala kessides.<verse eid="ISA 41:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 41:3" />Istta gooddi yeddidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:3">metoy baynda aadhdhi bides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:3">iza tohoy kase yedhdhontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:3">ogera hemettides;<verse eid="ISA 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 41:4" />Hayssa ooththidaynne poliday</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:4">yeletaa beniisofe xeygiday oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:4">GODAY koyroytarakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:4">wurseththaytarakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:4">dizay tana» gees.<verse eid="ISA 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 41:5" />Haruroti be7idi yayyida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:5">sa7a gaxatikka kokkorida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:5">issi bolla shiiqidi sinth yida.<verse eid="ISA 41:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 41:6" />Issoy issaara maadettees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:6">ba ishaakka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:6">«Aykkoy baa minna» gees.<verse eid="ISA 41:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 41:7" />Hiillanchchay worqqa ooththizayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:7">minththeththees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:7">naariqan qoxxi le7issizaadey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:7">birata marcon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:7">seerisizayssa minththeththees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:7">birata seerisi oyseththoy,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:7">«Lo7o» gees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:7">eeqa xoossaa misley</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:7">kundontta mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:7">misimaaren torggees.<verse eid="ISA 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 41:8" />GODAY, «Gido attiin nenoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:8">ta ashkara Isra7eele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:8">ta doorida Yaaqoobe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:8">ta laggeza Abrahaame</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:8">zereththazoo,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 20:7">2Taari 20:7</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 2:23">Yaaqo 2:23</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 41:9" />tani nena biitta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:9">gaxappe ehidayssoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:9">saloy danxxoosoppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:9">xeygidayssoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:9">‹Ta nena ta ayllezoo›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:9">gidayssoo ta nena</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:9">dooradis attiin olaagabeekke.<verse eid="ISA 41:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 41:10" />Tani nenara diza gishshas yayyofa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:10">tani ne Xoossa gidida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:10">dagammofa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:10">Tani nena</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:10">minththananne maaddana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:10">Ta xilloteththa ushachcha kushen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:10">zemppisa oykkana.<verse eid="ISA 41:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 41:11" />«Be7a ne bolla hanqettida ubbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:11">keehi yeellatananne kawuyana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:11">nenara eqettizayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:11">tim7i gi dhayana.<verse eid="ISA 41:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 41:12" />Neni ne morkketakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:12">koyadakka demmaka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:12">nena olizayti pitetti dhayana.<verse eid="ISA 41:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 41:13" />Gaasoykka tani GODAA ne Xoossay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:13">ta nena maaddana; yayyofa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:13">ta ne ushachcha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:13">kusheza oykkana.<verse eid="ISA 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 41:14" />Nenoo guxunezoo Yaaqoobe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:14">nenoo qeeri Isra7eele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:14">‹Yayyofa tani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:14">nena maaddana› gees.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:14">Nena wozzizay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:14">Isra7eele Geeshshaza.<verse eid="ISA 41:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 41:15" />Be7a tani nena oorath,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:15">qaranne achchara diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:15">kath bukkiza loda ooththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:15">neni zumata goya liiqisana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:15">zumbullatakka yedhdha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:15">happa kessana.<verse eid="ISA 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 41:16" />Neni istta suraggana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:16">carkoy istta pitti efana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:16">goteykka istta laallana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:16">Gido attiin neni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:16">GODAAN ufayettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:16">qasse Isra7eele Geeshshan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:16">bonchchettana.<verse eid="ISA 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 41:17" />Hiyeesatinne metotanchchati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:17">haath koyana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:17">gido attiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:17">aykkoka demmettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:17">haaththa saamon isttas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:17">poorandey melides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:17">Gido attiin tani GODAY</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:17">isttas zaaro immana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:17">tani Isra7eele Xoossay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:17">istta yegga aggike.<verse eid="ISA 41:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 41:18" />Tani bulattida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:18">zumbullata bolla shaafata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:18">shoobbatan pulttota dhuussana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:18">bazzo biitta eele haath,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:18">saamettida biittaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:18">haaththa pultto kessana.<verse eid="ISA 41:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 41:19" />Bazzo biittan ziga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:19">odoro, barseneetenne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:19">wogara mith moyzana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:19">aykkoy baynda bazzon xiidda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:19">guunththanne oonth tokkana.<verse eid="ISA 41:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 41:20" />Hessa gishshas asay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:20">hessa be7ananne erana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:20">GODAA kushey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:20">hayssa ooththidayssa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:20">Isra7eele Geeshshay medhdhidayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:20">istti issife yuushshi qoppananne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:20">akeekana» gees.<verse eid="ISA 41:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossay Wordo Xoossata Ixxees</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 41:21" />GODAY,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:21">«Ane intte mooto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:21">ekkidi haa shiiqite» gees.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:21">Yaaqoobe Kawoy, «Ane intte mooto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:21">daafaa haa ehite» gees.<verse eid="ISA 41:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 41:22" />Buroppe hananayssa yootana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:22">intte eeqa xoossata haa ehite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:22">nu akeekana malanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:22">istta wurseththaaka erana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:22">kase yo7oti aazakko nuus yootite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:22">buroppe hanana miishshata erite.<verse eid="ISA 41:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 41:23" />Intte xoossata gididayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:23">nu erana mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:23">sinththafe hanana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:23">miishshata nuus yootite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:23">nuni dagammana malanne yayyana mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:23">lo7o gidiin woykko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:23">iita miish ooththite.<verse eid="ISA 41:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 41:24" />Hekko intte aykko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:24">qoodan gelonttayta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:24">intte oosoy mulekka hada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:24">inttena dooridayti harassizayta.<verse eid="ISA 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 41:25" />«Tani pudeha baggafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:25">issaa denththadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:25">izikka yees.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:25">Arshey mokkiza baggara yizayssi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:25">ta sunththaa xeygizayssa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:25">manay urqqa yedhdhiza mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:25">izi kaaleththizaytakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:25">yedhdhees.<verse eid="ISA 41:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 41:26" />Nuni erana mala koyrotti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:26">nuus awajjiday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:26">‹Izi likke› nu gaana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:26">nuus kaseti yootiday oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:26">Oonikka yootibeenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:26">sinththatidi yootiday deenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:26">inttefe ay qaala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:26">siyidaykka deenna.<verse eid="ISA 41:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 41:27" />Koyrottada, ‹Hekko tani be7adis›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:27">gaada Xiyoones awajjiday tana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:27">Yerusalaames mishiraachcho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:27">yootizaade immadis.<verse eid="ISA 41:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 41:28" />Tani xeelliza wode oonikka deenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:28">istta giddon zoranchchay baawa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:28">ta oychchida wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:28">zaaro immizaykka deenna.<verse eid="ISA 41:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 41:29" />Be7ite istti ubbayka hada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:29">istta oososka go7ay deenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:29">istta misletikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:29">aykkoy baynda carko mala» gees.<verse eid="ISA 41:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="ISA 42" />
  <para style="s1">Godaa Ashkara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 42:1" />GODAY, «Tani kaafa oykkida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:1">ta ashkaray,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:1">ta izan ufayettiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:1">muurutay hayssa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:1">tani ta Ayana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:1">iza bolla woththadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:1">izi kawoteththatas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:1">suure pirda ehana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:17">Mato 17:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:5">17:5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:22">Mar 3:22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">9:35</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 42:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 42:2" />Waassenna; ba qaala dhoqqisenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:2">ba cenggurssaaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:2">oge bolla keehi sissenna.<verse eid="ISA 42:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 42:3" />Dinccettida maqqa izi menththenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:3">cuwattiza muqaadda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:3">izi toyssenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:3">ammaneteththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:3">izi suure pirda ehana.<verse eid="ISA 42:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 42:4" />Izi biitta bolla suure pirda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:4">ehana gakkanaas daaburenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:4">hidotakka qanxxenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:4">haruroti iza wogan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:4">ammanettana» gees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:1-4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:18-21">Mato 12:18-21</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 42:5" />Salota medhdhiday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:5">istta miccidaykka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:5">sa7anne izin diza ubbaa giigsiday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:5">ba deres peeno</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:5">izin de7iza asatas shemppo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:5">immiza GODAA Xoossay,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:24-25">Hawa 17:24-25</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 42:6" />«Tani GODAY</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:6">nena xilloteththan xeygadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:6">ta ne kushe oykkana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:6">ta nena naagana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:6">Tani nena kawoteththaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:6">caaqo qaala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:6">ayzaabetaska poo7o histtana<verse eid="ISA 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 42:7" />Ne qooqeta ayfe doy7ana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:7">di7ettidayta qasho keeththafe birshana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:7">dhuman uttidaytakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:7">karchchallefe kessana.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">42:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Karchchalle guussi qasho keeththa woykko woyne keeththa.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 42:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 42:8" />«Tani GODAA; hayssi ta sunththa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:8">ta bonchcho haras aaththa immike;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:8">ta galataakka eeqa xoossatas sheedhdhike.<verse eid="ISA 42:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 42:9" />Be7ite beni yo7oti polettida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:9">ha7i tani ooraththa miish awajjays;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:9">izi mokkanaappe sinth</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:9">ta inttes yootays» gees.<verse eid="ISA 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Galata Yeth</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 42:10" />Intteno duge abban wodhdhizaytoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:10">heen diza ubbatoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:10">Intteno harurotoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:10">Heenkka diza ubbatoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:10">GODAASSI ooraththa mazamure yexxite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:10">biittaa gaxaappe doommidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:10">izas galata mazamure shiishshite.<verse eid="ISA 42:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 42:11" />Bazzoynne katamati bantta cenggurssaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:11">dhoqqu histtetto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:11">Qeedaarey de7iza gutay ufayetto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:11">Seela dere asati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:11">ufayssan yexetto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:11">zuma xeerankka ililetto.<verse eid="ISA 42:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 42:12" />Istti bonchcho GODAAS immetto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:12">iza galataykka harurotan awajjetto.<verse eid="ISA 42:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 42:13" />GODAY ola qara mala kezana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:13">olanchcha mala ho7etti dendana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:13">Ceeqeteththa gayro sissana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:13">ba morkketakka oli xoonana.<verse eid="ISA 42:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Goday Ba Deraa Maaddana Immida Hidota</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 42:14" />GODAY, «Tani adussa wodeesofe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:14">co7u gadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:14">sirphi gadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:14">tana qum7a oykkadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:14">ha7i gidikko miixa oykettida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:14">maccassa mala waassays;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:14">sheenottayssinne bannakays.<verse eid="ISA 42:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 42:15" />Tani zumatanne zumbullata woddisana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:15">doozata ubbaa melissana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:15">Shaafata haruro biitta kessana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:15">eele haaththatakka micinchchana.<verse eid="ISA 42:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 42:16" />Tani qooqeta istti erontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:16">oge kaaleththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:16">istti meezetontta ogerakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:16">ta istta efana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:16">dhumaza ta istta sinththan poo7isana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:16">kundukurcco sohota ta giigsana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:16">haytantta ubbaa ta ooththontta aggike.<verse eid="ISA 42:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 42:17" />Eeqa xoossatan ammanettizayti gidikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:17">misletakka, ‹Intte nu xoossata› gizayti guye simmana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:17">istti mulera kawuyana» gees.<verse eid="ISA 42:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isra7eele Asaa Qooqeteththinne Tulleteth</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 42:18" />GODAY, «Intteno tulletoo siyite!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:18">intteno qooqetoo be7itenne xeellite!<verse eid="ISA 42:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 42:19" />Ta ashkaraappe attiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:19">hara qooqey oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:19">Tani kiittidaadefe attiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:19">hara tulley oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:19">taas ammanettidaade mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:19">qooqey,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:19">GODAA ashkara mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:19">qooqey oonee?<verse eid="ISA 42:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 42:20" />Daro miish be7ideta shin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:20">akeekibeekketa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:20">intte hayththay doya dees shin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:20">siyekketa» gees.<verse eid="ISA 42:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 42:21" />GODAY ba xilloteththaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:21">gishshas giidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:21">ba wogaa gitanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:21">bonchcho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:21">kessida gishshas ufayettides.<verse eid="ISA 42:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 42:22" />Ha derey bogettidanne bonqqettida,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:22">olla giddon wodhdhida,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:22">woyne keeththay iza bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:22">gordettida dere;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:22">istti bogettida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:22">istta ashshizaadey deenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:22">istti di7ettida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:22">«Istta zaarite» gizaykka baawa.<verse eid="ISA 42:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 42:23" />Intte giddofe hayssa siyizay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:23">sinththafe yaana wodes</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:23">akeeki siyizay oonee?<verse eid="ISA 42:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 42:24" />Yaaqoobey bogettana mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:24">Isra7eeley di7ettana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:24">ooththiday oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:24">Nagara ooththidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:24">nu qohida GODAA gidennee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:24">Istti iza oge kaallanaassinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:24">iza wogaas azazettana koyontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:24">aggida gishshassa.<verse eid="ISA 42:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 42:25" />Hessa gishshas eexxiza ba hanqoza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:25">iita ola istta bolla yeddides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:25">tama lacon istta giddoththides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:25">istti gidikko hessa akeekibeettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:25">istta xuuggides shin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:25">istti wozinan woththibeettenna.<verse eid="ISA 42:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="ISA 43" />
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Deraa Ashshizaade</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 43:1" />Ha7i gidikko Yaaqoobe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:1">nena medhdhiday,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:1">Isra7eele! Nena giigsida GODAY,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:1">«Tani nena</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:1">wozzida gishshas yayyofa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:1">Tani nena ne sunththan xeygadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:1">neni taassa.<verse eid="ISA 43:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 43:2" />Neni haaththa giddora pinniza wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:2">tani nenara gidana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:2">Neni pinnishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:2">shaafay nena mittenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:2">neni tama giddora bishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:2">nena xuuggenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:2">tama lacoykka nena meenna.<verse eid="ISA 43:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 43:3" />Gaasoykka tani GODAA ne Xoossay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:3">Isra7eele Geeshshay nees dhale;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:3">Ta ne gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:3">Gibxe wozzo immana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:3">Tophphiyanne Seeba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:3">ne gishshas aaththa immana.<verse eid="ISA 43:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 43:4" />Neni ta sinththan al7onne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:4">bonchcho gidida gishshas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:4">tani nena siiqiza gishshas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:4">asaa ne gishshas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:4">kawoteththata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:4">ne shemppo gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:4">laame immana.<verse eid="ISA 43:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 43:5" />«Tani nenara diza gishshas yayyofa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:5">tani ne nayta arshey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:5">mokkiza baggafe ehana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:5">nena arshey wulliza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:5">baggafe shiishshana.<verse eid="ISA 43:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 43:6" />Tani pudeha bagga, ‹Hamma›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:6">dugeha baggaka, ‹Yedda› gaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:6">ta attuma nayta haahoppe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:6">ta macca naytakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:6">biitta gaxappe,<verse eid="ISA 43:6" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 43:7" />ta sunththan xeygettida ubbaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:7">ta bonchchos ta medhdhidayta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:7">tani giigsidayssanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:7">ta ooththidayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:7">hammite» gaana.<verse eid="ISA 43:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 43:8" />Ayfey dishin qooqidayta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:8">hayththika dishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:8">tullidayta kessa.<verse eid="ISA 43:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 43:9" />Kawoteththati ubbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:9">issife shiiqetto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:9">asaykka issi bolla shiiqo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:9">isttafe kasetidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:9">hayssa nuus yootiday oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:9">Beni miish nuus awajjiday oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:9">Harati siyidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:9">«Hayssi tuma» gaana mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:9">istta tumateththayka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:9">qonccana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:9">bantta markkata ehetto.<verse eid="ISA 43:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 43:10" />«Intte tana erana malanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:10">ammanana mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:10">izi tana gididayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:10">intte akeekana mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:10">ta markkatinne ta doorida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:10">ta aylleti inttena.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:10">Taappe kase</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:10">hara xoossi oosettibeenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:10">taappe guyenkka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:10">hara xoossi deenna.<verse eid="ISA 43:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 43:11" />Tana; tani GODAA;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:11">Taappe attiin hara ashshizay deenna.<verse eid="ISA 43:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 43:12" />Tani qonccisadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:12">ashshadissinne yootadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:12">intte giddon hara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:12">allaga xoossi de7ibeenna.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:12">Tani Xoossa gididayssas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:12">intte ta markkatta.<verse eid="ISA 43:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 43:13" />Beniisofe doommada tani tana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:13">ta kusheppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:13">kessi ekkanay deenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:13">ta ooththizayssa laammanawu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:13">dandayzay oonee?» gees GODAY.<verse eid="ISA 43:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ammanettontta Isra7eeles Xoossa Maaroteth</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 43:14" />GODAY inttena wozziza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:14">Isra7eele Geeshshay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:14">«Intte gishshas Baabiloone bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:14">olanchchata kiittana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:14">istti ceeqettiza markabetan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:14">Baabilooneta ubbaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:14">beettana mala ooththana.<verse eid="ISA 43:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 43:15" />Tani GODAY intte Geeshshay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:15">Isra7eele medhdhida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:15">intte kawo» gees.<verse eid="ISA 43:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 43:16" />Abbaa giddora oge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:16">wolqqama haaththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:16">giddora aadhdhizaso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:16">kessida GODAY,<verse eid="ISA 43:16" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 43:17" />para-gaaretanne parata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:17">olanchchatanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:17">mino asata ubbaa ehidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:17">istti zaari dendontta mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:17">zaqullisida GODAY,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:17">muqaadda bidntha mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:17">istta dhayssida GODAY,<verse eid="ISA 43:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 43:18" />«Beni yo7ota hassa7opite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:18">kase aadhdhidayssa balite.<verse eid="ISA 43:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 43:19" />Hekko ta ooraththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:19">miish ooththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:19">izikka ha7i hanana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:19">intte yuushshi qoppeketii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:19">Tani bazzon oge giigsana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:19">tani aykkoy baynda bazzonkka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:19">shaafata kessana.<verse eid="ISA 43:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 43:20" />Bazzo do7ati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:20">worakanatinne guttoti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:20">tana bonchchana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:20">Tani bazzo biittan haath,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:20">aykkoy baynda bazzonkka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:20">pultto immana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:20">ta doorida ta deraas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:20">haath immana.<verse eid="ISA 43:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 43:21" />Tani taas giigsida derey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:21">ta galataa awajjana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:21">ta hayssa ooththana.<verse eid="ISA 43:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 43:22" />«Yaaqoobe, ne tana xeygabeekka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:22">Isra7eele, ne tana salettadasa.<verse eid="ISA 43:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 43:23" />Neni taas xuugettiza yarshos</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:23">dors ehabeekka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:23">ne yarshonkka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:23">tana bonchchabeekka.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:23">Tani nena kaththa yarshon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:23">waayisabeekke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:23">exaane yarshonkka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:23">saleththabeekke.<verse eid="ISA 43:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 43:24" />Neni taas lo7o</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:24">sawiza exaane shammabeekka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:24">modhdho yarshon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:24">tana kalssabeekka.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:24">Gido attiin ne nagara tooho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:24">tana toossadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:24">qohon tana daaburissadasa.<verse eid="ISA 43:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 43:25" />«Ta gishshas gaada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:25">ne qohoza dhayssizay tani tana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:25">ne nagaraa ta qoppike.<verse eid="ISA 43:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 43:26" />Ane kase aadhdhidayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:26">tana qofsa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:26">ane issife shiiqidi qoodhettoos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:26">ne tumateththaa ane erisa.<verse eid="ISA 43:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 43:27" />Ne aawa koyroyssi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:27">nagara ooththides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:27">ne astamaaretikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:27">ta bolla makkallida.<verse eid="ISA 43:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 43:28" />Hessa gishshas tani ne Xoossa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:28">Keeththa halaqata kawushshana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:28">Yaaqoobe bashshas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:28">Isra7eelekka cashshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:28">aaththa immana» gees.<verse eid="ISA 43:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="ISA 44" />
  <para style="s1">Doorettida Isra7eele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 44:1" />GODAY, «Gido attiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:1">ta ashkara Yaaqoobe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:1">ta doorida Isra7eele, siya.<verse eid="ISA 44:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 44:2" />Nena medhdhiday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:2">ne aayey ulon ooththiday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:2">nena maaddiza GODAY,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:2">‹Ta ashkara Yaaqoobee!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:2">Tani doorida Yishuruune! Yayyofa.<verse eid="ISA 44:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 44:3" />Tani saamettida biittan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:3">haath gussana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:3">mela biittankka shaafa gogisana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:3">Tani ta Ayana ne zereththa bolla,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:3">ta anjjo nees</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:3">naa naa bolla gussana.<verse eid="ISA 44:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 44:4" />Istti demban cilila maata mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:4">shaafa doonan diza miththa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:4">mokkana› gees.<verse eid="ISA 44:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 44:5" />Issoy, ‹Tani GODAASSA› gaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:5">haray bana Yaaqoobe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:5">sunththan xeygana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:5">haray qasse ba kushe bolla,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:5">‹Tani GODAASSA› gi xaafana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:5">izi bana Isra7eele sunththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:5">xeygana» gees.<verse eid="ISA 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Godaappe Attiin Hara Xoossi Deenna</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 44:6" />Isra7eele kawoynne istta wozzizay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:6">GODAY Ubbaafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:6">Wolqqama Xoossay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:6">«Koyroy tana; wurseththika tana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:6">Taappe hara Xoossi baawa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 48:12">Isa 48:12</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:17">Ajju 1:17</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:13">22:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 44:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 44:7" />Ta malay ooni dizee? Ane yooto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:7">koyro ta deraas ta yoch yeggishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:7">aazi hanidaakko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:7">sinththafekka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:7">aazi hananaakko yooto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:7">ane taas qoncciso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:7">buro hanana miishsha gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:7">sinththati yooto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:7">buro yaanayssa kaseti yooto.<verse eid="ISA 44:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 44:8" />Yayyofte; dagammofte.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:8">Hayssa tani inttes</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:8">yootabeekkinaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:8">Beniisofe ta inttena</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:8">erisabeekkinaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:8">Hessas intte ta markkata.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:8">Taappe attiin hara xoossi dizee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:8">Mulekka deenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:8">woykko hara Zaallay dizee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:8">Deenna; ta oonakka erikke» gees.<verse eid="ISA 44:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 44:9" />Eeqa misleta medhdhizayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:9">ubbati hada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:9">misleta isttafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:9">ooththiza miishshatikka hada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:9">isttas yootizaytikka qooqe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:9">Isttas erateththi deenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:9">istti yeellatana.<verse eid="ISA 44:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 44:10" />Aykkoka go7ontta eeqa xoossa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:10">massi giigsizay oonee?<verse eid="ISA 44:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 44:11" />Eeqa xoos medhdhizay as attiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:11">hara gidenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:11">izinne iza misatizayti yeellatana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:11">ubbayka shiiqidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:11">issi bolla eqqetto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:11">istti dagammananne yeellatana.<verse eid="ISA 44:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 44:12" />Birata qoxxizay naariqa oykkees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:12">xiifa bonqqo bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:12">woththi ooththees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:12">eeqa xoos naariqan qoxxidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:12">misle giigssees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:12">ba mino qesen giigssees.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:12">Hessafe guye gafees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:12">wolqqa dhayees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:12">haath saamettees; daaburees.<verse eid="ISA 44:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 44:13" />Massizay wodoron wadhdhees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:13">chokken malata woththees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:13">maarssara woocees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:13">irsaasen iza bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:13">malata woththees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:13">asa misatissi giigssees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:13">asa mala puulasees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:13">goynoson efi woththees.<verse eid="ISA 44:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 44:14" />Ziga mith qanxxees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:14">wola woykko moqoththa doorees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:14">woran diza miththatara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:14">issife diccana mala aggees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:14">woykko xiidda tokkees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:14">izakka iray dichchees.<verse eid="ISA 44:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 44:15" />Asi eesos go7ettees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:15">izappe guuth ekkidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:15">taman eeththi ho7ees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:15">ukeththika izan uukkees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:15">izappe massidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:15">eeqa xoos giigssees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:15">izaskka goynnees.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:15">Eeqa xoos ooththees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:15">kundidikka izas ziggees.<verse eid="ISA 44:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 44:16" />Bagga miththaa eeththees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:16">iza bollaka quma kaththees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:16">asho izan xiixidi kalli mees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:16">tamaza ho7ishe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:16">«Eroshsho tana ho7ides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:16">tamazikka taas beettees» gees.<verse eid="ISA 44:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 44:17" />Qasse attida miththaza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:17">baas eeqa xoos giigssees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:17">hokkidi izas ziggees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:17">izakka goynnees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:17">iza woossishe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:17">«Neni ta xoossaa gidida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:17">tana ashsha» gees.<verse eid="ISA 44:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 44:18" />Istti aykkoka erettennanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:18">akeekettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:18">istti xeellontta mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:18">istta ayfey goozettides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:18">istti yuushshi qoppontta mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:18">istta wozinay gordettides.<verse eid="ISA 44:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 44:19" />Oonikka takki gi qoppibeenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:19">erateththi woykko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:19">akeekay baynda gishshas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:19">«Baggaa taman eeththadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:19">iza bonqqon kath kaththadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:19">izan asho xiixada madis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:19">histtiin attidayssan wosttada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:19">tani harassiza miish ooththanee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:19">miththa anos tani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:19">goynnana bessizee?»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:19">gaanaas dandaybeenna.<verse eid="ISA 44:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 44:20" />Eeya wozinay iza baleththiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:20">izi bidinth qam7ees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:20">bana ashshana dandayenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:20">«Hayssi taas ushachcha kushen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:20">dizay wordo gidennee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:20">gaanaas dandaybeenna.»<verse eid="ISA 44:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 44:21" />GODAY, «Isra7eele neni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:21">ta ashkara gidida gishshas,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:21">‹Yaaqoobe hayssa qoppa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:21">tani nena ooththadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:21">neni ta ashkara.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:21">Isra7eele tani nena dogikke.<verse eid="ISA 44:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 44:22" />Tani ne mooro shaara mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:22">ne nagarakka maalado tulala mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:22">qucca dhayssadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:22">tani nena wozzida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:22">ha taakko simma› » gees.<verse eid="ISA 44:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 44:23" />GODAY hayssa ooththida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:23">Salotoo yexxite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:23">ciimma biittatoo ufayssan ililite.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:23">Intteno zumatoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:23">intteno woratoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:23">miththatoo ubbay ililite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:23">gaasoykka GODAY</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:23">Yaaqoobe wozzides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:23">ba bonchcho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:23">Isra7eele bolla qonccisides.<verse eid="ISA 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yerusalaamey Asa Duussaso Gidana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 44:24" />Nena aayi ulon medhdhidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:24">wozzida GODAY,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:24">«Ubbaa medhdhada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:24">salota tarkka piddisiday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:24">sa7akka micciday tana GODAA.<verse eid="ISA 44:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 44:25" />Tani wordo nabeta malata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:25">hada ooththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:25">bitizaytakka eeya kessana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:25">Tani aadho eranchchata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:25">shira yeggana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:25">istta erateththaaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:25">hada ooththana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:20">1Qoro 1:20</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 44:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 44:26" />Ta ashkaraza qaala ta polana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:26">ta kiittidayta zore ta minththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:26">tani Yerusalaame,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:26">‹Neni asi dizaso gidana›,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:26">Yuhuda katamatakka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:26">‹Istti keexettana›,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:26">istta laaleththaaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:26">‹Tani ooraxissana› gaana.<verse eid="ISA 44:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 44:27" />Tani ciimma haaththaaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:27">‹Ne mela gida!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:27">Ne shaafatakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:27">ta melissana› gaana.<verse eid="ISA 44:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 44:28" />Qiroosekka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:28">‹Izi ta heenththanchcha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:28">izi ta shene polana› gaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:28">Yerusalaameykka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:28">‹Simma eqqu› gaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:28">Xoossa Keeththaas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:28">‹Iza yochchi yegetto› gaana» gees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:23">2Taari 36:23</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 44:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="ISA 45" />
  <para style="s1">Qiroose Dooreteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 45:1" />«Ta tiydayssas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:1">ushachchaa ta oykkidayssas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:1">kawota gith birshana malanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:1">kawoteththati iza sinththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:1">haarettana mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:1">pengeti gordettontta mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:1">iza sinththan pengeta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:1">doyanaas Qirooses GODAY,<verse eid="ISA 45:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 45:2" />Tani ne sinththara baana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:2">zumata baasa ginasana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:2">xarqimala pengeta menththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:2">birata kolatatakka qanxxana.<verse eid="ISA 45:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 45:3" />Nena ne sunththan xeygida GODAY,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:3">Isra7eele Xoossay tana gididayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:3">ne erana mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:3">geemason dagattida aqota,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:3">dhumason diza haaro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:3">ta nees immana.<verse eid="ISA 45:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 45:4" />Ta ashkara Yaaqoobe gishshassinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:4">tani doorida Isra7eele gishshas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:4">ne tana erontta aggikokka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:4">tani nena ne sunththan xeygadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:4">bonchcho sunththika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:4">nees immadis.<verse eid="ISA 45:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 45:5" />Tani GODAA;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:5">taappe haray oonikka deenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:5">taappe hara Xoossi deenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:5">ne tana erontta aggikokka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:5">ta nena minththana.<verse eid="ISA 45:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 45:6" />Hessika asay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:6">arshey mokkizasoppe biidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:6">arshey wullizaso gakkanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:6">taappe haray bayndayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:6">erana malassa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:6">Tani GODAA;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:6">taappe haray oonikka deenna.<verse eid="ISA 45:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 45:7" />Tani poo7o ooththadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:7">dhumakka medhdhadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:7">ta duresayssinne manqisays;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:7">hayssa ubbaa ooththiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:7">GODAY tana.<verse eid="ISA 45:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 45:8" />Intteno salotoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:8">bollafe xilloteth bukisite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:8">shaaratikka duge xokisite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:8">biittay doyetto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:8">atoteththi mokko.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:8">Xilloteththika izara issife dicco.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:8">Tani GODAY hessa medhdhadis.<verse eid="ISA 45:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossay Medheteththassinne Taarikes Goda</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 45:9" />«Mana miishshata giddofe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:9">bana medhdhidayssara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:9">marshettizayssas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:9">aayye ana!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:9">Urqqay bana medhdhidayssa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:9">‹Ne ay ooththay?› gi erizee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:9">Ne ooththiza oosoy,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:9">‹Nees kushey baa› gi erizee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:20">Oro 9:20</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 45:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 45:10" />Ba aawa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:10">‹Ays tana hayssaththo yeladii?›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:10">ba aayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:10">‹Ays ne hayssaththo miixattadii?›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:10">gizaades aayye ana!<verse eid="ISA 45:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 45:11" />«Isra7eele Geeshshay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:11">iza medhdhida GODAY</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:11">sinththafe hanana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:11">hanota gishshas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:11">‹Ta nayta gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:11">tana oychcheetii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:11">Ta kushe oosota gishshas azazeetii?<verse eid="ISA 45:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 45:12" />Sa7a ooththiday tana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:12">asikka izi bolla medhdhadis.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:12">Salota tani ta kushen toladis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:12">istta bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:12">salo medhetata woththadis.<verse eid="ISA 45:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 45:13" />Tani Qiroose xilloteththan denththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:13">iza oge ubbaa giigsana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:13">ta katamayo izi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:13">zaari essana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:13">di7ettida ta asaa miish</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:13">qanxxisontta coo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:13">izi mela yeddana› » gees</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:13">GODAY Ubbaafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:13">Wolqqama Xoossay.<verse eid="ISA 45:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 45:14" />GODAY, «Gibxe dureteththinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:14">Tophphiya zal7ey,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:14">qasse geesan adus gidida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:14">Saaba asatikka neekko yaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:14">neyta gidana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:14">Istti nena kaallana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:14">sansalatan qashetti neekko yiidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:14">nees goynnana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:14">isttas, ‹Tumappe GODAY</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:14">nenara dees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:14">izappe attiin hara Xoossi deenna›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:14">giidi woossana» gees.<verse eid="ISA 45:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 45:15" />Ashshiza Isra7eele Xoossawu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:15">tumappe neni nena</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:15">genththiza Xoossa.<verse eid="ISA 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 45:16" />Eeqa xoossata medhdhizayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:16">ubbay yeellatana, guuxxana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:16">issi bolla kawuyana.<verse eid="ISA 45:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 45:17" />Isra7eeley gidikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:17">GODAAN mernaa atoteth attana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:17">intteka mernaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:17">yeellatekketanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:17">kawuyekketa.<verse eid="ISA 45:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 45:18" />Salota medhdhiday izi GODAA;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:18">biitta giigsidi medhdhiday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:18">sa7as yoch yeggiday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:18">iza asa duussaso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:18">gidana mala attiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:18">coo mela woththanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:18">medhdhontta GODAY,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:18">Tani GODAA;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:18">taappe haray deenna.<verse eid="ISA 45:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 45:19" />Ta dhuma biittan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:19">geeman yootabeekke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:19">Yaaqoobe zereththatas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:19">«Tana coo hada koyite» gabeekke.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:19">Tani GODAY tuma haasayays;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:19">suure yo7o awajjays.<verse eid="ISA 45:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Salonne Sa7aa Medhdhida Xoossaanne Baabiloone Eeqata</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 45:20" />«Intteno kawoteththatappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:20">beettidaytoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:20">issife shiiqidi haayite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:20">mata shiiqite.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:20">Miththaafe oosettida eeqa xoossaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:20">tookkizaytassinne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:20">ashshanawu dandayontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:20">xoossaa woossizaytas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:20">erateththi deenna.<verse eid="ISA 45:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 45:21" />Ane intte mooto yootite; shiishshite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:21">istti ane issife</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:21">shiiqidi zoretetto.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:21">Hayssa koyrottidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:21">awajjiday oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:21">Beni yootiday oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:21">Tana GODAA gidikkinaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:21">Xilloynne Ashshiza Xoossi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:21">taappe attiin haray deenna.<verse eid="ISA 45:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 45:22" />«Intteno biittaa gaxan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:22">de7iza ubbatoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:22">taakko simmidi attite.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:22">Tani Xoossa; taappe attiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:22">haray deenna.<verse eid="ISA 45:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 45:23" />Gulbatey ubbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:23">ta sinththan gulbatana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:23">inxars ubbayka tanan caaqqana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:23">Tani tarkka ta hu7en caaqqadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:23">guye simmontta qaalay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:23">ta doonappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:23">xilloteththan kezides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:11">Oro 14:11</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 2:10-11">Pili 2:10-11</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 45:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 45:24" />«Istti ta gishshas haasayshe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:24">‹Xilloteththinne wolqqay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:24">GODAAN xalla dees› gaana» gees.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:24">Iza bolla hanqon dendidayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:24">ubbay izakko yiidi yeellatana.<verse eid="ISA 45:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 45:25" />Gido attiin Isra7eele zereth ubbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:25">GODAAN xillana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:25">bonchchoka demmana.<verse eid="ISA 45:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="ISA 46" />
  <para style="s1">Baabiloone Xoossata</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 46:1" />Beeley kawuyides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:1">Neboy keehi guuxxides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:1">istta eeqa xoossati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:1">caana mehetan caanettida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:1">istti oykki yuuyiza misleti tooho;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:1">daaburda medosatas deexo ba7o.<verse eid="ISA 46:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 46:2" />Isttika issi bolla duge gufannana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:2">caanaakka ashshana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:2">dandayettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:2">isttika di7ettidi baana.<verse eid="ISA 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 46:3" />GODAY, «Intteno Yaaqoobe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:3">soo asatoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:3">Isra7eeleppe attida ubbatoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:3">Intte intte aayi ulon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:3">shaara attoosafe haa simmiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:3">inttena ta oykkidaytoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:3">Intte yelettoosofe doommada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:3">ta tookkidaytoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:3">Ta gizaa siyite.<verse eid="ISA 46:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 46:4" />Intte cimmidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:4">puulumana gakkanaaska</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:4">inttena tookkizay tana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:4">tani tana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:4">tani inttena medhdhadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:4">tani inttena tookkana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:4">tani inttena kaafana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:4">ta inttena ashshana.<verse eid="ISA 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 46:5" />«Tana oonara giniseetii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:5">Tana oonara likkiseetii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:5">Nuni issino misatana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:5">tana oonara geeddareetii?<verse eid="ISA 46:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 46:6" />Amarda asati worqqa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:6">bantta karaxiiteppe qoleettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:6">biraakka meezaanen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:6">geeddareettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:6">istti seerisi tigiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:6">hiillanchcha qaxxareettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:6">izikka isttas xoossa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:6">histti medhdhees.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:6">Isttika izas goynneettessinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:6">yaynneettes.<verse eid="ISA 46:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 46:7" />Denththidi bantta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:7">hashen tookkeettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:7">zaaridi he denththida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:7">sohon woththeettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:7">izikka heen eqqaa gees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:7">heeppe awakka qaaxxenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:7">oonikka izakko waassiko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:7">zaaro immenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:7">metoppeka iza ashshenna.<verse eid="ISA 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 46:8" />«Intteno mooranchchatoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:8">Hayssa akeekite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:8">yuushshika qopite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:8">intte wozinan qum7i oykkite.<verse eid="ISA 46:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 46:9" />Kase beni wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:9">hanida yo7ota akeekite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:9">tani Xoossa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:9">taappe haray deenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:9">tani Xoossa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:9">ta malay oonikka deenna.<verse eid="ISA 46:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 46:10" />Wurseththan hananayssa koyrotta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:10">buroppe yaanayssa beni yootadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:10">‹Ta halchchoy mino;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:10">tana ufayssizaaz ubbaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:10">ta ooththana› gadis.<verse eid="ISA 46:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 46:11" />Arshey mokkiza baggafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:11">bonqqiza arganth,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:11">haaho biittafe ta qofa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:11">poliza as tani xeygana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:11">Ta yootidayssa ta ooththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:11">ta halchchidayssa ta polana.<verse eid="ISA 46:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 46:12" />«Intteno wozina shuchchatoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:12">xilloteththafekka haakkidaytoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:12">tana siyite.<verse eid="ISA 46:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 46:13" />Tani ta xilloteththaa ehon days;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:13">haaho gidenna.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:13">Ta atoteththay gam7enna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:13">tani Xiyoone atoteth.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:13">Isra7eele bonchcho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:13">mayzana» gees.<verse eid="ISA 46:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="ISA 47" />
  <para style="s1">Baabiloone Bolla Yaana Pirda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 47:1" />GODAY, «Hanne Baabiloone geela7oyee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:1">gudulla bolla wodhdha utta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:1">hanne Baabilooneta nayee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:1">ne araataappe wodhdha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:1">biittan utta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:1">hayssafe guye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:1">neni mala lo7onne dalqidalqa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:1">geetetta xeygettaka.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:1-15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:1-14:23">Isa 13:1—14:23</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:1-51:64">Er 50:1—51:64</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 47:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 47:2" />Woxa ekkada kath gaacca;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:2">Ne goossaa qaara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:2">ne qamisaza qaara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:2">ne xifaa bessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:2">gadigadashe shaafaa pinna.<verse eid="ISA 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 47:3" />Ne kalloteththi qoncco;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:3">yeellachchiza ne kalloy beetto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:3">tani halo makkana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:3">ta oonakka aggike» gees.<verse eid="ISA 47:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 47:4" />Nuna Wozziza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:4">Isra7eele Geeshshaas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:4">sunththay Godaa Ubbaafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:4">Wolqqama Xoossa.<verse eid="ISA 47:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 47:5" />«Hanne Baabilooneta nayee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:5">dhumaso gelada co7u ga utta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:5">hayssafe guye ne kawoteththata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:5">godatteyo geetetta xeygettaka.<verse eid="ISA 47:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 47:6" />Tani ta deraa hanqettadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:6">tani xinxxozakka tunisadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:6">tani istta ne kushen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:6">aaththa immadis.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:6">Neni gidikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:6">isttas qadhettabeekka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:6">cimmidayta bollaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:6">keehi deexo qambara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:6">woththadasa.<verse eid="ISA 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 47:7" />Neni, ‹Tani mernaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:7">godatto gidana› gadasa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:7">Gido attiin haytantta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:7">akeekabeekka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:7">istta wurseththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:7">ay gidanaakko qoppabeekka.<verse eid="ISA 47:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 47:8" />«Hanne ishalo duus dizaaree!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:8">Nerkka nenan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:8">ammanetta uttidaaree!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:8">Ne wozinan, ‹Tana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:8">taappe attiin haray baa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:8">Hannife guye tani am7o gidikke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:8">yelada dhoommidaaro gidikke›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:8">gizaaree siya!<verse eid="ISA 47:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 47:9" />Ha nam7u yo7oti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:9">am7eteththinne yeli dhonththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:9">qofay baynda issi gallas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:9">ne bolla gakki wodhdhana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:9">ne ay keena bitikkoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:9">ne ay keena muurennikokka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:9">istti ne bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:9">kumeththa wolqqara yaana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:7-8">Ajju 18:7-8</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 47:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 47:10" />Neni ne iitateththan ammanettada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:10">‹Tana ooninne be7enna› gadasa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:10">Qasse, ‹Tana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:10">taappe attiin haray deenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:10">ne gida wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:10">ne aadho erateththaynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:10">cinccateththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:10">nena baleththida› gadasa.<verse eid="ISA 47:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 47:11" />Bashshi ne bolla yaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:11">neni wostta muurenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:11">zaaranaakko erakka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:11">ne qanxxo immada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:11">ne dandayontta qohoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:11">ne bolla gakkana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:11">Ne qoppontta metoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:11">ne bolla dingate yaana.<verse eid="ISA 47:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 47:12" />Hekko be7a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:12">neni naateththafe doommada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:12">ooththashe daaburda bitatanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:12">daro muurennota</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:12">gujja gujja ooththa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:12">oonee erizay nees hananaakko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:12">oonee erizay neni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:12">ne morkketa shirosanaakko?<verse eid="ISA 47:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 47:13" />Ne ekkida zore ubbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:13">nena daaburara ashshides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:13">aginappe agina gakkanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:13">xoolintte xeelli kaayizayti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:13">xoolintte taybizayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:13">ane haa yetto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:13">nena gakkiza metoppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:13">ane istti nena ashshetto.<verse eid="ISA 47:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 47:14" />Hekko istti happa mala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:14">tamay istta maana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:14">Tamaa lacoppe dendidayssan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:14">bana ashshanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:14">dandayettenna.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:14">Asi ho7ana bonqqoy deenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:14">uttidi ho7ana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:14">tamaykka deenna.<verse eid="ISA 47:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 47:15" />Naateththafe doommada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:15">ne isttara daaburdayti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:15">ne isttara zal7idayti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:15">istti ooththana dandayzay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:15">hayssa xalla;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:15">issoy issoy ba mooro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:15">gujji gujji baana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:15">gido attiin nena</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:15">ashshanay deenna» gees.<verse eid="ISA 47:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="ISA 48" />
  <para style="s1">Simmontta Ixxida Isra7eele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 48:1" />GODAY, «Intteno Isra7eele sunththan xeygettida,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:1">Yaaqoobeso asatoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:1">Yuhuda zareppe beettidaytoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:1">Intteno GODAA</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:1">sunththan caaqqizaytoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:1">tumateththaninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:1">xilloteththan gidontta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:1">Isra7eele Xoossaa xeygizaytoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:1">Hayssa siyite.<verse eid="ISA 48:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 48:2" />‹Nuni geeshsha katamayn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:2">dizayta› giidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:2">intterkka inttena xeygizaytoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:2">Isra7eele Xoossan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:2">ammanettizaytoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:2">GODAY Ubbaafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:2">Wolqqama Xoossay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:2">gizayssa siyite.<verse eid="ISA 48:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 48:3" />«Kase hanida miishshata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:3">tani daro wodeppe sinththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:3">yoota woththadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:3">ta doonappe kezides.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:3">Istti erettana malakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:3">tani ooththadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:3">ta dingate ooththiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:3">isttika polettida.<verse eid="ISA 48:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 48:4" />Ne ay mala simmontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:4">as gididaakko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:4">ta erays;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:4">ne morge shayay birata mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:4">ne konkkey xarqimala misatees.<verse eid="ISA 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 48:5" />Hessa gishshas hayta ha yo7ota</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:5">beni ta nees yootadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:5">istti polettanaappe sinththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:5">ta nena erisa woththadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:5">hessika, ‹Ta eeqa xoossati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:5">hayssa ooththida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:5">miththafe masettida misletinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:5">biratappe oosettida ta xoossati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:5">hayssa taas azazida›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:5">gontta malassa.<verse eid="ISA 48:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 48:6" />«Hayta ha yo7ota</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:6">ne siyadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:6">ane ubbaaka xeella;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:6">istti likke gididayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:6">neni ne hu7era markkattikii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:6">Ha7ippe doommada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:6">ooraththa miishshata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:6">neeppe geemmidaytanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:6">ne erontta yo7ota</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:6">ta nees yootana.<verse eid="ISA 48:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 48:7" />Heyti ha7i medhettida attiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:7">kase gidenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:7">istta gishshas ne hachchife attiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:7">kase siyabeekka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:7">hessa gishshas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:7">‹Ee, ta istta gishshas erays›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:7">gaana dandayakka.<verse eid="ISA 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 48:8" />Neni siyabeekka woykko erabeekka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:8">ne hayththi benippeka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:8">doyettibeenna.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:8">Gaasoykka neni kasekka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:8">cimmizaadenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:8">naateththafe doommada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:8">ne makkallanchcha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:8">geetettidayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:8">ta eradis.<verse eid="ISA 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 48:9" />«Ta sunththaa gishshas gaada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:9">tani ta hanqo gam7isana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:9">ta galata gishshas gaada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:9">ta neeppe teqqana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:9">ta nena qanxxontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:9">aggana malassa.<verse eid="ISA 48:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 48:10" />Be7a bira mala gidontta aggikokka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:10">nena gaccadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:10">tama mala meton paaccadis;<verse eid="ISA 48:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 48:11" />Ta gishshas gaada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:11">tani ta gishshas gaada ooththays.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:11">Tarkka tana wostta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:11">kawushshateththas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:11">aaththa immoo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:11">Ta bonchcho oonaska immike.<verse eid="ISA 48:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossi Doorida Oosanchcha</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 48:12" />«Nenoo Yaaqoobe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:12">tani xeygida Isra7eele</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:12">tani gizaa siya.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:12">Tani iza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:12">koyroykka tana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:12">wurseththayka tana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 44:6">Isa 44:6</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:17">Ajju 1:17</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:13">22:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 48:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 48:13" />Biittaas yoch yeggiday</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:13">ta kushe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:13">salota micciday</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:13">ta ushachcha kushe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:13">Ta istta xeygiza wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:13">istti ubbayka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:13">issi bolla eqqeettes.<verse eid="ISA 48:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 48:14" />«Intte ubbayka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:14">issi bolla shiiqidi siyite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:14">eeqa xoossatappe kase</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:14">haytantta yootiday oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:14">GODAAS doorettida laggey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:14">izi Baabiloone bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:14">halchchidayssa polana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:14">iza qeseykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:14">Baabilooneta bolla gidana.<verse eid="ISA 48:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 48:15" />Tani tarkka yootadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:15">tumukka ta xeygadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:15">ta iza ehana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:15">iza oosoykka izas polettana.<verse eid="ISA 48:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 48:16" />«Taakko haa shiiqidi hayssa siyite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:16">tani koyroppe doommadakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:16">geeman haasayabeekke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:16">izi polettishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:16">ta heen days» gees.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 48:16" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:16">Ha7ikka Ubbaa Haariza</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:16">GODAYNNE iza Ayanay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:16">tana kiittida.<verse eid="ISA 48:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 48:17" />GODAY nena Wozzida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:17">Isra7eele Geeshshay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:17">«Tani GODAA ne Xoossay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:17">nena go7izaaz tamaarsizayssa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:17">baanaas bessizaa ogera</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:17">nena kaaleththizay tana.<verse eid="ISA 48:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 48:18" />Neni ta azazo siyidaa gididaakko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:18">nees saroteththi shaafa mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:18">nees xilloteththika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:18">abba dambala mala gidanashin.<verse eid="ISA 48:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 48:19" />Ne zereththi abba shaamintta mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:19">ne naytikka qooday baynda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:19">gudulla mala gidanashin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:19">istta sunththi qucettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:19">ta sinththafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:19">dhayettennashin» gees.<verse eid="ISA 48:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 48:20" />Baabiloone biittafe kezite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:20">Baabiloone asaappe baqatite!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:20">Hayssa ililisan erisite; awajjite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:20">biitta gaxa gakkanaas yootite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:20">«GODAY ba ashkaraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:20">Yaaqoobe wozzides» giite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:4">Ajju 18:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 48:21" />Izi istta bazzo biittara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:21">kaaleththishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:21">istti saamettibeettenna.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:21">Izi isttas zaallafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:21">haath pulttisides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:21">izi zaallaa phalqides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:21">haaththika dhuuqqi kezides.<verse eid="ISA 48:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 48:22" />«Iitatas saroy baa» gees GODAY.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 57:21">Isa 57:21</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 48:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="ISA 49" />
  <para style="s1">Godaa Oosanchcha</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 49:1" />Intteno harurotoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:1">ta gizayssa siyite.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:1">Intteno haahon diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:1">kawoteththatoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:1">hayssa ezgite.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:1">Tani ta aayi ulon dishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:1">GODAY tana xeygides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:1">ta yelettontta dishin tana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:1">ta sunththan xeygides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:5">Er 1:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 49:2" />Ta inxarsaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:2">giththa mashsha mala qarasides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:2">ba kushe kuwan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:2">tana genththides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:2">izi tana hoxe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:2">yiishsha mala ooththides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:2">histtidi ba kooho giddon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:2">tana qottides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 4:12">Ib 4:12</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:16">Ajju 1:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 49:3" />Izi tana, «Isra7eele</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:3">ne ta aylle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:3">tani ta bonchcho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:3">nenan qonccisana» gides.<verse eid="ISA 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 49:4" />Gido attiin tani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:4">«Tani mela coo daaburadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:4">go7ay baynda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:4">coo hada miishshan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:4">ta wolqqa wursadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:4">gidikkoka ta oosozas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:4">kushe zaaranay GODAA;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:4">ta waagaykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:4">ta Xoossa matanna» gadis.<verse eid="ISA 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 49:5" />Ha7i tani GODAA ayfe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:5">sinththan bonchchettadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:5">Xoossay taas wolqqa gidides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:5">tani Yaaqoobe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:5">izakko zaarana mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:5">Isra7eele izakko shiishshana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:5">ooththida GODAY</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:5">ha7ikka zaaridi,<verse eid="ISA 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 49:6" />«Neni taas oosanchcha gideththi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:6">Yaaqoobe qommota</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:6">ne zaaranayssinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:6">ta naagida Isra7eele zaarada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:6">ne ehanayssi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:6">hessi nena deexxenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:6">qasseka ta atoteththaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:6">biitta gaxa ne gaththana mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:6">tani nena kawoteththatas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:6">poo7o histtana» gees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:6">Isa 42:6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 2:32">Luqa 2:32</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:47">Hawa 13:47</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:23">26:23</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 49:7" />Kadhettidayssassinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:7">kawoteththan ixettidayssas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:7">dere haarizayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:7">ashkara gidida nees,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:7">GODAY, Isra7eele</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:7">ashshiza Geeshshay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:7">«Kawoti nena be7idi dendi eqqana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:7">kawo nayti nena be7idi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:7">nees ziggana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:7">gaasoykka nena doorida GODAY,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:7">Isra7eele Geeshshay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:7">ammanettidaade» gees.<verse eid="ISA 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isra7eele Zaari Eso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 49:8" />GODAY,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:8">«Tani doorida wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:8">ne oyshaa zaarana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:8">atoteththa gallas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:8">tani nena maaddana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:8">deraas caaqo qaala gidana mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:8">biittayokka ne zaara essana mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:8">kase biitta yeggi dhaydaytas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:8">istta xinxxo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:8">ne zaara immana mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:8">ta nena maaddana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:8">ta nees ooththana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 6:2">2Qoro 6:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 49:9" />Neni di7ettidayta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:9">‹Haa kezite!›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:9">dhuman dizayta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:9">‹Poo7on kezite›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:9">gaana mala ta ooththadis.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:9">Istti ogey dizason dizason</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:9">kath maana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:9">aykkoy baynda zumbulla bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:9">heemettizaso demmana.<verse eid="ISA 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 49:10" />Istti gafettettenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:10">woykko saamettettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:10">istta bazzo biitta seelay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:10">woykko awa seelay qohenna.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:10">Isttas qadhettizay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:10">istta kaaleththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:10">haaththa pulttoy dizason</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:10">istta heemmana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 7:16-17">Ajju 7:16-17</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 49:11" />«Ta zumata ubbaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:11">oge kessana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:11">ta wogga ogetikka dhoqqu gaana.<verse eid="ISA 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 49:12" />Hekko istti haaho dereppe yaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:12">issi issineti pudehappe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:12">baggayti arshey wulliza baggafe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:12">hankko attidayti Sinimeppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:12">yaana» gees.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sinime geetettizay ha7i woden Asewa geetettiza Gibxe katamakko.</char></note><verse eid="ISA 49:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 49:13" />Salotoo intte, ilili giite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:13">biittayee neni ufayetta.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:13">Intteno Zumatoo ufayssan yexxite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:13">gaasoykka GODAY</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:13">ba deraa minththeththees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:13">metotanchchatas qadhettees.<verse eid="ISA 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 49:14" />Xiyoona gidikko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:14">«GODAY tana aggides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:14">GODAY tana balides» gadus.<verse eid="ISA 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 49:15" />GODAY,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:15">«Aaya ba dhanththiza naa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:15">balanaas dandayazee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:15">ba yelida naas qadhettekee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:15">oonee erizay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:15">iza balana dandayawus;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:15">tani gidikko nena balikke.<verse eid="ISA 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 49:16" />Hekko tani nena</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:16">ta kushe qaa7an xaafadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:16">ne dirsa gimbetikka ubbatoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:16">ta sinththan deettes.<verse eid="ISA 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 49:17" />«Ne attuma naytikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:17">eeson simmana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:17">nena laallidayti neeppe baqatana.<verse eid="ISA 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 49:18" />Ane dhoqqu gaada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:18">ne yuusho xeella;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:18">ne nayti ubbay issife shiiqidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:18">neekko yaana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:18">Tani GODAY ta de7on caaqqays;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:18">neni istta ubbaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:18">alleqo mala may7ana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:18">ne istta mishira may7o mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:18">may7ana» gees.<verse eid="ISA 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 49:19" />«Ne laalettada bula gidikkoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:19">ne biittay mulera dhaykkoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:19">hach neni ne derezas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:19">xunth gidikkoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:19">nena mittidayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:19">neeppe haakkana.<verse eid="ISA 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 49:20" />Ceece wode ne yelida nayti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:20">ne hayththi siyishin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:20">‹Hayssi gadey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:20">nuus keehi xuummides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:20">nu daanaas nuus</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:20">gidizaso imma› gaana.<verse eid="ISA 49:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 49:21" />Neni ne wozinan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:21">‹Hayta taas yeliday oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:21">Tani ceecizaadenne maynne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:21">tani goodettidaadenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:21">ixettidaade gida dishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:21">haytantta dichchiday oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:21">Tani tarkka attadis shin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:21">histtiin haytanti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:21">awappe yidoo?› gaasa» gees.<verse eid="ISA 49:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 49:22" />Ubbaa Haariza GODAY, «Be7a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:22">tani kawoteththata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:22">malatan xeygana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:22">tani ta bandira asaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:22">dhoqqu histta essana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:22">ne attuma nayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:22">istti idimmi ehana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:22">ne macca naytakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:22">bantta hashen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:22">tookkidi ehana.<verse eid="ISA 49:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 49:23" />Kawoti nena dichchiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:23">aawata gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:23">istta machcheti nena dichchiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:23">aayeta gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:23">istti gufannidi nees goynnana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:23">ne toho bollafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:23">baanaakka laaccana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:23">nekka tani GODAA</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:23">gididayssa erana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:23">tanan hidota ooththizayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:23">yeellatettenna» gees.<verse eid="ISA 49:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 49:24" />Di7i ekkida miish olanchchatappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:24">guye zaaranaas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:24">di7etti bidayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:24">menxe iitata kusheppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:24">ashshanaas dandayettizee?<verse eid="ISA 49:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 49:25" />Gido attiin GODAY,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:25">«Tumukka olanchchati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:25">di7i efida miish</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:25">kessi ekkanaas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:25">menxe iitata kusheppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:25">di7ettidayta ashshanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:25">dandayettees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:25">nenara olettizaytara ta olettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:25">ne naytakka tani ashshana.<verse eid="ISA 49:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 49:26" />Nena un7eththizayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:26">banttarkka ba asho maana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:26">woyne ushshan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:26">maththottiza mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:26">banttarkka ba suuththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:26">maththottana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:26">hessafe guye asa zereth ubbay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:26">tani GODAA, nena Ashshizayssa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:26">nena wozzizayssanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:26">Yaaqoobe Wolqqama gididayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:26">hessan erana» gees.<verse eid="ISA 49:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="ISA 50" />
  <para style="s1">Isra7eele Nagaranne Xoossa Aylle Azazeteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 50:1" />GODAY,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:1">«Tani intte aayo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:1">anjja yeddida waraqatay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:1">awan dizee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:1">woykko ta inttena</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:1">ay tal7a ekkidaades bayzadinaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:1">Be7ite intte intte</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:1">nagara gishshas bayzettideta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:1">intte mooro gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:1">intte aaya anjjetta badus.<verse eid="ISA 50:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 50:2" />Tani yiza wode heen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:2">asi ays dhaydee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:2">Ta xeygiza wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:2">zaaro immiza asi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:2">heen waani dhaydee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:2">Inttena wozzana miish cigganaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:2">ta kushey qaammadee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:2">Woykko inttena ashshanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:2">taas wolqqay guuththee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:2">Be7ite ta hanqon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:2">abba melissays;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:2">shaafatakka bazzo kessays;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:2">isttan diza moleti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:2">saamon hayqqidi zeeqqeettes.<verse eid="ISA 50:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 50:3" />Tani salo dhumisana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:3">tani iza maaqa mayzana» gees.<verse eid="ISA 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 50:4" />Ubbaa Haariza GODAY taas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:4">inxarsa erateth immides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:4">hessa gishshas daaburanchchatas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:4">ta ay gaana bessizaakko ta erays;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:4">maalado maalado</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:4">tana beegoththees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:4">tamaarshe diza tamaare mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:4">siyanaas ta hayth doyees.<verse eid="ISA 50:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 50:5" />Ubbaa Haariza GODAY</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:5">ta hayth doydes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:5">tani makkallanchcha diikke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:5">guyekka baqatabeekke.<verse eid="ISA 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 50:6" />Ta zokko shocizaytas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:6">ta buuchcha shoddizaytas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:6">aaththa immadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:6">Ta ayfeso cuchchafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:6">genththabeekke.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:67">Mato 26:67</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Mar 14:65</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 50:7" />Ubbaa Haarizaa GODAY</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:7">tana maaddiza gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:7">tani kawuykke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:7">hessa gishshas ta ayfeso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:7">daldacha shuchcha mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:7">ooththadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:7">tani yeellatonttayssa erays.<verse eid="ISA 50:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 50:8" />Ta xilloteththa qonccisizaadey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:8">ta matan dees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:8">histtiin tana mootana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:8">dandayzay izi oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:8">Ane issife tiran gayttoos!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:8">Ta baalgaaray oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:8">Ane haayo!<verse eid="ISA 50:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 50:9" />Be7ite, Ubbaa Haariza GODAY</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:9">tana maaddees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:9">histtiin ta bolla pirdanay oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:9">Be7ite, istti ubbayka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:9">may7o mala ceeggana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:9">bilay istta maana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:8-9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:33-34">Oro 8:33-34</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 50:10" />Intte giddofe GODAAS yayyizay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:10">iza ayllaa qaalas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:10">azazettizay oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:10">Hessaadey dhuman</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:10">bizaa gidikkonne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:10">poo7oy izas baynda aggiko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:10">izi GODAA sunththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:10">ammanetto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:10">ba Xoossankka zemppo.<verse eid="ISA 50:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 50:11" />Ha7i gidikko intte tama eeththidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:11">laciza intte xomppe xomppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:11">oykkida ubbati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:11">intte poo7on biite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:11">intte oyththida xomppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:11">poo7on simerettite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:11">Intte ta kusheppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:11">ekkanayssi hayssa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:11">intte iita meton kundana.<verse eid="ISA 50:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 50" />
  <chapter number="51" style="c" sid="ISA 51" />
  <para style="s1">Xiyoonis Mernaa Atoteth</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 51:1" />«Intteno xilloteth kaallizaytoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:1">GODAA koyzayto siyite.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:1">Intte izappe phalqetti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:1">kezida zaallazanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:1">intte booketti kezida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:1">ollaa xeellite.<verse eid="ISA 51:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 51:2" />Intte aawa Abrahaamekko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:2">inttena yelida Saarakko xeellite.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:2">Izi barkka dishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:2">tani iza xeygadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:2">tani iza anjjadissinne darssadis.<verse eid="ISA 51:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 51:3" />«GODAY Xiyoono</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:3">tumu minththeththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:3">izi laaleteththaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:3">qadhetan xeellana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:3">izi bazzo biittaza Edene mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:3">izi bazzo biittaza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:3">GODAA atakiltesoho mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:3">ooththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:3">ishaloynne ufayssi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:3">galataynne yeththa cenggurssi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:3">izin seetettana.<verse eid="ISA 51:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 51:4" />«Ta baggatoo ta gizayssa siyite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:4">ta derezoo ta gizaa ezga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:4">wogay taappe kezana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:4">ta pirday kawoteththatas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:4">poo7o gidana.<verse eid="ISA 51:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 51:5" />Ta xilloteththay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:5">eesoti yeeththa bolla,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:5">ta atoteththay matishe dees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:5">ta qesey kawoteththatas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:5">tuma pirda ehana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:5">haruroti taakko xeellana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:5">ta qesekka hidota ooththana.<verse eid="ISA 51:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 51:6" />Pude dhoqqu giidi salota xeellite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:6">ziqqi giidi duge sa7aakka xeellite.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:6">Saloti cuwa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:6">tim7i gi dhayana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:6">sa7aykka afaladan ceeggana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:6">izin de7iza asay udunxxe mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:6">eeson dhayana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:6">ta atoteththay mernaas daana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:6">ta xilloteththaaska</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:6">wurseththi deenna.»<verse eid="ISA 51:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 51:7" />GODAY, «Intteno</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:7">xilloteth erizaytoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:7">ta wogaa intte wozinan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:7">woththida asatoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:7">ta gizaa siyite.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:7">Asay inttena kadhishin babbofte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:7">istti inttena</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:7">cayishin dagammofte.<verse eid="ISA 51:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 51:8" />Bilay may7o miza mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:8">istta maana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:8">istti guxuney mida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:8">suufe mala gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:8">ta xilloteththi gidikko mernaas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:8">ta atoteththi yeletappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:8">yeleta gakkanaas daana» gees.<verse eid="ISA 51:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 51:9" />Abeet GODAA qesey denda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:9">wolqqa may7a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:9">kase aadhdhida wodetan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:9">miimintte qanxxereththiday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:9">gita daweza caddiday</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:9">nena gidikkii?<verse eid="ISA 51:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 51:10" />Wozzetti attidayti pinnana mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:10">abbaanne ciimmaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:10">haaththaa melissiday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:10">ciimma giddora oge giigsiday</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:10">nena gidikkii?<verse eid="ISA 51:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 51:11" />GODAY wozzidayti simmana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:11">yexxishekka Xiyoone gelana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:11">mernaa ufayssa kallachcha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:11">hu7en goxxana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:11">istti injjenne ufayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:11">duus demmana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:11">ceeceynne yeehoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:11">isttafe baqatana.<verse eid="ISA 51:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 51:12" />GODAY,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:12">«Inttena minththizay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:12">Tani xalla Iza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:12">hayqqiza asa zereth,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:12">maata mala shulliza asa naas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:12">ays babbay?<verse eid="ISA 51:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 51:13" />Nena medhdhidayssa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:13">salota tolidayssa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:13">sa7as yoch yeggidayssa ne baladasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:13">nena dhayssanaas giigettida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:13">menxe iitaza gaasoppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:13">dendidayssan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:13">ubbaa gallas shiron daasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:13">histtiin he menxe iitaza hanqoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:13">ha7i awan dizee?<verse eid="ISA 51:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 51:14" />Qashettidayti eeson birshettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:14">istti ba qashettida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:14">olla giddon hayqqettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:14">kaththi isttas paccenna.<verse eid="ISA 51:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 51:15" />Gaasoykka dambalay dendana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:15">abba qaaththiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:15">Tani GODAY ne Xoossa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:15">ta sunththi GODAA</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:15">Ubbaafe Wolqqama Xoossa.<verse eid="ISA 51:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 51:16" />Tani ta qaala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:16">ne doonan woththadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:16">ta kushe kuwan kammadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:16">salota istti dizason woththiday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:16">biittas yoch yeggiday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:16">Xiyoono, ‹Ne ta dere›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:16">giday Tana» gees.<verse eid="ISA 51:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Godaa Hanqo</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 51:17" />GODAA kusheppe hanqo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:17">ushshu uyidaaree,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:17">orccoka ashshontta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:17">as gandigarssiza ushshu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:17">xixxi histta uyidaaree,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:17">hanne Yerusalaame denda!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:17">denda, denda eqqa!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 14:10">Ajju 14:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:19">16:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 51:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 51:18" />Iza yelida nayta ubbaafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:18">kaaleththizay issoyka baawa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:18">qasse iza dichchida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:18">nayta ubbaafekka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:18">izi kushe oykkizay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:18">issoyka baawa.<verse eid="ISA 51:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 51:19" />Be7a bashsha bolla bashshi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:19">ne bolla yides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:19">histtiin nena oonee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:19">minththeththanay?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:19">isttika laaleteththinne dhays,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:19">koshanne mashsha.<verse eid="ISA 51:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 51:20" />Ne attuma nayti daaburda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:20">woximaden oykettida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:20">genessa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:20">oge gaxan ubbaan ichchida.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:20">GODAA hanqoynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:20">ne Xoossa seeray</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:20">istta bolla kumides.<verse eid="ISA 51:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 51:21" />Hessa gishshas woyne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:21">ushshan gidontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:21">coo maththottizaare hayssa siya<verse eid="ISA 51:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 51:22" />Ba deraa ashshiza ne GODAY</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:22">Ubbaafe wolqqama Xoossay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:22">«Be7a; nena gandigarssiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:22">ushshaa ne kusheppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:22">ta ekkadis,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:22">ta hanqo xuu7aappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:22">nam7anththo uyakka.<verse eid="ISA 51:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 51:23" />Tani hessa nena un7eththizayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:23">kushen woththana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:23">Istti nena, ‹Nuni ne bollara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:23">hemettidi aadhdhana mala zaqulla› gida.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:23">Histtiin istti aadhdhana gakkanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:23">ne zokko isttas biitta malanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:23">oge mala ooththadasa» gees.<verse eid="ISA 51:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 51" />
  <chapter number="52" style="c" sid="ISA 52" />
  <para style="s1">Xoossay Yerusalaame Ashshana</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 52:1" />Hanne Xiyoone denda; denda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:1">wolqqa may7a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:1">geeshsha katamaye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:1">Yerusalaamee!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:1">Ne bonchcho may7o may7a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:1">hayssafe guye qaxxarettonttaynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:1">tunay ne giddo gelenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:2">Ajju 21:2</ref>,<ref loc="REV 21:27">27</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 52:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 52:2" />Hanne Yerusalaame, denda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:2">gudullaa pitta; ne araatan utta.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:2">Di7ettida Xiyoone nayee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:2">ne qoodhen qashettida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:2">sansalata kessa yegga.<verse eid="ISA 52:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 52:3" />GODAY, «Intte coo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:3">hada bayzettideta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:3">ha7ikka miishshi baynda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:3">coo intte wozzettana» gees.<verse eid="ISA 52:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 52:4" />Ubbaa Haariza GODAY,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:4">«Koyro ta derey de7anaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:4">duge Gibxe wodhdhides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:4">guyeppe Asoorey gaasoykka baynda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:4">un7eththi haarides.<verse eid="ISA 52:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 52:5" />‹Histtiin ta derey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:5">gaasoykka baynda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:5">di7etti biichchiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:5">taas haan aazi dizee?›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:5">Istta haaridayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:5">istta bolla qilccida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:5">gallas kumeth ta sunththaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:5">pacey baynda cayeettes.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:24">Oro 2:24</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 52:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 52:6" />Hessa gishshas ta derey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:6">ta sunththaa erana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:6">he gallas kasekka yootiday</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:6">tana gididayssa istti erana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:6">Ee hessi tana» gees.<verse eid="ISA 52:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 52:7" />Zuma bolla eqqida tohoti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:7">mishiraachcho ekki yiza tohoti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:7">saroteth yootizayti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:7">lo7o mishiraachcho yootizayti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:7">atoteth awajjizayti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:7">Xiyoonokka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:7">«Ne Xoossay kawotides»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:7">giza tohoti ay mala lo7o!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NAM 1:15">Naho 1:15</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 10:15">Oro 10:15</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:15">Efe 6:15</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 52:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 52:8" />Hanne siya!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:8">Nena naagiyzayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:8">bantta qaala dhoqqu histtida.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:8">Issi bolla ililishe yexxeettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:8">GODAY Xiyoone simmiza wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:8">istti iza bantta ayfera be7ana.<verse eid="ISA 52:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 52:9" />Intteno Yerusalaamen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:9">qolettida sohotoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:9">Intte issi bolla ililisan yexxite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:9">GODAY ba deraa minththeththides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:9">Yerusalaame katamaakka wozzides.<verse eid="ISA 52:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 52:10" />GODAY ba geeshsha qesaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:10">kawoteththata ubbaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:10">sinththan qonccisana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:10">qasse biittaa gaxan diza ubbayka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:10">nu Xoossaa atoteththaa be7ana.<verse eid="ISA 52:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 52:11" />Intteno GODAA keeththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:11">miishshata tookkizaytoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:11">Shaakettite, shaakettite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:11">heeppe kezite.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:11">Tuna miish bochchofte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:11">heeppe kezite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:11">intte hu7esikka geeyte.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 6:17">2Qoro 6:17</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 52:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 52:12" />Gidikkoka eeson kezekketa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:12">woykko beti beekketa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:12">GODAY inttefe sinth aadhdhidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:12">inttena kaaleththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:12">Isra7eele Xoossayka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:12">guyera inttena naagana.<verse eid="ISA 52:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Metoy Iza Gakkiza Oosanchcha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 52:13" />GODAY, «Be7ite,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:13">ta ashkaray akeekan ooththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:13">izi erettidaade gidana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:13">izi dhoqqu dhoqqu gaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:13">izi keehi bonchchettana.<verse eid="ISA 52:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 52:14" />Daro asay izan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:14">dagamanaashe gakkanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:14">as ubbaafe qohettida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:14">iza medhay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:14">asa medhappe laamettides.<verse eid="ISA 52:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 52:15" />Hessa gishshas izi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:15">daro kawoteththata malalisana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:15">iza gaason kawoteththati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:15">bantta doona oykkana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:15">isttas yootettonttayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:15">istti be7ana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:15">istti siyi erontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:15">miish akeekana» gees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:21">Oro 15:21</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 52:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 52" />
  <chapter number="53" style="c" sid="ISA 53" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 53:1" />Derezi, «Nuni yootidayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:1">oonee ammaniday?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:1">GODAA qesey oonas qonccidee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">53:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:38">Yoha 12:38</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 10:16">Oro 10:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 53:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 53:2" />Izi iza sinththan caarechcha mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:2">mela biittafe mokkiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:2">xapho mala mokkides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:2">nu iza xeellanaas shicateththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:2">woykko teemay deenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:2">nu iza dosanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:2">iza malay lo7enna.<verse eid="ISA 53:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 53:3" />Izi asan kadhettidaadenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:3">ixettidaade;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:3">izi hargefenne metoppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:3">shaaketti erontta asa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:3">Izi asi iza be7anaappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:3">ba ayfeso haraso zaariza asa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:3">kadhettidaade gidides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:3">nunikka iza bonchchibeekko.<verse eid="ISA 53:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 53:4" />«Tumukka Izi nu harge</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:4">baas ekkides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:4">qasse nu sakokka izi tookkides.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:4">Nuni gidikko iza gakkida metoy,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:4">desheteththaynne waayey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:4">Xoossafe izas imettidaaza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:4">giidi qoppidos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">53:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:17">Mato 8:17</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 53:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 53:5" />Gido attiin izi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:5">nu mooro gishshas cadettides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:5">nu qoho gishshas liiqides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:5">iza bolla wodhdhida qixaatey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:5">nuus saro ehides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:5">iza madunththan nu paxidos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">53:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:24">1Phex 2:24</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 53:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 53:6" />Nuni ubbay dorsa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:6">toylatti dhaydos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:6">nuni issoy issoy nu oge bidos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:6">GODAY nu ubbaa qoho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:6">iza bolla woththides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">53:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:25">1Phex 2:25</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 53:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 53:7" />«Izi un7ettidessinne waayettides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:7">gido attiin doonakka pogibeenna.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:7">Dorsa laaqqa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:7">shukettanaas laagettides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:7">ba iske qanxxizayta sinththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:7">co7u giza dorsa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:7">izi doonakka phoqqibeenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">53:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 5:6">Ajju 5:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 53:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 53:8" />Iza metoththoninne pirdan efida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:8">Izi ta deraa mooro gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:8">deshettidi, paxay diza biittafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:8">digettidayssa iza zereththafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:8">akeekiday oonee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">53:7-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:32-33">Hawa 8:32-33</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 53:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 53:9" />Izi aykko gene haasayontta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:9">ay moorokka ooththontta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:9">iza hayqoy iitatara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:9">issife qoodettides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:9">gido attiin izi dureta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:9">duufon moogettides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">53:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:22">1Phex 2:22</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 53:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 53:10" />«Iza liiqeththinne waayezi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:10">GODAA shene gidides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:10">GODAY iza shemppo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:10">nagara yarsho ooththikoka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:10">izi ba zereththaa be7ana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:10">GODAA sheney</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:10">iza kushen polettana.<verse eid="ISA 53:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 53:11" />Iza shemppoy waayettidaappe guye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:11">izi de7o poo7o</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:11">be7ananne ufayettana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:11">Ta xillo ayllezi ba erateththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:11">darota xillisana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:11">istta moorokka tookkana.<verse eid="ISA 53:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 53:12" />Hessa gishshas iza gakkiza gisha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:12">gita asata gishara issife histtana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:12">di7i ehidayssa wolqqamatara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:12">izi issife gishettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:12">izi ba shemppo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:12">hayqos aaththi immidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:12">iita ooththizaytara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:12">issife qoodettida gishshas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:12">darota nagara tookkides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:12">qohidayta gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:12">gaannatides» gaana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">53:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 15:28">Mar 15:28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:37">Luqa 22:37</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 53:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 53" />
  <chapter number="54" style="c" sid="ISA 54" />
  <para style="s1">Xiyoones Sinththafe Yaana Bonchcho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 54:1" />GODAY,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:1">«Hanne maynne maccassayee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:1">naa yela eronttaare yexxa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:1">ilili gaada ufayssan waassa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:1">hanne miixatta eronttaare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:1">ba azinara dizaari naytappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:1">azinay aggidaari</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:1">nayti darana» gees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">54:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:27">Gala 4:27</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 54:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 54:2" />Ne dunkaane essanaaso aassa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:2">ne dunkaane magalashatakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:2">aassa tola; xuunththofa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:2">ne wodorota adussa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:2">dhishketakka minththa essa.<verse eid="ISA 54:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 54:3" />Neni ushachcha baggaranne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:3">hadirsa baggara aakkana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:3">ne zareti kawoteththata laattana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:3">histtidi aykkoy baynda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:3">istta katamatan istti daana.<verse eid="ISA 54:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 54:4" />«Aykkoy baa babbofa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:4">ne yeellatakka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:4">hirgofa; ne kawuyaka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:4">ne yelagateththa yeellaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:4">neni dogana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:4">ne am7eteththaa borokka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:4">hayssafe sinththan hassa7akka.<verse eid="ISA 54:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 54:5" />Nena medhdhidayssi nees azina;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:5">iza sunththayka Ubbaafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:5">Wolqqama GODAA.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:5">Nena wozziday</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:5">Isra7eele Geeshsha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:5">izi biitta ubbaa Xoossa geetettees.<verse eid="ISA 54:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 54:6" />Naateththan ekkidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:6">kadhida machchi mala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:6">neni wozina meqqidanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:6">kadhettida machchi mala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:6">gido attiin GODAY</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:6">nena guye zaari xeygana»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:6">gees Xoossay.<verse eid="ISA 54:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 54:7" />«Guuththa wode tani nena aggadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:7">gido attiin gita qadhetan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:7">ta nena zaara shiishshana.<verse eid="ISA 54:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 54:8" />Ta guuththa wodes</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:8">keeha hanqettida gishshas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:8">ta ayfeso neeppe genththadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:8">gido attiin ta mernaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:8">kiyateththan nees qadhettana»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:8">gees nena Wozziza GODAY.<verse eid="ISA 54:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 54:9" />«Hayssi taas Nohe wode haaththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:9">biitta zaari dhayssontta mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:9">ta caaqqoyssaththo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:9">ha7ikka ne bolla zaarada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:9">hanqettontta malanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:9">seerontta mala ta caaqqadis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">54:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 9:8-17">Medhe 9:8-17</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 54:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 54:10" />Zumati qaaxxiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:10">zumbullati ba dizasoppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:10">kichchikokka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:10">nees diza ta siiqoy qaaxxenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:10">nenara ta caaqqida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:10">saroteththa qaalay laalettenna»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:10">gees nena maariza GODAY.<verse eid="ISA 54:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 54:11" />GODAY, «Hanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:11">un7ettida katamayee!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:11">Gote carkon shocettidaaree!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:11">minettonttaaree! Be7a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:11">tani nena bonchchettida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:11">shuchchatan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:11">alleqissa keexxana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:11">semppere shuch nees</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:11">yoch yeggana.<verse eid="ISA 54:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 54:12" />Tani ne qustte zo7o inqqun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:12">ne pengeta xolqiza inqqutan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:12">ne dirsata bonchchettida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:12">shuchchatan ooththana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">54:11-12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:18-21">Ajju 21:18-21</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 54:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 54:13" />Ne attuma nayti ubbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:13">GODAAPPE tamaardayta gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:13">ne nayta saroteththika darana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">54:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:45">Yoha 6:45</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 54:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 54:14" />Neni xilloteththan minna eqqana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:14">gene ogera aysoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:14">neeppe haakkana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:14">Nena babisiza miishshi deenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:14">shiroteththi neeppe haakkana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:14">ne matakka shiiqenna.<verse eid="ISA 54:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 54:15" />Oonikka nena qohikko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:15">hessi taappe gidenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:15">nena qohiday diikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:15">ne sinththan kundana;<verse eid="ISA 54:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 54:16" />«Be7a, xiifay taman bonqqana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:16">womppiina punnizayssa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:16">ola miish qoxxiza wogace</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:16">medhdhiday tana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:16">Qasse bash gaththana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:16">medhdhidaykka tana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:16">bashshizayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:16">medhdhidaykka tana.<verse eid="ISA 54:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 54:17" />Nena qohanaas oosettida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:17">miishshi ooththenna.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:17">Nena mootiza inxars ubbaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:17">ne laththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:17">hessa gishshas GODAA aylleta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:17">xinxxoy hayssa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:17">istti taappe demmana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:17">anjjoy hessa» gees.<verse eid="ISA 54:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 54" />
  <chapter number="55" style="c" sid="ISA 55" />
  <para style="s1">Xoossafe Beettiza Maaroteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 55:1" />GODAY, «Intteno saamettidaytoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:1">ubbayka haa yiite!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:1">Haaththaako haa yiite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:1">Intteno miishshi bayndaytoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:1">shammite; miite.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:1">Haa yiite; miishshi bayndanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:1">qanxxontta woyne ushshinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:1">maath shammite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">55:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:6">Ajju 21:6</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:17">22:17</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 55:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 55:2" />Go7ontta kaththas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:2">ays intte miish dhaysseetii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:2">inttena kalssontta miishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:2">ay ekkanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:2">intte wolqqa wurseetii?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:2">Siyite; ta gidaaz siyite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:2">lo7o gididaaz miite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:2">lo7o quman inttena ufayssite.<verse eid="ISA 55:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 55:3" />Intte hayth doydi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:3">haa taakko shiiqite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:3">intte shemppora paxa daana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:3">ta gizaa ezgi siyite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:3">kase ta Dawitera caaqqida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:3">mino siiqon inttenarakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:3">mernaa caaqo caaqettana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">55:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:34">Hawa 13:34</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 55:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 55:4" />Be7ite, tani iza deraas markka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:4">kaaleththizaadenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:4">ola gadawa ooththadis.<verse eid="ISA 55:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 55:5" />Be7a, neni erontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:5">kawoteththata xeygana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:5">nena erontta kawoteththati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:5">neekko eeson yaana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:5">Gaasoykka GODAA ne Xoossay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:5">Isra7eele Geeshshay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:5">ba bonchchon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:5">nena dhoqqu dhoqqu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:5">histtides» gees.<verse eid="ISA 55:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 55:6" />GODAY beettiza wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:6">iza koyite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:6">matan diza wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:6">iza xeygite.<verse eid="ISA 55:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 55:7" />Iita asi ba oge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:7">qohizaykka ba qofa aggo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:7">GODAAKKO simmo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:7">Izikka iza maarana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:7">iza maaroteththay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:7">daro gidida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:7">izi nu Xoossako simmo.<verse eid="ISA 55:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 55:8" />GODAY, «Ta qofay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:8">intte qofa mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:8">intte ogeykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:8">ta oge mala gidenna.<verse eid="ISA 55:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 55:9" />Saloti sa7appe dhoqqida mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:9">ta ogey intte ogeppe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:9">ta qofaykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:9">intte qofappe dhoqqees.<verse eid="ISA 55:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 55:10" />Iraynne shachchi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:10">saloppe wodhdhidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:10">biitta kalssidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:10">biittay mokisana malanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:10">ayfe immana mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:10">zerizaades zereth, mizaades kath</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:10">immontta dishe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:10">guye simmonttayssa mala,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">55:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 9:10">2Qoro 9:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 55:10" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 55:11" />ta doonappe keziza qaalaykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:11">coo hada haa taakko simmenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:11">gido attiin izi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:11">tani koyidayssa ooththees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:11">ba kiitettida waanna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:11">qofaakka polees.<verse eid="ISA 55:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 55:12" />Intte ufayssan kezana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:12">saron moyzettana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:12">Zumatinne zumbullati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:12">intte sinththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:12">ililisara yexxana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:12">demban diza miththati ubbayka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:12">bantta kushe baqqana.<verse eid="ISA 55:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 55:13" />Agunththa gishshas xiidday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:13">kindichcho gishshas barsineete</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:13">geetettiza miththi mokkana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:13">hessika GODAA hassa7issiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:13">miishshi dhayontta mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:13">mernaas malata gidana» gees.<verse eid="ISA 55:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 55" />
  <chapter number="56" style="c" sid="ISA 56" />
  <para style="s1">Azazettiza Ubbaas Imettida Atoteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 56:1" />GODAY, «Tumu pirda naagite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:1">lo7o ooththite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:1">gaasoykka ta atoteththay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:1">matan dees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:1">ta xilloteththayka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:1">eeson qonccana.<verse eid="ISA 56:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 56:2" />Sambata tunisontta bonchchizay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:2">iita oosoppe ba kushe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:2">shiishshizaynne naagizay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:2">haytantta polizay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:2">anjjettidaade» gees.<verse eid="ISA 56:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 56:3" />GODAAKKO shiiqida betey,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:3">«GODAY tana ba asaappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:3">tumu shaakkana» gooppo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:3">Gundulaykka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:3">«Tani melida miththa» gooppo.<verse eid="ISA 56:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 56:4" />GODAY, «Ta Sambatata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:4">bonchchiza gundulatas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:4">tana ufayssiza miish doorizaytas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:4">ta caaqo qaala naagizaytas,<verse eid="ISA 56:4" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 56:5" />ta Keeththaninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:5">ta gimbeta giddon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:5">attuma naytappenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:5">macca naytappe aadhdhiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:5">hassa7issiza miishshinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:5">sunth isttas immana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:5">mernaas dhayontta sunth</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:5">ta isttas immana.<verse eid="ISA 56:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 56:6" />GODAAS haggazanaas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:6">bana GODAARA gaththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:6">waaxida bete asata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:6">GODAA sunth siiqizaytanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:6">izas goynnizayta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:6">sambata tunisontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:6">bonchchiza ubbatanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:6">caaqo qaala naagizayta,<verse eid="ISA 56:6" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 56:7" />tani ta geeshsha zumaa bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:7">istta ehana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:7">ta woosa keeththa giddon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:7">ta istta ufayssana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:7">Taas yarsho yarshizasoza bollan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:7">istti shiishshiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:7">xuugettiza yarshonne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:7">hara yarshota ta ekkana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:7">gaasoykka ta keeththay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:7">ubbaa asaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:7">woosa keeth geetettana» gees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">56:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:13">Mato 21:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:17">Mar 11:17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:46">Luqa 19:46</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 56:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 56:8" />Laalettida Isra7eele shiishshiza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:8">Ubbaa Haariza GODAY,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:8">«Shiiqidayta bolla gujja,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:8">tani haratakka zaara shiishshana» gees.<verse eid="ISA 56:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iitata Bolla Xoossa Walasse</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 56:9" />Intteno do7atoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:9">intteno wora do7atoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:9">ubbayka haa yiite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:9">intte achchaarakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:9">puuzereththite.<verse eid="ISA 56:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 56:10" />Isra7eele asaa naagizayti qooqe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:10">isttas erateththi deenna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:10">istti ubbay boccontta kana mala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:10">boccanaas dandayettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:10">istti ichchidi agumetteettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:10">istti dhiskanchcha.<verse eid="ISA 56:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 56:11" />Istti ganjama kana mala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:11">miidi kalli erettenna.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:11">Istti akeekay baynda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:11">heenththanchchata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:11">istti ubbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:11">bantta oge oge beettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:11">issoy issoy ba go7a xalla xeellees.<verse eid="ISA 56:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 56:12" />Istti issoy issaara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:12">«Haa yiite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:12">woyne ushshu ane uyoos.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:12">Ane maththottana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:12">gakkanaas uyoos!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:12">Wontoyka hachcha mala gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:12">woykko hachchifekka aadhdhi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:12">lo7o gidana» geetettana.<verse eid="ISA 56:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 56" />
  <chapter number="57" style="c" sid="ISA 57" />
  <para style="s1">Xillota Gakkiza Meto</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 57:1" />Xillo asi hayqqees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:1">hessa oonikka wozinan woththenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:1">Xoossaas aqiza asata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:1">shemppoy ekettees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:1">xilloti iitappe attana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:1">ekettidayssa oonikka akeekenna.<verse eid="ISA 57:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 57:2" />Suureteththan bizayti saron gelana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:2">hayqqidikka ba hiiththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:2">saron shemppana.<verse eid="ISA 57:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iitata Bolla Yaana Pirda</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 57:3" />GODAY, «Intteno maro naytoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:3">intteno laggeththizayssanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:3">laymatizaari zereththatoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:3">intte haa yiite.<verse eid="ISA 57:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 57:4" />Intte oona bolla qilcceetii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:4">Intte inxarsi oona bolla kesseetii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:4">Intte makkallanchchata naytanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:4">wordanchchata zare gidekketii?<verse eid="ISA 57:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 57:5" />Intte wola garsaninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:5">daashsha miththata garsan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:5">ziitan xuugettizayta gidekketii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:5">zulletaninne zaalla za7ata garsan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:5">intte nayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:5">yarshizayta gidekketii?<verse eid="ISA 57:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 57:6" />Hanne zullen diza liiqo shuchchati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:6">nees eeqa xoossata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:6">isttika ne qaadata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:6">tumukka ne istta bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:6">ushsha yarsho gussadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:6">kaththa yarshoka shiishshadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:6">histtiin ha yo7ota gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:6">ta co7u gaanee?<verse eid="ISA 57:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 57:7" />Ne hiixa dhoqqu gida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:7">adussa zumbulla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:7">hu7en hiixxadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:7">heen ne yarsho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:7">shiishshana kezadasa.<verse eid="ISA 57:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 57:8" />Ne pengefenne qosilaththaafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:8">soo baggara eeqa misleta essadasa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:8">Tana aggada ne hiixaa qaaradasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:8">iza bolla kezada keeha qaaradasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:8">ne dosidaytara qaala giigadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:8">istta kalloka be7adasa.<verse eid="ISA 57:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 57:9" />Wogara zayte ekkada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:9">shitto iza bolla gujjada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:9">Molooke geetettiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:9">eeqa xoossaako badasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:9">nees kiitettizayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:9">haako dere kiittadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:9">duge si7oole gakkanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:9">kanththadasa.<verse eid="ISA 57:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 57:10" />Ne oge daroppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:10">dendidayssan daaburadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:10">gido attiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:10">‹Hidotay baawa› gabeekka.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:10">Ne wolqqay haa ooraxides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:10">hessa gishshas argacabeekka.<verse eid="ISA 57:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 57:11" />«Neni taas wordotiday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:11">oonas yayyadaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:11">Oonas hirgadaa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:11">Ne tana qoppontta aggiday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:11">hayssaka ne wozinan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:11">qum7ontta aggiday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:11">taas ne yayyontta ixxiday,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:11">tani co7u gida gishshas gidennee?<verse eid="ISA 57:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 57:12" />Tani ne xilloteththinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:12">ne ooso qonccisana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:12">isttika nena go7ettenna.<verse eid="ISA 57:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 57:13" />Neni maado demmanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:13">waassiza wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:13">ane ne shiishshida eeqa xoossati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:13">nena ashshetto!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:13">istta ubbaaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:13">carkoy ekki efana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:13">guuththa peenoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:13">istta laalli dhayssana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:13">gido attiin tana baas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:13">baqataso ooththida asi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:13">biittayo laattana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:13">ta geeshsha zumayo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:13">baas miish ooththana» gees.<verse eid="ISA 57:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wozinay Meqqidaytas Imettida Minththeththo</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 57:14" />GODAY, «Baasite, baasite!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:14">Oge giigsite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:14">ta deraa ogaappe dhuphiza miish</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:14">ubbaa diggite» gees.<verse eid="ISA 57:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 57:15" />Dhoqqu gidayssi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:15">Ubbaa haarizayssi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:15">izas sunththayka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:15">Geesh geetettidayssi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:15">mernaas de7izayssi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:15">«kawuyidayta ayana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:15">denththeththanaas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:15">wozinay meqqidayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:15">minththeththanaas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:15">dhoqqu gida geeshshasohon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:15">ta de7ays;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:15">qasseka wozinay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:15">meqqidaytaranne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:15">ayanan ashke gididaytara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:15">tani de7ana.<verse eid="ISA 57:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 57:16" />Asa ayanay ta sinththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:16">daaburontta mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:16">ta medhdhida asaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:16">peenoy eqqontta mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:16">ta mernaas walassike;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:16">ta ubbato hanqettike.<verse eid="ISA 57:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 57:17" />Iza nagara gishshassinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:17">iza yiiqeteththa gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:17">ta hanqettadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:17">ta iza qaxxayadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:17">ta sinththaaka hanqon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:17">izappe genththadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:17">gido attiin ha7ikka simmidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:17">izi ba ogen bides.<verse eid="ISA 57:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 57:18" />Tani iza ogeta be7adis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:18">gidikkoka ta iza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:18">paththananne kaaleththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:18">izassinne iza gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:18">yeekkiza geeshshata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:18">ta minththeththana.<verse eid="ISA 57:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 57:19" />Isra7eele biittan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:19">yeekkizayta doonan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:19">ta galata woththana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:19">Mataninne haahon dizaytas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:19">saroynne woppay gido.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:19">Tani istta paththana» gees.<verse eid="ISA 57:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 57:20" />Gido attiin iitati dambalay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:20">urqqanne buura kessiza mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:20">co7u gaanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:20">dandayonttayssa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:20">bulakettiza abba mala.<verse eid="ISA 57:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 57:21" />Ta Xoossay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:21">«Iitatas saroy baawa» gees.<verse eid="ISA 57:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 57" />
  <chapter number="58" style="c" sid="ISA 58" />
  <para style="s1">Tumu Xooma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 58:1" />GODAY, «Ne qaalaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:1">dhoqqu histta waassa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:1">aykkoka ashshofa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:1">Ne cenggurssa zaye mala sissa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:1">Ta deraas istta makkallateththa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:1">Yaaqoobe keeththa asaasikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:1">istta nagaraa yoota.<verse eid="ISA 58:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 58:2" />Istti tana hach hach koyeettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:2">ta ogeza eranaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:2">laamotiza misateettes.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:2">Suure miish ooththida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:2">kawoteththa malanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:2">ba Xoossaa azazo yeggi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:2">aggontta dere mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:2">istti tana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:2">suure pirda oychcheettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:2">Xoossi isttako shiiqanayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:2">istti dosiza misatees» gees.<verse eid="ISA 58:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 58:3" />Istti shiiqidi, «Ne ekkonttaashin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:3">nu aazas xoomidonii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:3">Ne wudu gonttaashin ays nuna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:3">kawushshidonii?» gaana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:3">GODAY zaaridi isttas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:3">«Gidikkoka intte xoomiza gallas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:3">intte wozina</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:3">qofa mala ooththeeta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:3">inttes ooththizaytappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:3">bonqqeeta.<verse eid="ISA 58:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 58:4" />Intte xoomay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:4">ooshshaninne palaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:4">gene oosoninne wadhetan polettees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:4">hayssafe sinththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:4">intte xoomizayssa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:4">hachchife guye intte woosay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:4">salon siyettana giidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:4">hidota ooththofte.<verse eid="ISA 58:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 58:5" />Tani dooriday hayssa mala xoomaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:5">Asi bana kawushshanay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:5">hayssa mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:5">gallas xallaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:5">Shacca mala bana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:5">ziqqi histteththee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:5">woykko maaqa may7idi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:5">bidinththaa bolla bululeteththee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:5">Histtiin ne xooma ga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:5">xeygizayssi hayssee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:5">GODAY hessa malan ufayettizee?<verse eid="ISA 58:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 58:6" />«Be7ite tani doorida xoomay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:6">un7ettidayta sansalata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:6">intte duuththana mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:6">qambara wodoro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:6">intte birshana mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:6">un7ettidayta intte</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:6">la7a yeddana mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:6">tooho gidida qambara intte</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:6">menththana mala gidennee?<verse eid="ISA 58:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 58:7" />Qasseka ne qumaappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:7">gafidaades shaakkanaas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:7">toylattida manqoza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:7">neso gelththanaas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:7">kallottida be7ada mayzanaas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:7">nees asho dabbozas ne sinththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:7">ne tukkontta mala gidennee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">58:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:35">Mato 25:35</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 58:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 58:8" />Ne hessaththo ooththiko ne poo7oy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:8">wontta xalqqe mala caarana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:8">paxateththi nees eeson gakkana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:8">xilloteththi neeppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:8">sinththara baana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:8">Xoossa bonchchoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:8">nena garadana.<verse eid="ISA 58:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 58:9" />He wode neni xeygana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:9">GODAYKKA nees koyana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:9">Neni maado</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:9">demmanaas waassana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:9">izikka, ‹Ta nees days› gaana.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 58:9" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:9">«Ne neeppe metoththiza qambara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:9">iita haasayanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:9">biradhdhen malata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:9">bessizayssa aggiko,<verse eid="ISA 58:9" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 58:10" />gafidaades ne qadhettiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:10">qohettidayti kallana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:10">ne histtiko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:10">nees poo7oy dhuma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:10">giddon poo7ana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:10">nees dhumidayssika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:10">seeta gallassa mala gidana.<verse eid="ISA 58:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 58:11" />GODAY nena ubbatoo kaaleththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:11">away xuuggida biittan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:11">ne amo izi kunththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:11">ne meqeththatakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:11">izi minththana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:11">Neni haath alada atakiltesohonne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:11">mulekka to7ontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:11">pultto mala gidana.<verse eid="ISA 58:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 58:12" />Ne dabboti beni yochchata yeggana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:12">kase laalettidayta zaari keexxana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:12">neni laalettida gimbe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:12">zaari ooraxissizaade,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:12">wogga ogeti diza katamata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:12">zaari giigsizaade geetettana» gees.<verse eid="ISA 58:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sambata Bonchchon Beettiza Go7a</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 58:13" />Qasseka, «Ne tohoti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:13">sambata shaarontta mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:13">ne shempisikko dummatida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:13">ta gallassaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:13">ne wozina qofa ooththontta aggiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:13">sambata gallassaa ufays,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:13">GODAAS dummatida gallassa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:13">neni bonchcho gallas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:13">ga xeygikko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:13">ne shene mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:13">ne ooththizayssafenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:13">hada yo7oppe ne naagettiko,<verse eid="ISA 58:13" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 58:14" />he wode ne GODAAN ufayettana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:14">Biitta bollan dhoqqasohotan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:14">ta nena togisana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:14">ne aawa Yaaqoobe xinxxo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:14">ne kalla maana mala ooththana»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:14">giidi GODAY hayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:14">ba doonan haasaydes.<verse eid="ISA 58:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 58" />
  <chapter number="59" style="c" sid="ISA 59" />
  <para style="s1">Nagara Maareteththinne Wozzeteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 59:1" />Hekko GODAA kushey inttena</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:1">ashshanaas qaammibeenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:1">iza hayththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:1">siyanaappe tullibeenna.<verse eid="ISA 59:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 59:2" />Gido attiin intte qohoy inttena</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:2">intte Xoossaafe shaakkides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:2">intte nagaray iza ayfeso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:2">inttefe genththides.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:2">Hessa gishshas izi siyenna.<verse eid="ISA 59:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 59:3" />Intte kushey suuththan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:3">intte biradhdheyka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:3">qohon muulettides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:3">intte doonay wordo haasaydes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:3">inxarsati iita yo7o sissida.<verse eid="ISA 59:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 59:4" />Xilloteththan mootizay baawa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:4">tumateththan pirdizay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:4">oonikka deenna.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:4">Hada yo7on ammanetteettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:4">wordo haasayeettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:4">shiro qanththatidi iitateth yelida.<verse eid="ISA 59:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 59:5" />Istti shooshsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:5">phuuphphulle haphphida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:5">achcharo keeth keexxida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:5">istta phuuphphulleta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:5">miza asi hayqqees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:5">isttafe issoy meqqiko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:5">puukkiza shooshshi kezees.<verse eid="ISA 59:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 59:6" />Istta qacinay may7o gidenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:6">istti ooththidayssan bantta bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:6">kammana dandayettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:6">istta oosoy iita;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:6">istta kushetan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:6">makkalla oosoy kumides.<verse eid="ISA 59:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 59:7" />Istta tohoti nagarakko woxxeettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:7">xillo suuth gussanaas eesoteettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:7">istti iita qofa qoppeettes.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:7">Bashshinne qohoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:7">istti aadhdhida oge ubbaas malata.<verse eid="ISA 59:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 59:8" />Istti saroteththa oge erettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:8">istti biza ogen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:8">suure pirday baawa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:8">istti bantta oge geellasida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:8">he ogera bizay saro demmenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">59:7-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:15-17">Oro 3:15-17</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 59:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 59:9" />Hessa gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:9">suure pirday nuuppe haakkides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:9">xilloteththika nuukko gakkenna.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:9">Nuni poo7o koyidos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:9">gido attiin ubbay dhuma gidides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:9">wagagga poo7o koyidos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:9">gido attiin sakkanna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:9">dhuma gidides.<verse eid="ISA 59:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 59:10" />Qooqe mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:10">gimbeza bolla gandigardos.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:10">Nu hemetay ayfey baynda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:10">asa mala tattafeteth gidides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:10">arshey wullishin haniza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:10">seeta gallas dhuphettidos.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:10">Qasse mino asata giddon nuni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:10">hayqqida asa mala gididos.<verse eid="ISA 59:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 59:11" />Nuni ubbay zardo mala laawoos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:11">haraphpheta malakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:11">ceecishe guugumoos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:11">nuni suure pirda koyidos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:11">gido attiin demmibeekko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:11">attana koyidos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:11">gido attiin izi nuuppe haakkides.<verse eid="ISA 59:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 59:12" />Gaasoykka nu qohoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:12">ne sinththan darides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:12">nu nagaraykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:12">nu bolla markkattides.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:12">Nu mooroy nuuppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:12">shaakettibeenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:12">nu makkallateththaaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:12">nuni eroos.<verse eid="ISA 59:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 59:13" />Nuni GODAA bolla makkallidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:13">wordo haasaydos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:13">nu Xoossaa kaalo aggidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:13">sher7i gidos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:13">makkallateththinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:13">gene yo7o haasaydos.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:13">Nu wozinay shaari uttida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:13">wordo haasaydos.<verse eid="ISA 59:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 59:14" />Hessa gishshas suure pirday</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:14">guye sugettides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:14">xilloteththika nuuppe haakkides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:14">tumateththi oge bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:14">dhuphettides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:14">suureteththika gelanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:14">dandaybeenna.<verse eid="ISA 59:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 59:15" />Tumateththi awankka beettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:15">iitateththaafe haakkizay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:15">qohettees;</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 59:15" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:15">GODAY be7idi suure pirday</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:15">dhayda gishshas ceecides.<verse eid="ISA 59:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 59:16" />Oonikka bayndayssa be7ides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:16">izakko gaannatizay bayndayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:16">be7idi malalettides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:16">Hessa gishshas iza qesey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:16">izas atoteth ehides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:16">iza xilloteththi iza kaafi oykkides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">59:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 63:5">Isa 63:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 59:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 59:17" />Izi xilloteththa xurure mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:17">tiran may7ides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:17">atoteththaa birata qoobe mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:17">ba hu7e bolla woththides.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:17">May7o garsara may7iza mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:17">halo keso may7ides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:17">may7o gophi may7iza mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:17">qanaate bollara gophides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">59:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:14">Efe 6:14</ref>,<ref loc="EPH 6:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 5:8">1Taso 5:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 59:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 59:18" />Istta ooso mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:18">hanqo ba baalgaaratas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:18">pirda ba morkketas izi qanxxana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:18">Haruro biittatas istta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:18">ooso ooso mala immana.<verse eid="ISA 59:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 59:19" />GODAA peenoy sugi ekki biza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:19">wolqqama di7o mala yaana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:19">Hessa gishshas arshey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:19">wulliza baggara dizayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:19">GODAA sunththas yayyana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:19">arshey mokkiza baggara dizayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:19">iza bonchchos haarettana.<verse eid="ISA 59:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 59:20" />GODAY, «Wozzizaadey Xiyoonessinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:20">Yaaqoobe zaretan bantta nagara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:20">paaxidaytakko yaana» gees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">59:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:26">Oro 11:26</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 59:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 59:21" />Qasseka GODAY, «Ta baggara taassinne isttas diza caaqo qaalay hayssa; intte bolla diza ta Ayanaynne tani intte doonan woththida ta qaalay hachchife doommidi mernaa gakkanaas, intte doonappe, intte nayta doonappenne intte zereththa doonappe shaakettenna» gees.<verse eid="ISA 59:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 59" />
  <chapter number="60" style="c" sid="ISA 60" />
  <para style="s1">Sinththafe Yaana Xiyoone Bonchcho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 60:1" />GODAY,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:1">«Ne poo7oy yida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:1">dendada poo7isa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:1">GODAA bonchchoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:1">ne bolla poo7ides.<verse eid="ISA 60:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 60:2" />Be7a, dhumay sa7aa kammana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:2">sakkanna dhumay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:2">deraa goozi oykkana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:2">gido attiin GODAY nees gakkana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:2">ba bonchchoka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:2">ne bolla poo7isana.<verse eid="ISA 60:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 60:3" />Kawoteththati ne poo7okko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:3">kawotikka ne wontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:3">xalqqeko yaana.<verse eid="ISA 60:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 60:4" />«Dhoqqu gaada ne yuusho xeella;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:4">istti ubbay issife shiiqidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:4">neekko yaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:4">ne attuma nayti haahoppe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:4">ne macca naytikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:4">idimon neekko yaana.<verse eid="ISA 60:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 60:5" />He wode ne be7ananne phoollana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:5">ne wozinay ufayssan kumana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:5">abban diza aqotay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:5">neekko yaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:5">kawoteththata dureteththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:5">nees gidana.<verse eid="ISA 60:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 60:6" />Gaamella marati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:6">Midiyaameppenne Eefappe yida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:6">gaamella marati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:6">ne biittaa kammana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:6">Worqqanne exaane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:6">ekkidi Saabappe yizayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:6">GODAA galata awajjana.<verse eid="ISA 60:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 60:7" />Qeedaareppe dorsata wudey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:7">ubbay neekko shiiqana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:7">Nebayoote dere dharshoti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:7">nena go7ana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:7">haytanti taas yarsho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:7">yarshizasoza bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:7">ekettida yarshota gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:7">tanikka ta bonchcho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:7">keeththaa puulasana.<verse eid="ISA 60:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 60:8" />«Haraphphey ba aqizaso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:8">biza malanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:8">shaara mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:8">bizayti haytanti oonee?<verse eid="ISA 60:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 60:9" />Tumukka haruroti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:9">tanan hidota ooththeettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:9">izi nena ba bonchcho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:9">mayzida gishshas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:9">GODAA ne Xoossa bonchchos,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:9">Isra7eele Geeshshaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:9">haakoppe ne attuma nayta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:9">istta biraaranne worqqaara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:9">gaththi ehanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:9">Tarseese markabeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:9">sinththati kezana.<verse eid="ISA 60:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 60:10" />«Allagati ne gimbe gimbana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:10">istta kawoti nees haggazana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:10">ta hanqon ta nena</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:10">shocidaa gidikkoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:10">ta qadheta siiqo nena bessana.<verse eid="ISA 60:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 60:11" />Ne pengeti ubbatoo doya de7ana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:11">gallas gidiin omars</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:11">mulekka gordettettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:11">hessika asay kawoteththata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:11">dureteththaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:11">neekko ehanaassa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:11">istta kawotikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:11">xoonon neekko gelana malassa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">60:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:25-26">Ajju 21:25-26</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 60:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 60:12" />Nees haarettontta kawoteththinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:12">derey mulekka dippi gaana.<verse eid="ISA 60:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 60:13" />Ta Keeththay dizaso alleqissanaas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:13">Libaanoose bonchchoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:13">guuganththi, xiiddaynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:13">barseneetey neekko yaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:13">ta tohoy eqqizasoza ta bonchchana.<verse eid="ISA 60:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 60:14" />Nena un7eththidayta attuma nayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:14">ziggishe neekko yaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:14">nena kadhida ubbati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:14">ne toho bolla kundana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:14">‹Hanne GODAA katamayee!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:14">Isra7eeles Geeshsha miish gidida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:14">Xiyoone› gi xeygana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">60:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 3:9">Ajju 3:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 60:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 60:15" />«Hanne ixettada yegettidaaree,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:15">oonikka ne giddora kanththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:15">bizaaro gidontta aggikokka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:15">tani nena mernaa ceeqossinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:15">yeleta ubbaas ufays histtana.<verse eid="ISA 60:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 60:16" />Neni kawoteththata maath uyana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:16">kawota dhanththika dhammana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:16">Hessafe guye tani GODAY</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:16">nena Ashshizayssa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:16">nena Wozzizayssanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:16">Yaaqoobe Wolqqama gididayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:16">neni erana.<verse eid="ISA 60:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 60:17" />Xarqimala sohon worqqa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:17">birata sohon bira ehana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:17">miththa sohon xarqimala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:17">shuchcha sohon birata ehana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:17">saroteth nena ayssizaade,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:17">xilloteththika nees</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:17">halaqa histtana.<verse eid="ISA 60:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 60:18" />Hayssafe guye ne biittan shiroy,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:18">ne zawankka laaleteththinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:18">bashshi siyettenna.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:18">Gido attiin ne dirsaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:18">gimbe atoteththi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:18">ne pengetakka galata gaada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:18">ne xeygana.<verse eid="ISA 60:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 60:19" />«Hessafe guye gallas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:19">awa poo7oy nees koshshenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:19">omarsika aginay poo7enna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:19">gaasoykka GODAY nees</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:19">mernaa poo7o gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:19">ne Xoossay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:19">nees bonchcho gidana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">60:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:23">Ajju 21:23</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:5">22:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 60:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 60:20" />Ne arshey hayssafe guye gelenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:20">ne aginaykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:20">poo7o imo aggenna.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:20">GODAY nees</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:20">mernaa poo7o gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:20">ne ceecida gallassati gidana.<verse eid="ISA 60:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 60:21" />Ne asay ubbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:21">xillo gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:21">biittayokka mernaas laattana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:21">istti ta bonchcho qonccisanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:21">tani tokkida puutetanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:21">ta kushe oosota.<verse eid="ISA 60:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 60:22" />Neeppe kaalozi shii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:22">ubbaafe wurseththa kaalozi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:22">wolqqama kawoteth gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:22">Tani GODAA;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:22">wodey gakkiza wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:22">tani hessa eeson polana» gees.<verse eid="ISA 60:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 60" />
  <chapter number="61" style="c" sid="ISA 61" />
  <para style="s1">Atoteththa Mishiraachcho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 61:1" />Ubbaa Haariza GODAA Ayanay ta bolla dees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:1">hiyeesatas mishiraachcho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:1">yootana mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:1">GODAY tana tiydes.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:1">Izi tana wozinay meqqidayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:1">koolana mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:1">di7ettidayta la7a kessana mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:1">qashettidaytas birsheth</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:1">awajjana mala kiittides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">61:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:5">Mato 11:5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 7:22">Luqa 7:22</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 61:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 61:2" />Dosettida GODAA layth,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:2">nu Xoossay halo kessiza gallassa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:2">awajjana malanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:2">yeekkizayta ubbaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:2">minththeththana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:2">tana kiittides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">61:1-2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 4:18-19">Luqa 4:18-19</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 61:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 61:3" />Qasseka Xiyoonen kayottizayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:3">doshisana mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:3">bidinththa gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:3">puulateththa kallachcha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:3">yeeho gishshas ufayssa zayte</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:3">istta hu7en ta gussana mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:3">ceece ayana gishshas galata seelo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:3">ta istta bolla gophana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:3">tana kiittides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:3">isttika iza bonchcho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:3">qonccisana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:3">GODAY tokkida xillo mith</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:3">geetetti xeygettana.<verse eid="ISA 61:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 61:4" />Istti beni laalettidayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:4">zaari keexxana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:4">kase wode kundidaytakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:4">zaari essana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:4">daro yeletatappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:4">kase kundidaytanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:4">laalettida katamata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:4">zaari keexxana.<verse eid="ISA 61:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 61:5" />Imaththati intte dorsa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:5">wudeta heemmana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:5">allaga biitta asati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:5">intte gadeninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:5">intte woyne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:5">atakilte giddon ooththana.<verse eid="ISA 61:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 61:6" />Intte qasse, «GODAA qeeseta»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:6">geetetti xeygettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:6">asaykka inttena,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:6">«Nu Xoossaa oosanchchata»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:6">giidi xeygana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:6">intte kawoteththata aqota maana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:6">istta dureteththankka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:6">intte ceeqettana.<verse eid="ISA 61:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 61:7" />Ta derey yeellatidayssa qoodhe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:7">nam7u kushe ekkana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:7">kawuyidayssa qoodhe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:7">bantta xinxxon ufayettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:7">bantta biittaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:7">nam7u kushe laattana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:7">mernaa ufayssi isttas gidana.<verse eid="ISA 61:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 61:8" />Tani GODAY suure pirda dosays;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:8">bonqqanne qoho ixxays.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:8">Ta ammaneteththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:8">isttas bessizayssa immana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:8">isttara mernaa caaqo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:8">qaala gelana.<verse eid="ISA 61:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 61:9" />Istta zareti kawoteththata giddon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:9">istta nayti dere giddon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:9">erettidayta gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:9">istti be7iza ubbay GODAY anjjida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:9">dere gididayssa erana;<verse eid="ISA 61:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 61:10" />Tani GODAAN keehippe ufayettays;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:10">ta shemppoyakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:10">ta Xoossan hombocawus;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:10">mishiray ba hu7en</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:10">kallachcha goxxiza mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:10">mishirayakka bana inqqun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:10">seeleththiza mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:10">atoteththa may7o tana mayzides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:10">xilloteththa seelokka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:10">ta bolla gophides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">61:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:2">Ajju 21:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 61:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 61:11" />Biittay caarech caarissiza mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:11">atakiltesohoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:11">puute puutisiza mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:11">Ubbaa Haariza GODAY</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:11">kawoteththata ubbaa sinththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:11">xilloteththinne galata caarissana.<verse eid="ISA 61:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 61" />
  <chapter number="62" style="c" sid="ISA 62" />
  <para style="s1">Xiyoonis Ooraththa Sunth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 62:1" />Izi xilloteththi maalado poo7o mala phoollanaashe gakkanaas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:1">izi atoteththi xomppe mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:1">poo7anaashe gakkanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:1">ta Xiyooni gishshas co7u giikke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:1">Yerusalaame gishshassika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:1">sirphi giikke.<verse eid="ISA 62:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 62:2" />Kawoteththati ne xilloteth,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:2">kawotikka ne bonchcho be7ana;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:2">GODAY ba doonan sunththida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:2">ooraththa sunththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:2">ne xeygettana.<verse eid="ISA 62:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 62:3" />Neni GODAA kushe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:3">bonchcho akilile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:3">ne Xoossa kushen kawota</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:3">kallachcha gidana.<verse eid="ISA 62:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 62:4" />Hayssafe guye neni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:4">«Azinay yeggi aggidaaro» geetettaka.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:4">Qasse ne biittayakka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:4">«Yegetta attidaaro» geetettuku.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:4">Gido attiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:4">«Ta ufayssi izinna» geetettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:4">ne biittayakka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:4">«Azinay dizaaro» geetettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:4">GODAY nenan ufayettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:4">ne biittayakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:4">azinara dizaaro gidana.<verse eid="ISA 62:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 62:5" />Panththi geela7o ekkiza mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:5">ne nayti nena ekkana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:5">mishirazi mishirayn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:5">ufayettiza mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:5">ne Xoossi nenan ufayettana.<verse eid="ISA 62:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 62:6" />Hanne Yerusalaamee!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:6">Naagizayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:6">ne dirsata bolla essadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:6">istti gallassika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:6">omars guye geettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:6">Intteno GODAAKKO waassizaytoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:6">mulekka shempofte;<verse eid="ISA 62:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 62:7" />Izi Yerusalaame minththana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:7">gakkanaassinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:7">biitta ubbaa bolla erettida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:7">katama ooththana gakkanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:7">izas shemppo immofte.<verse eid="ISA 62:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 62:8" />GODAY ba ushachcha kusheninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:8">ba wolqqama qesen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:8">«Hayssafe guye ta intte kath</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:8">intte morkketas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:8">quma gidana mala immike;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:8">qasse intte daaburi kessida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:8">ooraththa ushshaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:8">allagati uyettenna.<verse eid="ISA 62:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 62:9" />Gido attiin kaththaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:9">shiishshidayti maana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:9">GODAAKKA galatana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:9">woyne teera maxi shiishshidayti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:9">ta keeththa pengen uyana»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:9">gi caaqqides.<verse eid="ISA 62:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 62:10" />Aadhdhite! Iza pengeta baggara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:10">kanththi biite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:10">deraas oge baasite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:10">giigsite; shuchchata diggite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:10">kawoteththatas malaata essite.<verse eid="ISA 62:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 62:11" />Be7ite, GODAY</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:11">sa7a gaxa gakkanaas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:11">«Xiyoone macca nays,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:11">‹Hekko nena Ashshizaadey yees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:11">ne waagay iza kushen dees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:11">ne qaaday izakkon dees› giite»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:11">giidi awajjides.<verse eid="ISA 62:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 62:12" />Istti, «GODAY Wozzida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:12">Geeshsha dereta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:12">nekka Yegetta Attonttaaro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:12">koyettiza Katamayo» geetettana.<verse eid="ISA 62:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 62" />
  <chapter number="63" style="c" sid="ISA 63" />
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Xoononne Izi Ashshiza Wolqqa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 63:1" />Eedoome biittan diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:1">Booxira katamappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:1">zo7o seelo may7o may7idi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:1">yizay hessi izi oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:1">hayssi bonchcho may7idi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:1">ba wolqqa gitateththan hemettishe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:1">yizay izi oonee?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:1">«Xillo haasayzaynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:1">ashshanaas wolqqay dizay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:1">tana gidikkinaa!» gees GODAY.<verse eid="ISA 63:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 63:2" />Ne seelo may7oy woyne gum7iza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:2">asata may7o mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:2">ays zo7idee?<verse eid="ISA 63:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 63:3" />«Gum7izasohozan woyne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:3">tani tarkka yedhdhadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:3">kawoteththatappe oonikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:3">tanara deenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:3">tani istta ta hanqon yedhdhadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:3">ta bashshankka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:3">istta dirxxereththadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:3">istta suuththi ta seelo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:3">may7o bolla dhacettides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:3">ta may7oy ubbay moorettides.<verse eid="ISA 63:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 63:4" />Tani halo kessana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:4">gallassay ta wozinan dees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:4">ta wozzana gallassayka gakkides.<verse eid="ISA 63:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 63:5" />Tani xeelladis shin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:5">maaddizay beettibeenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:5">maaddizaadey baynda gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:5">tani malalettadis.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:5">Hessa gishshas ta qesey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:5">taas atoteth ehides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:5">ta hanqoyka tana minththides.<verse eid="ISA 63:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 63:6" />Ta hanqon kawoteththata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:6">yedhdhadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:6">ta bashshan istta maththosadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:6">istta suuththaaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:6">biittan gussadis» gaana.<verse eid="ISA 63:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossay Isra7eeles Ooththida Kiyateth</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 63:7" />GODAA kiyateththi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:7">GODAY nuus ooththida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:7">ooso ubbaa gishshas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:7">izi galatettiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:7">oosoza gishshas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:7">iza siiqozanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:7">iza kiyateththa keena,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:7">Isra7eele keeththas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:7">izi ooththidayssa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:7">ee izi ooththida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:7">lo7o oosota gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:7">ta yootana.<verse eid="ISA 63:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 63:8" />GODAYKKA, «Tumukka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:8">istti ta dereta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:8">istti taas wordotontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:8">attuma nayta» gides.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:8">Hessa gishshas izi istta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:8">Ashshizaade gidides.<verse eid="ISA 63:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 63:9" />Istta meto ubbaan ceecides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:9">Iza duussaa erisiza kiitanchchay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:9">istta ashshides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:9">izi ba siiqoninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:9">ba maaroteththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:9">istta wozzides.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:9">Kase aadhdhida wode ubbaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:9">istta denththidesinne tookkides.<verse eid="ISA 63:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 63:10" />Istti gidikko makkallida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:10">iza Geeshsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:10">Ayanaakka mishisida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:10">hessa gishshas izi simmidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:10">isttas morkke gidides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:10">istta olides.<verse eid="ISA 63:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 63:11" />Hessafe guye asay beni wodezanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:11">Muse wode yuushshi qoppides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:11">Ba dorsata heenththanchchatara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:11">ubbaafe kessidayssi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:11">izi awan dizee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:11">Ba Geeshsha Ayana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:11">istta giddon woththidayssi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:11">ha7i awan dizee?<verse eid="ISA 63:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 63:12" />Bonchchettida wolqqama qese,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:12">Muses ushachcha kushe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:12">bolla woththides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:12">baas mernaas sunth kessanaas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:12">haaththata istta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:12">sinththan shaakkides.<verse eid="ISA 63:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 63:13" />Paray aykkoy baynda bazzo biittara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:13">kanththi biza mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:13">isttaka ciimma giddora</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:13">kaaleththi pinththides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:13">hessa gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:13">istti dhuphettibeettenna.<verse eid="ISA 63:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 63:14" />Duge zulle wodhdhiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:14">mehe wude mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:14">GODAA Ayanay isttas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:14">shemppo immides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:14">izi deraa hessaththo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:14">kaaleththiday, ne sunththaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:14">bonchchisanaassa.<verse eid="ISA 63:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maado Demmanaas Woossiza Woosa</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 63:15" />Abeet GODAWU,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:15">dummatida, bonchchettidanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:15">dhoqqu gida ne araataappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:15">saloppe duge xeella;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:15">ne wolqqaynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:15">ne mishettiza mishoy awanee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:15">ne ashketeththaynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:15">ne qadheteththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:15">nuuppe haakkides.<verse eid="ISA 63:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 63:16" />Abrahaamey nuna erontta aggiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:16">Isra7eeleykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:16">nuna akeekontta aggikokka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:16">neni nuus aawa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:16">Abeet GODAWU, neni nuus aawa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:16">Beniisofekka doommidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:16">ne sunththay nuna wozzizayssa.<verse eid="ISA 63:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 63:17" />Abeet GODAWU,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:17">nuni ne ogeppe kezana mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:17">nu wozina tullisada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:17">nees yayyontta mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:17">ays ooththay?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:17">Ne aylleta gishshas gaada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:17">nees xinxxo gidida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:17">qommota gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:17">gaada nuukko simma.<verse eid="ISA 63:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 63:18" />Guuththa wodes ne derey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:18">geeshshasohoza laattides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:18">ha7i gidikko nu morkketi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:18">ne Keeththaa yedhdhida.<verse eid="ISA 63:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 63:19" />Hekko beniisofe nuni neyta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:19">gido attiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:19">istta neni haarabeekka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:19">istti ne sunththankka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:19">xeygettibeettenna.<verse eid="ISA 63:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 63" />
  <chapter number="64" style="c" sid="ISA 64" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 64:1" />Abeet GODAWU, neni salota daakkada duge wodhdharkkii!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:1">Zumati ne sinththan kokkoretto.<verse eid="ISA 64:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 64:2" />Qayxare tamay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:2">haath penttisiza mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:2">ne morkketa matan ne sunththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:2">erettana mala wodhdha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:2">kawoteththatakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:2">ne sinththan kokkorssa.<verse eid="ISA 64:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 64:3" />Kasekka neni nu qoppontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:3">yashissiza miish</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:3">ne ooththida wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:3">ne wodhdhiin zumati kokkorida.<verse eid="ISA 64:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 64:4" />Beniisofe doommidi hidota ooththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:4">naagizaytas gakkiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:4">malaata ooththiday neeppe attiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:4">hara Xoos be7ida ayfeynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:4">siyida hayththi mulekka deenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">64:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 2:9">1Qoro 2:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 64:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 64:5" />Suure miish ufayssan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:5">ooththizaytanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:5">ne oge qoppizayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:5">neni maaddaasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:5">gido attiin nuni istta bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:5">pacey baynda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:5">nagara ooththida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:5">hekko neni nu bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:5">hanqettadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:5">histtiin nuni waani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:5">attana dandayzonii?<verse eid="ISA 64:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 64:6" />Nuni ubbayka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:6">tuna asa mala gididos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:6">nu xilloteththa ooso ubbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:6">tunida carqqa mala.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:6">Nuni ubbayka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:6">boncco mala qokkidos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:6">nu nagaray nuna carko mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:6">pitti efides.<verse eid="ISA 64:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 64:7" />Oonikka woosan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:7">ne sunth xeygenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:7">nena oykkana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:7">paaccizaykka deenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:7">neni ne ayfeso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:7">nuuppe genththadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:7">nu nagaray nuna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:7">dhayssana mala aggadasa.<verse eid="ISA 64:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 64:8" />Gidikkoka abeet GODAWU,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:8">neni nuus aawa; nuni urqqata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:8">neni nuna medhdhidayssa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:8">nuni ubbayka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:8">ne kushen medhettidayta.<verse eid="ISA 64:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 64:9" />Abeet GODAWU, keeha hanqettofa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:9">nu nagaraakka mernaas qoppofa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:9">nuus woosetta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:9">nu ubbay ne dere gidida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:9">ne ayfeso nuukko haa zaara.<verse eid="ISA 64:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 64:10" />Ne geeshsha katamati aykkoy baynda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:10">bazzo gidida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:10">Xiyoonakka aykkoy baynda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:10">bazzo biitta gidadus;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:10">Yerusalaameykka yegetta attadus.<verse eid="ISA 64:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 64:11" />Nu aawati kase nena</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:11">izan galatiza Xoossa Keeththay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:11">taman xuugettides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:11">kase lo7osoti ubbatikka dhayda.<verse eid="ISA 64:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 64:12" />Abeet GODAWU,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:12">hayssi ubbay haniinkka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:12">ne simmikii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:12">Neni co7u gaada nuna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:12">zaway baynda qixaate qaxxayay?<verse eid="ISA 64:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 64" />
  <chapter number="65" style="c" sid="ISA 65" />
  <para style="s1">Pirdanne Atoteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 65:1" />GODAY, «Tana woossonttaytas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:1">ta qonccadis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:1">tana koyonttaytas beettadis.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:1">Ta sunththaa xeygontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:1">kawoteththas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:1">‹Yee! Yee!› ga koyadis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">65:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 10:20">Oro 10:20</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 65:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 65:2" />Makkallanchcha deretas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:2">iita ogera bizaytas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:2">bantta wozina amo kaallizaytas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:2">ta kushe gallas kumeth miccadis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">65:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 10:21">Oro 10:21</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 65:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 65:3" />Atakiltesohon yarsho yarshizayti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:3">urqqafe medhettida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:3">yarshosohota bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:3">exaane cuwasizayti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:3">ubba wode tana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:3">hanqeththiza dereta.<verse eid="ISA 65:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 65:4" />Duufo giddon uttizayti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:4">geemasohon aqizayti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:4">guddunththa asho mizayti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:4">istti bantta otota tunida asho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:4">camba kunththizayta.<verse eid="ISA 65:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 65:5" />Istti, ‹Ta geesh gidida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:5">kichcha; ta mata yooppa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:5">taakko shiiqoppa› gizayta.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:5">Hayssa mala derey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:5">ta siidhen cuwa malanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:5">gallas kumeth eexxiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:5">tama mala.<verse eid="ISA 65:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 65:6" />«Be7ite, ta sinththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:6">xaafetti uttides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:6">ta co7u giikke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:6">gido attiin iza ooso ooso mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:6">ta izas immana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:6">istta hano mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:6">ta isttas ciggana.<verse eid="ISA 65:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 65:7" />Intte nagara halonne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:7">intte aawata nagara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:7">halo ta kessana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:7">Istti zumata bolla xuugettiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:7">yarsho shiishshida gishshas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:7">zumbullata bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:7">tana cayida gishshas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:7">istti makkida miishshan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:7">isttas zaari makettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:7">istti kase ooththida ooso kushe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:7">zaari ekkana» gees.<verse eid="ISA 65:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 65:8" />GODAY, «Woyne wurco giddon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:8">ililoy diza mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:8">asaykka, ‹Iza giddon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:8">lo7o miishshi diza gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:8">iza qanxxofte› giza mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:8">tanikka ta aylleta gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:8">gaada hessaththo ooththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:8">mulera tani istta dhayssike.<verse eid="ISA 65:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 65:9" />Tani Yaaqoobe zereththatappenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:9">Yuhuda zereththafe ta zumata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:9">laattanayta ta ehana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:9">doorettida ta derey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:9">istta laattana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:9">ta ashkaratikka heen daana.<verse eid="ISA 65:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 65:10" />Tana minththi koyza ta derezas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:10">Lasharooney dorsa wudey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:10">heemettizaso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:10">Akoore zulley wude mehey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:10">pe7izaso gidana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">65:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 7:24-25">Iya 7:24-25</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 65:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 65:11" />Gido attiin GODAA aggida inttes,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:11">ta geeshsha zumaa dogida inttes,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:11">‹Ta baso› geetettiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:11">eeqa xoossas soho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:11">giigsida inttes,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:11">‹Gaade› geetettiza eeqa xoossas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:11">walakettida woyne ushshu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:11">wancan kunththida inttes,<verse eid="ISA 65:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 65:12" />ta xeygiin zaarontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:12">ixxida gishshas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:12">ta yootiin siyontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:12">ixxida gishshas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:12">ta sinththankka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:12">iita ooththida gishshas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:12">tana hanqeththiza miish</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:12">intte doorida gishshas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:12">ta inttena mashshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:12">aaththa immana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:12">intte ubbayka shukettanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:12">qoodhe immana» gees.<verse eid="ISA 65:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 65:13" />Hessa gishshas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:13">Ubbaa Haariza GODAY,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:13">«Be7ite, ta ashkarati maana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:13">intte gidikko gafana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:13">ta ashkarati uyana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:13">intte gidikko saamettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:13">Ta ashkarati ufayettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:13">intte gidikko yeellatana.<verse eid="ISA 65:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 65:14" />Ta ashkarati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:14">wozinappe ufayssan yexxana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:14">intte gidikko wozinay meqqiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:14">intte waassana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:14">intte ayanay meqqida gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:14">intte woo woo giidi waassana.<verse eid="ISA 65:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 65:15" />Intte intte sunththaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:15">doorettida ta derey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:15">qanggana mala aaththi immana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:15">Ubbaa Haariza GODAY</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:15">inttena wodhana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:15">baas haggazizaytas gidikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:15">izi hara sunth immana.<verse eid="ISA 65:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 65:16" />Hessa gishshas biittay bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:16">anjjo koyzaadey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:16">tuma Xoossa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:16">sunththan anjjettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:16">biittayn caaqqiza asi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:16">tuma Xoossa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:16">sunththan caaqqana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:16">kase aadhdhida metoti dogettida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:16">ta ayfeppekka geemmida» gees.<verse eid="ISA 65:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ooraththa Medhetata</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 65:17" />GODAY, «Hekko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:17">tani ooraththa salotanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:17">ooraththa sa7a medhdhana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:17">kase aadhdhida miishshati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:17">qofettettennanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:17">hassa7ettettenna.<verse eid="ISA 65:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 65:18" />Gido attiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:18">tani medhdhizayssan ufayettite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:18">mernaas hombocite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:18">tani Yerusalaame ufayssas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:18">izi deraakka homboceththas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:18">medhdhana.<verse eid="ISA 65:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 65:19" />Tani Yerusalaamen ufayettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:19">tani ta derezan hombocana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:19">hayssafe guyen yeehoynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:19">waasoy heen seetettenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">65:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:4">Ajju 21:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 65:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 65:20" />Hayssafe guyen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:20">heen guuththa wodes</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:20">shemppora paxa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:20">daana yidhay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:20">woykko wode kallontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:20">cimay deenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:20">xeetu layth kumida asi hayqqiko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:20">wodey gakkontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:20">mulqqetti hayqqida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:20">asa mala qoodettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:20">asi xeetu layth</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:20">kumontta hayqqiko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:20">boshan hayqqida mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:20">qoodeettes.<verse eid="ISA 65:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 65:21" />He wode asay keeth keexxana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:21">izankka daana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:21">woyne mith tokkidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:21">iza ayfe maana.<verse eid="ISA 65:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 65:22" />Hayssafe guye hara asi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:22">izan daana keeth keexxettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:22">woykko haray maana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:22">miishshi tokettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:22">ta deraa layththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:22">miththa layththa mala aduqqana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:22">tani dooridayti bantta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:22">kushe ooson</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:22">adussa layth ufayettana.<verse eid="ISA 65:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 65:23" />Istta daaburay hada attenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:23">qaada iita naakka yelettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:23">isttinne istta zereththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:23">GODAY anjjida dere gidana.<verse eid="ISA 65:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 65:24" />Istti buro tana xeyganaappe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:24">kaseta tani koyana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:24">istti taas yooti wursontta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:24">ta siyana.<verse eid="ISA 65:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 65:25" />Kana suyteynne dorsa laaqqay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:25">issife maana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:25">gaammoy boora mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:25">maata maana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:25">shooshshi gudulla laaccana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:25">ta geeshsha zumaa bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:25">istti qohettettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:25">bashshika istta bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:25">yeenna» gees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">65:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:6-9">Isa 11:6-9</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 65:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 65" />
  <chapter number="66" style="c" sid="ISA 66" />
  <para style="s1">Pirdanne Hidota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 66:1" />GODAY, «Saloy taas araata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:1">sa7aykka taas yedhdhizaso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:1">histtiin intte taas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:1">keexxana keeththinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:1">ta shemppana soy awayssee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">66:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:34-35">Mato 5:34-35</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:22">23:22</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 66:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 66:2" />Hayta ubbaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:2">ta kushey ooththibeennee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:2">Hayti beettana mala ooththiday</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:2">tana gidikkinaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:2">Tani ashke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:2">wozinay meqqidaadenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:2">ta qaalaska kokkorizaadeko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:2">ta xeellays.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">66:1-2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:49-50">Hawa 7:49-50</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 66:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 66:3" />«Gido attiin taas boora yarshizaadey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:3">as wodhizaade mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:3">dorsa laaqqa yarshizaadey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:3">kana cuulli wodhiza asa mala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:3">kaththa yarsho shiishshizaadey,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:3">guddunththa suuth</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:3">shiishshizaade mala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:3">qofsos exaane taas cu7asizaadey,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:3">eeqa xoos goynniza asa mala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:3">istti bantta oge doorida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:3">istta shemppoyakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:3">istta tunateththan ufayettawus.<verse eid="ISA 66:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 66:4" />Hessa gishshas meto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:4">ta istta bolla gaththana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:4">istti yayyida miishshika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:4">ta istta bolla ehana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:4">gaasoykka ta xeygiza wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:4">istti koyibeettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:4">ta yootishin istti ezgibeettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:4">ta sinththan iita miish ooththida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:4">tana iitiza miish doorida» gees.<verse eid="ISA 66:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 66:5" />Intteno qaalaas kokkorizaytoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:5">hayssa GODAA qaala siyite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:5">«Intte ishantti inttena ixxidaytoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:5">ta sunththa gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:5">inttena kessi yeggidaytoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:5">Inttena, ‹Ane GODAY</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:5">bonchchettoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:5">Ane intte ufayssaaka be7oos› gida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:5">gidikkoka istti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:5">yeellatanayssi attenna.<verse eid="ISA 66:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 66:6" />Hessa kataman diza waasoza siyite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:6">Xoossa keeththan diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:6">caabba siyite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:6">hessika GODAA cenggurssa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:6">izi ba morkketas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:6">bessiza waaga qanxxana.<verse eid="ISA 66:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 66:7" />Miixattanaappe kaseta yelawus;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:7">miixa waaye be7ontta dashe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:7">attuma naa yelawus.<verse eid="ISA 66:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 66:8" />Hessa mala yo7o siyi erizay oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:8">Hessa mala yo7o</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:8">be7i erizay oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:8">Derey issi gallas medhetti erizee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:8">Woykko kawoteththati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:8">qiphida ayfey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:8">xeellanaashe gakkanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:8">beetti erizoo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:8">Xiyoono buro miixay oykkishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:8">heerakka ba nayta yelawus.<verse eid="ISA 66:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 66:9" />Yelettana matidayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:9">yelettontta mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:9">tani diggazinaa?» gees GODAY.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:9">«Yelishin yeliza ulo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:9">ta gorda erazinaa?»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:9">gees ne GODAY.<verse eid="ISA 66:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 66:10" />«Intteno Yerusalaamo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:10">siiqiza ubbatoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:10">izira ufayettite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:10">intte izira hombocite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:10">izis yeekkida ubbati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:10">izira keehi ufayettite.<verse eid="ISA 66:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 66:11" />Minththeththiza izi dhanththaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:11">intte dhammidi kallana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:11">inttes gidanaashe gakkanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:11">intte uyana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:11">keehippe daro gidida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:11">izi dureteththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:11">intte ufayettana» gees GODAY.<verse eid="ISA 66:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 66:12" />GODAY, «Be7ite,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:12">tani izis saroteth</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:12">gita shaafa mala gogisana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:12">kawoteththata aqota</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:12">shaafa haaththa mala gogisana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:12">intte izi ki7on</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:12">idimetti dhammana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:12">izi ki7on uttidi intte guppana.<verse eid="ISA 66:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 66:13" />Aaya ba naa al7isiza mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:13">takka inttena al7isana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:13">intte Yerusalaamen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:13">minettana» gees.<verse eid="ISA 66:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 66:14" />Intte hessa be7iza wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:14">intte wozinay ufayettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:14">intte meqeththaykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:14">maata mala cililana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:14">qasse GODAA kushey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:14">iza aylleta bolla dizayssi erettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:14">iza hanqoy gidikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:14">iza morkketa bolla qonccana.<verse eid="ISA 66:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 66:15" />Hekko GODAY tama lacon yaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:15">iza para-gaareti gote carko mala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:15">izi ba yiillo hanqon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:15">ba seera tama lacon qonccisana.<verse eid="ISA 66:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 66:16" />Tamaninne mashshan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:16">GODAY ba pirdaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:16">asa ubbaa bolla ehana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:16">daroti GODAA</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:16">mashshan shukettana.<verse eid="ISA 66:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 66:17" />GODAY, «Atakiltey dizasoho biidi isttafe issaas goynnanaas bana geeshshizaytinne dummasizayti, guddunththa ashonne ecere asho, tunida miishshata miza ubbati ba pirda wurseththan issife ekkana» gees.<verse eid="ISA 66:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 66:18" />«Tani istta oosonne istta qofa eriza gishshas, kawoteththata ubbaanne dumma dumma qaalan haasayza ubbata issife shiishshanaas yaana; isttika yiidi ta bonchcho be7ana. <verse eid="ISA 66:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 66:19" />Tani istta giddon malata ooththana; isttafe attida issi issineta gede kawoteththatakko, Tarseese, Puuxe, wondafen olettiza erettida Luudetakko, Tubaalenne Yaawaane hessaththoka ta goobateththaa siyonttaytakkonne ta bonchcho beyonttaytakko haakon diza abba giddon diza harurotakko ta yeddana; ta bonchcho kawoteththata giddon yootana. <verse eid="ISA 66:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 66:20" />GODAAS yarsho gidana mala intte ishata ubbata kawoteththatappe bonchchettida ta zumaa Yerusalaame paran, para-gaareninne gaaren, baquloninne gaamellan istta ehana. Isra7eele asay kaththa yarsho wogan diza mala geeshsha miishshan woththidi GODAA Keeth shiishshiza mala haytakka shiishshana. <verse eid="ISA 66:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 66:21" />Tanikka isttafe baggayta qeesetanne Leweta gidana mala ta doorana» gees.<verse eid="ISA 66:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 66:22" />GODAY, «Tani medhdhana ooraththa salotinne ooraththa sa7ay ta sinththan minni daanayssaththo intte sunththinne intte zereththa sunththi hessaththo minni daana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">66:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:17">Isa 65:17</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 3:13">2Phex 3:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:1">Ajju 21:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ISA 66:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 66:23" />Agina xeeroppe biidi hara aginay xeerana gakkanaas, issi Sambatappe biidi hara Sambata gakkanaas, as gidida ubbay taas goynnana yaana. <verse eid="ISA 66:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 66:24" />Istti kezidi ta bolla makkallida asata aha be7ana. Istta miza guxuneykka hayqqenna; istta miza tamaykka to7enna. Istti asa zereth ubbaas harassizaaz gidana» gees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">66:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 9:48">Mar 9:48</ref></char></note><verse eid="ISA 66:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 66" />
</usx>